hadiths[600]{hadithnumber,text}:
"601","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu as-sabbaaha ash-Shami ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdul-Aziz ash-Shami se, un ke walid se, Abu Ayyub se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Aey Abu Ayyub, Kya main tumhen aise sadqe ki rehnumai na karun jis se Allah aur us ke Rasulullah razi hon? Unhon ne kaha: Haan farmaya Aap ne farmaya: Tum logon ke darmiyan sulah karao jab woh apne mein bigad hon, aur unhen qareeb lao jab woh door hon"
"602","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah Ibn al-Mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, haivaha bin Shuraih se, Yazid Ibn Abi Habib se, Aslam Abu Imran at-tujiibii se, jo tujiiba ke aazad-karda the, unhon ne kaha: Ham kustuntuniyaa mein the, Fuzalah bin Ubaid al-Ansari Sham walon par aur Uqbah bin Amir al-Juhani Misr walon par ruumiyon ki bade saf hamare samne nikli, aur Musalmanon ki bade saf nikli, aur ek Musalman ne Rumi saf par hamla kiya aur mein qatl kiya, phir aaya logon ne shora macaayaa aur kaha: Subhanallah, Us ne apne hathon se apne ko halakat mein diya phir Abu Ayyub al-Ansari khade hue aur kaha: Aey logo, tum is aayat ki wahi us ke matlab ke siwa par karte ho yeh aayat hamare bare mein nazil hui, Ansar ki jama'at: Jab Allah Ta'ala ne apne deen ko mazboot kiya aur us ke madadgar badhae, to Ham ne apne mein kar, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se alag kaha: Hamara maal zaya hua hai, to agar ham us ke sath thaharen aur jo zaya hua hai use sanvaaren — phir Allah Ta'ala ne yeh aayat nazil ki, us ka jawab dete hue jo Ham ne apne dilon mein thaanaa tha, ke ham apne maal ke sath thaharen aur jo zaya hua hai use sanvaaren. halakat woh tha jo Ham ne karne ka irada kiya tha, aur hamen jang ka hukm diya gaya Abu Ayyub ne jang nahin chhodi yahan tak ke Allah Ta'ala ne unhen uthe"
"603","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Yazid Ibn Abi Habib se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne mujhe bayan kiya Jis ne Abu Ayyub ko suna tha ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Maghrib ki namaz rozedar ke iftar ke waqt padhte the, sitare ke nikalne se pahle jaldi karte hue"
"604","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Murrah ne mujhe khabar di, Abu al-Bakhtari ko Abu Sa'id se riwayat karte suni, unhon ne kaha: Jab yeh surat nazil hui, jab Allah ki madad aur fath aae, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ise padha yahan tak ke poora kiya, phir farmaya: Main aur mere sahaba ek jama'at hain, aur log doosri jama'at; fath ke baad koi hijrat nahin Abu Sa'id ne kaha: Main ne yeh hadees Marwan bin al-Hakam ko sunai — jo Madinah ke malik the — aur unhon ne kaha: Tum ne jhoot kaha, jabke Zaid bin Sabit aur Zaid bin Arqam un ke sath the main ne kaha: Yeh donon, agar chahte to tumhen bayan karte; lekin yeh darta hai ke tum us se sadqe ka ohadaa chheen lo, aur yeh darta hai ke tum us se us ki qaum ki saradaarii chheen lo Unhon ne mujh par lathi uthai, aur jab Unhon ne woh dekha to kaha: Us ne sach kaha"
"605","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib ne ham se bayan kiya, Dawud Ibn Abi Hind se, Abu nazaraa se, Abu Sa'id se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) wafat pae to Ansar ke khateeb khade hue, aur mein se kuch ne kaha: Aey Muhajireen ki jama'at, jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tum mein se aadmi bhejte to hamare mein se aadmi us ke sath jorate; to ham samajhte hain yeh muamla do aadmiyon ke paas hona chahiye, tum mein se ek aadmi aur ham mein se ek aadmi phir Zaid bin Sabit khade hue aur kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Muhajireen mein se the, aur ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke madadgar the to ameer sirf Muhajireen mein se hoga, aur ham us ke madadgar hain jaise ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke madadgar the Abu Bakr, Rahimahullah ne kaha: Allah tumhen jaza de, Aey Ansar ki jama'at, qabeela mein se bhalai se, aur woh tumhare khateeb ko Sabit kare Allah ki qasam, agar Tum ne is ke siwa kaha hota to ham tum sulah na karte"
"606","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, Zaid bin Sabit se, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath sahar khayi, phir namaz ke liye nikle"
"607","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Imran al-Qattan ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Anas se, Zaid bin Sabit se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Yaman ki taraf dekha aur farmaya: Aey Allah, un ke dil hamari taraf phera. phir Sham ki taraf dekha aur farmaya: Aey Allah, un ke dil hamari taraf phera. phir Iraq ki taraf dekha aur farmaya: Aey Allah, un ke dil hamari taraf pher, aur hamare sa' aur mudd mein hamare liye barkat de"
"608","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Sabit ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid Sabit se, unhon ne kaha: Main Anas ke sath chala, aur woh chhote qadam lene lage unhon ne kaha: Aey Sabit, tum mujh se kyun nahin poochte ke main tumhare sath aisa kyun karta hun? Main ne kaha: Aur tum aisa kyun karte ho? Unhon ne kaha: Main Zaid bin Sabit ke sath chala, aur Unhon ne mere sath waisa hi kiya, aur kaha: Tum mujh se kyun nahin poochte ke main tumhare sath aisa kyun karta hun? To Main ne un se poocha, aur Zaid ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mere sath waisa hi kiya, aur mujh se farmaya: Aey Zaid, Kya tum jante ho main tumhare sath aisa kyun karta hun? Main ne kaha: Aur Aap ne aisa kyun kiya? Aap ne farmaya: Main chahta tha ke masjid ki taraf hamare qadam bahut hon"
"609","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Adi bin Sabit se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah bin Yazid al-Ansari ko Zaid bin Sabit se riwayat karte suna, ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Uhud ki taraf nikle to un ke sath walon mein se ek giroh wapas gaya Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba un ke bare mein do jamaaton mein banta gae: Ek jama'at kehti thi, ham unhen qatl karte hain, aur ek jama'at kehti thi, nahin phir yeh aayat nazil hui: Tumhen Kya hua ke tum Munafiqon ke bare mein do jamaaaten ho, jabke Allah ne unhen un ke kamaae se bartan kar diya — poori aayat"
"610","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Adi bin Sabit se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah bin Yazid al-Ansari ko Zaid bin Sabit se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh Taibah (Madinah) hai, aur woh apni gandagi nikalti hai jaise aag chandi ki mail nikalti hai"
"611","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: Ubaid bin as-Sabbaq ne mujhe khabar di ke Zaid bin Sabit ne unhen bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Bakr, Raziyallahu anhu ne Yamama walon ke qatl ke waqt mujhe bulwaya, aur Umar bin al-Khattab, Raziyallahu anhu un ke sath the unhon ne kaha: Yeh mere paas aaya aur mujhe khabar di ke qatl Quran ke qariyon par bhaari pada hai — ya'ni Yamama ke din — aur mujhe dar hai ke qatl doosre maidaanon mein Quran ke qariyon par bhaari jae, to Quran jayega Main ne faisla kiya hai ke tum use jama karo main ne kaha: Tum woh kaise karte ho jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne nahin kiya? Allah ki qasam, agar woh mujh par pahadon mein se pahaad nikalne ka bojh dalte to woh mujhe us se zyada pasandeeda hota jo Unhon ne mujh par diya"
"612","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: Kharijah bin Zaid ne mujhe khabar di, Zaid bin Sabit se, unhon ne kaha: Main ek aayat raghbat baitha jise main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko padhte sunta tha, to Main ne use talash kiya aur use Khuzaimah bin Sabit ke paas paya: Mu'minon mein aadmi hain jo Allah se kiye ahd mein sachche rahe — to Main ne use us ki surat mein joraa."
"613","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdur Rahman Ibn Abi az-Zinad ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Kharijah bin Zaid se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Yeh maal hara aur meetha hai, to phal na becho yahan tak ke un ka pakna zahir ho"
"614","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se: Ubaid bin as-Sabbaq ne ham se bayan kiya ke Zaid bin Sabit ne unhen bayan kiya, kehte hue: Main ek aayat raghbat baitha jise main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko padhte sunta tha, to Main ne use talash kiya aur use Khuzaimah bin Sabit ke paas paya: Tumhare paas tum mein se Rasulullah aaya hai — aayat — to Main ne use us ki surat mein joraa."
"615","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Qais bin ar-Rabi ne ham se bayan kiya, ar-rukaina bin ar-Rabi se, al-Qasim bin Hassan se, unhon ne kaha: Vadiiata al-Ansari ne mujhe Zaid bin Sabit ke paas Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki Khawf ki namaz ke bare mein poochne bheja main un ke paas aaya aur un se poocha, aur Unhon ne bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne sahaba ke sath namaz padhi aur unhen taqseem: Ek giroh apne dushman ke samne, aur ek giroh un ke saamane. Aap ne apne han walon ke sath ek rak'at padhi, phir woh apne bhaiyon ki safon mein gae, phir doosre aae aur Aap ne un ke sath ek rak'at padhi to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki do rak'aten huin, aur logon ki ek-ek rakaata."
"616","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Yazid bin Abdullah bin Qusait se, Ata bin Yasar se, Zaid bin Sabit se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne an-Najm padhi, aur Aap ne us mein sajdah na kiya"
"617","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Yunus bin Jubair ko Kaseer bin as-Salt se riwayat karte suna, ke woh Zaid bin Sabit ke sath masaahifa likh rahe the, aur is aayat par aaye Zaid bin Sabit ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Buddha aadmi aur budhi aurat, jab woh zina karen to unhen pakka rajm karo, Allah aur us ke Rasulullah ki taraf se rok ke taur par"
"618","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Umar bin Sulaiman se, Abdur Rahman bin Aban se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Zaid bin Sabit ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Teen cheezen jin ke par Musalman ka dil khayanat nahin rakhta: Allah Ta'ala ke liye amal mein khalis, hukkaama ko khairkhwahi, aur jama'at se cimatanaa; kyunke un ki dua un ke peeche walon ko ghere hai"
"619","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Umar bin Sulaiman se, Abdur Rahman bin Aban se, un ke walid se, Zaid bin Sabit se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo duniya ko apni niyyat banae, Allah Ta'ala us ka muamla us par bikhera deta hai, us ki mufalisii us ki aankhon ke samne rakhta hai, aur duniya mein se us ke paas kuch nahin aata siwae us ke jo us ke liye likha gaya aur jo aakhirat ko apni niyyat banae, Allah Ta'ala us ki ghina us ke dil mein rakhta hai, us ka muamla us ke liye jama karta hai, aur duniya us ke paas zaleel kar aati hai"
"620","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Umar bin Sulaiman se, Abdur Rahman bin Aban se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Zaid bin Sabit ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Allah us aadmi ko tarotaazaa kare jo ham se hadees sune, use yaad kare aur pahunchaye; kyunke bahut samajh ke taraf use us tak pahunchate hain jo us se zyada samajh wala ho, aur bahut samajh ke taraf nafs samajh wale nahin hote"
"621","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Sahl bin Sulaiman ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id bin Sinan se, bin Woh-dailaamii se, unhon ne kaha: Main Zaid bin Sabit ke paas aaya, aur unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Agar Allah Ta'ala apne aasmanon walon aur apni zameen walon ko azab deta to unhen baghair zulm kiye azab deta; aur agar un par raham karta to us ki rehmat un ke liye un ke aamal se behtar hoti agar tumhare paas Uhud jaisa Sona hota aur tum use Allah ke raste mein kharch karte to woh tum qabool na hota yahan tak ke taqdeer par iman lao, tamam, us ki bhalai aur burayi; aur agar tum is ke siwa par mare to aag mein dakhil hoge is tarah Abu Dawud ne kaha, jabke log Ise Sa'id bin Sinan se, Wahb bin Khalid se, bin Woh-dailaamii se riwayat karte hain"
"622","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin dinar se, Tawus se, Hujr al-madaarii se, Zaid bin Sabit se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Umrah ka hadiya waris ka hai — ya unhon ne kaha: Us ka rasta wirasat ke raste jaisa hai"
"623","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, Abdullah Ibn Abi Qatadah se, un ke walid se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se ek baitul-khala aae to apne daayen hath se istinja na kare, na apne satar ko daayen hath se kare"
"624","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer ne mujhe likha, mujhe Abdullah Ibn Abi Qatadah se, un ke walid se bayan karte hue, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab namaz ki azan di jae to khade na ho yahan tak ke mujhe dekho"
"625","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibn al-Mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, Ma'mar se, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, Abdullah Ibn Abi Qatadah se, un ke walid se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab namaz qayam ki jae to khade na ho yahan tak ke dekho ke main aaya hun"
"626","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, Abdullah Ibn Abi Qatadah se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khajoor aur kishmish ki nabeez milaakara na banao; mein se har ek ki alag-alag nabeez banao"
"627","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, Abdullah Ibn Abi Qatadah se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) bartan mein saans lete the — ya teen martaba saans lete the"
"628","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, Abdullah Ibn Abi Qatadah se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Zuhr aur Asr ki namazon ki pehli do rak'aton mein padhte the, hamen kabhi-kabhi aayat sunate hue; pehli rak'at lambi karte aur doosri chhoti, aur Maghrib ki namaz ki do rak'aton mein padhte the"
"629","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id al-Maqburi se, Abdullah Ibn Abi Qatadah se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khutba diya aur jihad ka zikr kiya, farz namaz ke siwa us par kisi ko fazeelat na dete hue"
"630","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id al-Maqburi se, Abdullah Ibn Abi Qatadah se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi khada hua aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mujhe batao, agar main Allah ke raste mein qatl kiya jaun to main kahan aur? Aap ne farmaya: Agar tum Allah ke raste mein qatl kiye jao, sabr, ajr sunane wale, aage badhte hue peeche na hote hue, to tum jannat mein ho phir woh khamosh hue, aur Ham ne dekha ke Aap par Wahy utar rahi thi phir farmaya: Woh aadmi kahan hai? Unhon ne kaha: Main hazir hun Aap ne farmaya: Siwae is ke ke us par qarz ho, kyunke woh us se liya jaega; is tarah Jibreel, Alaihissalam ne da'wa kiya"
"631","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abdullah Ibn Abi Qatadah al-Ansari se, un ke walid se, ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas janaza laya jata to Aap us ke bare mein puuchate. agar us ki bhalai se tareef ki jati to us par namaz padhte; aur agar us ki burayi se baat ki jati to us ke walon se kehte: Use nafs sanbhaalo, aur us par namaz na padhte"
"632","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Salih Ibn Abi Hassan se, Abdullah Ibn Abi Qatadah se, un ke walid se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen jaasuusa bana bheja jabke un ke sahaba ehram mein the aur woh nahin the unhon ne kaha: Ham ne li gadha dekha, to Main ne un se koraa qarz manga; Unhon ne qarz dene se inkar kiya, to Main ne mein se ek se chheeni aur use mara aur qatl kiya Unhon ne mere sath khane se inkar kiya, to woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Ham ne kuch kiya aur nahin jante woh Kya hai Unhon ne unhen khabar di, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khao, aur hamen khilaao."
"633","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, Abdullah Ibn Abi Qatadah se, un ke walid se, ke woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Hudaibiyah ke saal mein nikle mere sathi ehram mein dakhil hue aur main nahin hua Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aage ho, aur main apne sahaba ke sath tha; mein se kuch doosron par chamakne lage Main ne dekha, aur wahan li gadha tha Main ne us par hamla kiya, use bhedaa aur dabocaa. Main ne un ki madad mangi, aur Unhon ne meri madad se inkar kiya Ham ne us mein se khaya, aur mujhe dar hua ke meri qaum kat jaegi, to Main ne apna ghoda dauraayaa Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko talash karte hue main raat ke ghora andhera mein Ghifar ke ek aadmi se mila aur kaha: Tum ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko kahan chhoda? Unhon ne kaha: As-Suqya mein main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, tumhare sahaba tumhen salam aur Allah ki rehmat pahunchate hain, aur unhen dar hua ke woh tumhare baghair kat jaenge, to un ka intezar karo, Aey Allah ke farmaya main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Main ne li gadha mara, aur mere paas us mein se kuch bacha hai Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne logon se farmaya: Khao — jabke woh ehram mein the"
"634","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya: Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah Ibn Abi Qatadah se, Abu Qatadah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Zuhr ki namaz ki pehli do rak'aton mein Fatiha aur do suraten padhte the, hamen aayat sunate hue; pehli rak'at lambi karte doosri mein lambi se zyada, aur aakhri do mein faatihaa. aur hamare sath Fajr ki namaz mein padhte the, pehli rak'at lambi karte doosri mein lambi se zyada"
"635","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Malik bin Anas ne ham se bayan kiya, Amir bin Abdullah bin az-Zubair se, Amr bin Sulaim az-Zurqi se, Abu Qatadah se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se ek masjid mein dakhil ho to baithne se pahle do rak'aten padhe"
"636","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abd Rabbihi bin Sa'id al-Ansari se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman ko kehte suna: Main khwab dekhta tha jo mujhe beemar karta, to Main ne is ka zikr Abu Qatadah se kiya unhon ne kaha: Main bhi khwab dekhta tha jo mujhe beemar karta, yahan tak ke Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Nek khwab Allah ki taraf se hai jab tum mein se ek woh dekhe jo use pasand ho to use sirf us se bayan kare jise woh pasand karta ho aur jab woh dekhe jo use napasand ho to jaagane par apne baayen teen martaba thooke, us ke sharr aur shaitan ke sharr se Allah ki panah mange, aur kisi ko us ki khabar na de; kyunke woh use nuqsan nahin dega"
"637","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Ghailan se, Abdullah bin Ma'bad az-zimmaanii se, Abu Qatadah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Aashura ke roze ke bare mein farmaya: Main waqaee Allah Ta'ala se ummeed karta hun ke woh saal ka kaffara kare aur Arafah ke din ke roze ke bare mein farmaya: Main waqaee Allah se ummeed karta hun ke woh us se pahle ke saal aur us ke baad ke saal ka kaffara kare"
"638","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Hammad bin Zaid, Hisham aur mahadii ne ham se bayan kiya — Hammad aur mahadii ne kaha: Ghailan bin Jarir se, aur Hisham ne kaha: Qatadah se, Ghailan se — Abdullah bin Ma'bad az-zimmaanii se, Abu Qatadah se, ke ek dehati ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se un ke roze ke bare mein poocha, aur woh gusse hue yahan tak ke un ke chehre mein dekha gaya Umar bin al-Khattab, Raziyallahu anhu khade hue aur kaha: Ham Allah se Rabb ke taur par, Islam se deen ke taur par, aur tum Nabi ke taur par razi hain main Allah ke gusse aur us ke Rasulullah ke gusse se Allah ki panah mangta hun Umar use kehte rahe yahan tak ke woh shaanta hue unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, tum us aadmi ke bare mein Kya kehte ho jo saal bhar roza rakhe? Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us ne na roza rakha na iftar kiya — ya unhon ne kaha: Us ne na roza rakha na Us ne iftar kiya unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, us ka Kya jo do din roza rakhe aur ek din iftar kare? Aap ne farmaya: Aur us ki taqat kaun rakh sakta hai? Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, us ka Kya jo do din iftar kare aur ek din roza rakhe? Aap ne farmaya: Kaash mujhe us ke liye taqat di jati unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, tum Peer ke roze ke bare mein Kya kehte ho? Aap ne farmaya: Woh din hai jis mein main paida hua, aur jis mein mujh par Wahy utari gayi unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, tum us aadmi ke bare mein Kya kehte ho jo ek din roza rakhe aur ek din iftar kare? Aap ne farmaya: Woh mere bhai Dawud ka roza hai unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, tum Aashura ke din ke roze ke bare mein Kya kehte ho? Aap ne farmaya: Main waqaee Allah se ummeed karta hun ke woh saal ka kaffara kare unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, tum Arafah ke din ke roze ke bare mein Kya kehte ho? Aap ne farmaya: Main waqaee Allah Ta'ala se ummeed karta hun ke woh us se pahle ke saal aur us ke baad ke saal ka kaffara kare"
"639","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhaib ne ham se bayan kiya, Dawud Ibn Abi Hind se, Abu nazaraa se, Abu Sa'id al-Khudri se, ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Khandaq khodii to log ek-ek iinta uthate the, jabke Ammar, jo beemari se beemar the, do-do eentein uthate the Abu Sa'id ne kaha: Mere sahaba ne mujhe bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne sar se mitti jhadte the, farmate hue: Afsos tum par, Aey sumayyaa ke bete, baghi giroh tumhein qatl karega yeh hadees Abu nazaraa se, Abu Sa'id se, Abu Qatadah se bhi riwayat ki gayi"
"640","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah Ibn al-Mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Uqbah al-Hazrami se, ulaiya bin Rabah se, Abu Qatadah al-Ansari se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ghodon mein behtareen kala hai jis ki peshani aur oopri honth par safedi ho, gaharaa kala, safed taangon wala, dayan taraf aazad; aur agar gaharaa kala na ho to is rang ka gaharaa bhuuraa."
"641","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin dirham al-Azdi ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ka'b bin Abdur Rahman al-Azdi ne mujhe bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Qatadah al-Ansari se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare paas aae jabke ham masjid bana rahe the, aur farmaya: Use kushada karo aur tum use bharoge."
"642","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Fulaih bin Sulaiman ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amir bin Abdullah bin az-Zubair ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Sulaim az-Zurqi se, Abu Qatadah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) logon ko namaz padhate the — ya'ni logon ko — jabke Umamah, Abu al-Aas ki beti ko apni gardan par uthae hue jab ruku karte to use utarte, aur jab uthte to use uthate"
"643","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail Ibn Abi Khalid ne mujhe khabar di, Qais Ibn Abi Hazim se, Abu Mas'ud al-Badri se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main falan ke peeche namaz padhta hun, aur woh namaz lambi karta hai yahan tak ke main kabhi der karta hun unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) gusse hue, aisa gussa jaisa Main ne nasihat mein kabhi nahin dekha, phir farmaya: Tum mein aise hain jo logon ko door bhagaate hain jo logon ko namaz parhe, woh un ke liye namaz halki kare; kyunke mein kamzor, buddha aur haajatamanda hai"
"644","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Wa'il ko Abu Mas'ud al-Badri se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Ham mein se ek aadmi jis ka upanaama Abu Shu'aib tha Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye khana tayyar kiya, aur kaha: Aao, tum aur tumhare sath Paanch Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum mujhe chathe ki ijazat dete ho?"
"645","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sulaiman al-A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Wa'il ko Abu Mas'ud al-Badri se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Ham kharch par bojh uthate the, aur aadmi bada Sadqa lekar aata aur dikhaavebaaza kehlate, aur aadmi aadha sa' lekar deta phir yeh aayat nazil hui: Jo naflii dene wale mu'minon par sadqon mein aib lagate hain — us ke qaul dardnak azab tak"
"646","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya: Al-A'mash ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Amr ash-Shaibani ko Abu Mas'ud al-Badri se riwayat karte suna, ke ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas nakela wali untni sadqe ke taur par lekar aaya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Qayamat ke din tumhare liye us ke badle saat sau nakela wali untniyan hain"
"647","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Amr ash-Shaibani ko Abu Mas'ud se riwayat karte suna, ke ek aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Mujhe sawari do, kyunke mera janwar toot gaya hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Falan ke paas jao aur us se mango woh us ke paas gaya aur us se manga, aur Us ne use sawari di Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo bhalai ki rehnumai kare use us ke karne wale ke ajr jaisa hai — ya unhon ne kaha: Us ke kaam karne wale ke"
"648","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Umarah bin Umair ko Abu Ma'mar al-Azdi se, Abu Mas'ud al-Badri se riwayat karte suna, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us aadmi ki namaz kafi nahin jo ruku aur sajde mein apni reedh — ya unhon ne kaha: Apni peeth — seedhi na kare"
"649","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, Umarah bin Umair se, Abu Ma'mar se, Abu Mas'ud al-Badri se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare kandhe seedhe karte the — ya'ni namaz mein — farmate hue: Seedhe khade ho, aur ikhtilaf na karo, kahin tumhare dil ikhtilaf na karen; aur samajh aur aql wale mujh se qareeb hon, phir un ke thaile wale, phir un ke thaile len Abu Mas'ud ne kaha: Aaj tum kahin zyada ikhtilaf karte ho"
"650","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash aur Mansoor se, Ibrahim se, Abdur Rahman bin Yazid se, Abu Mas'ud al-Badri se, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe un se ek hadees pahunchee, to main un se mila jabke woh Baitullah ka tawaf kar rahe the aur un se poocha Unhon ne mujhe bayan kiya ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo raat mein Surah-Baqarah ki aakhri do aayaat padhe, woh use kafi hain"
"651","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Adi bin Sabit se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah bin Yazid ko Abu Mas'ud al-Badri se riwayat karte suna, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab aadmi apne gharwalon par kharch kare, us par ajr chahte hue, to woh us ke liye Sadqa hai unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se? Unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se"
"652","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Hammad se, Ibrahim se, Abu Abdullah al-Jadali se, Abu Mas'ud al-Badri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) raat ke shuru, us ke darmiyan aur us ke aakhir mein witr padhte the"
"653","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Qais se, Amr bin Maimun se, Abu Mas'ud se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum mein se koi har raat Quran ka tihai padhne ki taqat nahin rakh sakta? Ham ne kaha: Aur us ki taqat kaun rakh sakta hai, Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Woh Allah hai, ek — Quran ka tihai hai"
"654","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ismail bin Raja az-zubaidii se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Aws bin damaaja ko Abu Mas'ud al-Badri se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Logon ko mein Allah ki Kitab ki tilawat mein sab aage aur tilawat mein sab pahle parhaae. agar tilawat mein barabar hon to mein hijrat mein sab pahle; agar hijrat mein barabar hon to umar mein sab baraa. kisi aadmi ko us ke ghar ya us ki saltanat mein imamat na karao, aur us ki izzat ki jagah par na baitho siwae us ki ijazat se — ya unhon ne kaha: Siwae is ke ke woh tumhen ijazat de"
"655","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Habib Ibn Abi Sabit se, al-Qasim bin Ubaidullah se, Abdullah bin Utbah bin Mas'ud se, Abu Mas'ud al-Badri se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath ek ghar mein dakhil hue, aur Aap ne farmaya: Yeh saltanat tumhare darmiyan rahegi, aur tum us ke hakim, jab tak nae kaam na karo jab tum unhen karoge to Allah Ta'ala tum par apni makhlooq mein se badtareen musallat karega, aur woh tumhen chiilenge jaise lakdi chiilii jati hai Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ya'ni taraashii jaise lakdi taraashii jati hai"
"656","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata bin as-Sa'ib se, Salim al-barraada se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Mas'ud ne hamen kaha: Kya main tumhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki namaz na padhaunga? Ham ne kaha: Haan farmaya unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne hamen chaar rak'aten padhain, Zuhr ya Asr ki namaz, apne hath apne ghutnon par rakhte hue aur apni ungliyan phailate hue phir sar uthaya aur seedhe khade hue yahan tak ke un ka har hissa thehar gaya Unhon ne aisa kiya yahan tak ke apni namaz poori ki phir kaha: Aisi thi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki namaz"
"657","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, Rib'i bin Hirash se, Abu Mas'ud al-Badri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Pehli nubuwwat ke kalimaat mein se jo logon ko mila: Jab tumhen haya na aae to jo chaho karo"
"658","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Ubaidullah Ibn Abi Yazid se, Ibn Abbas se, Usamah bin Zaid se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sood sirf qarz mein hai"
"659","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdur Rahman bin Mihran se, unhon ne kaha: Umair, Ibn Abbas ke aazad-karda ne mujhe bayan kiya, Usamah bin Zaid se, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas Ka'ba mein dakhil hua, aur Aap ne tasweeren dekheen Aap ne pani ki baaltii mangavaaii, main Aap paas laya, aur Aap unhen mitaane lage, farmate hue: Allah us qaum ko halaak kare jo woh banae jo woh paida nahin karte"
"660","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Hisham bin Urwah se, un ke walid se, Usamah bin Zaid se, ke woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath ifaza kiye, aur woh halki raftaara se chalte the; jab kisi kushaada jagah aate to tez hote"
"661","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Salih Ibn Abi al-akhazara ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Urwah bin az-Zubair se, Usamah se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe subah Ubna par hamla karne aur jalaane ka hukm diya"
"662","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Khalid bin Abdullah al-Wasiti ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata bin as-Sa'ib se, Abu Abdur Rahman as-Sulami se, Usamah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne ek aadmi par hamla kiya aur us ne kaha: Allah ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin, to Main ne us mein talwar ghonpii aur use qatl kiya Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Aey Usamah, tum qayamat ke din Allah ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin ka Kya karoge? Aap ne Ise Kayeen martaba dohraya yahan tak ke Main ne chaha ke Main ne us ghadi ke siwa Islam na magar hota"
"663","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Haris bin Abdur Rahman se, apne mamu, Kuraib se, Usamah bin Zaid se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko ghamgin dekha, aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, tumhen Kya hua? Aap ne farmaya: Jibreel ne mujh se wa'da kiya tha aur Main ne use teen din se nahin dekha ek kutta zahir hua, gharon mein se ek se nikalta hua, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use qatl ka hukm diya phir Jibreel zahir hue, aur Aap ne kaha: Aey Jibreel, jab tum mujh se wa'da karte the to mere paas aate the, to ab tumhen Kya hua? Unhon ne kaha: Ham kisi ghar mein dakhil nahin hote jis mein kutta ya tasweeren hon"
"664","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, az-zibriqaana se, Zuhrah se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Zaid bin Sabit ke sath baithe the, aur Unhon ne Usamah bin Zaid ke paas darmiyan ki namaz ke bare mein poochte hue bheja unhon ne kaha: Woh Zuhr ki namaz hai; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) use dopehar ki garmi mein padhte the"
"665","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Shu'bah se, jo Ibn Abbas ke aazad-karda the, Ibn Abbas se, Usamah bin Zaid se, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke peeche Arafah se Muzdalifah tak sawar hua Aap pahaarii raste par aae, utre, pani bahaye, phir namaz na padhi yahan tak ke Muzdalifah aaye"
"666","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Habib Ibn Abi Sabit se, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Amir bin Sa'd se pahunchi, jise main nahin mila; main Ibrahim bin Sa'd se mila aur un se poocha, aur Unhon ne mujhe khabar di ke Unhon ne Usamah bin Zaid ko Sa'd se bayan karte suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne taoon ke bare mein farmaya: Jab woh kisi zameen mein jae aur tum us mein ho to use na chhodo; aur jab woh kisi zameen mein ho aur tum us mein na ho to us mein dakhil na ho"
"667","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin budaila ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Ali bin Husain se, Amr bin Usman se, Usamah bin Zaid se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kafir Musalman se wirasat nahin leta, na Musalman kafir se"
"668","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, ke Umar bin al-Hakam bin Sauban ne unhen bayan kiya ke Qudamah bin Maz'un ke aazad-karda ne unhen bayan kiya ke Usamah bin Zaid ke aazad-karda ne unhen bayan kiya ke Usamah bin Zaid wadi al-quraa mein jaayadaada ki taraf sawar hote the, Peer aur Jumairat ke roze rakhte hue Main ne un se kaha: Kya tum roza rakhte ho halanke tum boodhe aur dubale ho gae ho? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Peer aur Jumairat ke roze rakhte dekha, to main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya tum Peer aur Jumairat ke roze rakhte ho? Aap ne farmaya: Amal Peer aur Jumairat ko pesh kiye jate hain"
"669","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: Iyadh, Usamah ke susara ne mujhe bayan kiya, Usamah se, ke ek aadmi dehat se aaya, beemari ne use pakda, aur woh aaya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe ummeed hai us ka darraa ham se na cuukegaa — ya'ni Madinah ka darraa."
"670","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Umar Ibn Abi Salamah se, un ke walid se, Usamah se, unhon ne kaha: Main Ali aur al-Abbas ke paas se guzra jabke woh masjid mein baithe the, aur unhon ne kaha: Aey Usamah, hamare liye Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se ijazat mango main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, yahan Ali aur al-Abbas ijazat mang rahe hain Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum jante ho unhen Kya laya? Main ne kaha: Nahin, Allah ki qasam, main nahin jaanta Aap ne farmaya: Lekin main janta hun unhen Kya laya Aap ne unhen ijazat di, woh dakhil hue, salam kiya, phir baithe aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, tumhare gharwalon mein se tumhen kaun sab pasandeeda hai? Aap ne farmaya: Fatimah, Muhammad ki beti"
"671","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, wasallam bin Shaddad se, Kulsoom al-hain se, Usamah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us beemari mein farmaya jis mein woh wafat pae: Mere sahaba ko mere paas aao woh un ke paas dakhil hue jabke woh mafarii chadar mein baith the, aur farmaya: Allah Yahud par lanat kare; Unhon ne apne ambiya ki qabron ko masajid banaya"
"672","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, azaraa se, ash-Sha'bi se, unhon ne kaha: Usamah bin Zaid ne mujhe bayan kiya ke woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Arafah se ifaza kiye, aur un ki sawari ne subah agli paon na uthaya yahan tak ke Muzdalifah aaye"
"673","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah, Sabit Abu Zaid aur doosron ne ham se bayan kiya, sab Asim bin Sulaiman se, Abu Usman an-Nahdi se, Usamah bin Zaid se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki beti ne unhen bheja ke us ka beta mar raha hai aur woh chahti hai ke woh us ke paas aaye Aap ne salam diya, farmate hue: Allah ka hai jo woh leta hai aur jo woh deta hai, aur us ke paas har cheez muqarrar muddat ke liye hai; woh sabr kare aur ajr chahe Us ne qasid ko diya, qasam dete hue ke woh zaroor aaye Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khade hue, Mu'az bin Jabal, Sa'd aur Ubayy bin Ka'b un ke sath the bachcha Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas uthaya gaya jabke us ki jaan us ke seene mein kharakharaa rahi thi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki aankhen beh pariin, aur Sa'd ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, yeh Kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Yeh rehmat hai jo Allah apne bandon mein se jis ke dilon mein chahta hai rakhta hai; aur Allah Ta'ala sirf apne bandon mein raham karne walon par raham karta hai"
"674","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Ubaidullah se, Ammar bin Yasir se, unhon ne kaha: A'ishah ka haar, Kaaba ke Aqiq ka, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke safaron mein se ek mein raghbat gaya, aur A'ishah us safar mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath thin A'ishah ne apna haar talash kiya yahan tak ke raat andherii hui Abu Bakr aae, un par gusse hue, aur kaha: Tum ne logon ko baghair pani ki jagah rok rakha phir pak mitti ki aayat nazil hui Abu Bakr aae aur kaha: Tum, Allah ki qasam, Aey meri beti — jahan tak main janta tha — mubarak ho Ubaidullah ne kaha: Ammar bayan karte the ke us din logon ne apni hathlion se zameen ponchanaa shuru kiya, un se apne chehre ponchhte hue, phir usi doosri cota marte hue, un se apne hath kandhon aur baghlon tak ponchhte hue, phir namaz padhte hue Muhammad bin Ishaq ne yeh hadees Zuhri se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah se, Ibn Abbas se, Ammar se riwayat ki"
"675","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hakam se, Zarr bin Abdullah ko bin Abdur Rahman bin Abza se, un ke walid se riwayat karte suni, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Umar ke paas aaya aur zikr kiya ke woh safar mein tha, junubi hua, aur pani na paya unhon ne kaha: Woh namaz na padhe Ammar ne kaha: Kya tumhen yaad nahin, Aey Ameerul-Mu'minin, jab tum aur main dastay mein the aur junubi hue aur pani na paya? Jahan tak tumhara miskeen hai, Tum ne namaz na padhi; jahan tak mera miskeen hai, Main ne mitti mein uthaya aur namaz padhi jab ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae to Ham ne is ka zikr Aap se kiya Aap ne tum farmaya: Jahan tak tumhara miskeen hai, tumhen namaz nahin choranii chahiye thi; aur jahan tak tumhara miskeen hai, Aey Ammar, tumhen janwar ki tarah nahin lotanaa chahiye tha tumhen kafi hota — aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne hath se zameen par mitti lagai, phir is tarah kaha, us mein phoonka, aur apna chehra aur apne hath jod tak ponchhe — aur us mein kalaiyon ka zikr nahin hai"
"676","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Salamah bin Kuhail se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Zarr ko bin Abdur Rahman bin Abza se, un ke walid se riwayat karte suna, ke ek aadmi Umar ke paas aaya — aur Unhon ne usi jaisi baat zikr ki"
"677","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, main se, Ammar bin Yasir se, unhon ne kaha: Main oonton ke darmiyan junubi hua aur pani na paya, to main janwar ki tarah lotaa. phir main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur is ka zikr Aap se kiya Aap ne farmaya: Tayammum tumhen kafi hota"
"678","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid se, Salamah bin Muhammad se, Ammar bin Yasir se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, jinhon farmaya: Fitrat kulli karna, naak mein pani carhaanaa, miswak, moonchh kaatna, nakhun qat, thaile ke baal ukhedna, zer-istidad mundna, istinja ke baad dhonaa, khatanaa, aur ungliyon ke jod dhonaa hai"
"679","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sahl bin Hunaif ke gharane ke ek aadmi ne mujhe bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Ammar se, Ammar se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi behaya dallal jannat mein dakhil nahin hota"
"680","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Murrah ne mujhe khabar di, Abdullah bin Salamah ko kehte suni: Main ne Ammar bin Yasir ko Siffeen ke din dekha, boodhe saanvle aadmi, un ke hath mein bhala tha jo kaanpta tha Unhon ne Amr bin al-Aas ki taraf dekha, jin ke hath mein jhanda tha, aur kaha: Yeh waqaee jhanda hai jis ke sath Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath teen martaba jang ki Allah ki qasam, agar woh hamen marte yahan tak ke hamen Hajar ki khajoor ki daaliyon tak le aate, to main janta ke islah ka hamara giroh haq par hai aur woh gumrahi par"
"681","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek ne ham se bayan kiya, ar-rukaina bin ar-Rabi se, Husain bin Qabeesah se, Ammar bin Yasir se — Nabi se marfu' — unhon ne kaha: Duniya mein do munh wala qayamat ke din aag mein do munh wala hoga Abu Nu'aim aur doosron ne yeh hadees Shareek se, ar-rukaina se, Nu'aim bin Hanzhalah se, Ammar se riwayat ki"
"682","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan bin Uyainah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdul-Karim se, Hassan bin Bilal se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ammar ko wuzu karte dekha, apni dadhi mein ungliyan pherte hue, aur kehte hue: Is tarah Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko karte dekha"
"683","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata al-khuraasaanii se, Yahya bin Ya'mur se, Ammar bin Yasir se, unhon ne kaha: Main safar se apne gharwalon ke paas aaya aur Unhon ne mujhe za'fran kiya subah main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur unhen salam kiya, lekin Unhon ne mera aamdeed na kiya na mujh par muskuraye, farmate hue: Jao aur yeh apne se dhoo. Main ne use dhoya, phir aaya, mujh par us mein se kuch bacha hua; Main ne unhen salam kiya, lekin Unhon ne mera aamdeed na kiya na mujh par muskuraye, farmate hue: Jao aur yeh apne se dhoo. Main ne use dhoya, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya, unhen salam kiya, aur Unhon ne mera salam diya, mera aamdeed kiya, aur farmaya: Farishte bhalai ke sath na kafir ke janaze mein hazir hote hain, na za'fran lagae hue ke, na junubi ke aur Unhon ne junubi ko ijazat di, jab woh khana ya Sona chahe, wuzu kare"
"684","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Imran ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, unhon ne kaha: Hamare ek sathi ne hamen Ammar se bayan kiya, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat ki misaal baarish jaisi hai; nahin ma'loom us ka shuru behtar hai ya us ka aakhira."
"685","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Abu nazaraa se, unhon ne kaha: Qais bin ubaada ne mujhe bayan kiya, kehte hue: Main ne Ammar se kaha: Aey Abu al-yaqazaana, mujhe batao, yeh muamla jo Tum ne apni rae se uthaya, ya kuch jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne tumhen hukm diya? Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen kuch hukm nahin diya siwae us ke jo Unhon ne logon ko hukm diya"
"686","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu at-Tayyah se, Abdullah Ibn Abi al-Hudhail al-anazii se, ke Ammar, Raziyallahu anhu un ke sath utha rahe the — ya'ni pathar — aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Afsos tum par, Aey sumayyaa ke bete, baghi giroh tumhein qatl karega Abdul-waris ne yeh hadees Abu at-Tayyah se, Ibn Abi al-Hudhail se, Ammar se riwayat ki, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Afsos tum par, Aey sumayyaa ke bete"
"687","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya: Al-Umari ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id al-Maqburi ne mujhe bayan kiya, Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman bin al-Haris bin Hisham al-Makhzumi se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ammar bin Yasir ko do rak'aten padhte aur chhoti karte dekha Main ne un se kaha — ya ek aadmi ne un se kaha: Aey Abu al-yaqazaana, Tum ne unhen chhota kiya unhon ne kaha: Aey mere bhai ke bete, Kya Tum ne mujhe un ki hudood mein se kuch chhodte dekha? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin unhon ne kaha: Main ne vasavase ke par jaldi ki, aur Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Aadmi namaz padhta hai aur use us mein se sirf aadha milta hai; woh namaz padhta hai aur use us mein se sirf tihai milta hai; woh namaz padhta hai aur use us mein se sirf chauthai milta hai — yahan tak ke daswen tak pahunche"
"688","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, us se Jis ne Ammar ko suna: Ek aadmi ne un ke samne A'ishah ka zikr kiya aur un ki burayi kahi, to unhon ne kaha: Khamosh ho, zaleel aur malauuna. Kya tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki mahabuubaa ko takleef dete ho?"
"689","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid se, Abu Usman se, unhon ne kaha: Main Salman ke sath darakht ke neeche tha; Unhon ne us mein se khushk dal li aur use harkat, aur us ke patte jhadi unhon ne kaha: Kya tum mujh se nahin poochhoge ke main aisa kyun karta hun? Main ne kaha: Aur tum aisa kyun karte ho? Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne aisa kiya, phir farmaya: Aey Salman, Kya tum mujh se nahin poochhoge ke main aisa kyun karta hun? Main ne kaha: Aur tum aisa kyun karte ho, Ya Rasulullah? Aap ne farmaya: Jab Musalman wuzu kare, use poora karte hue, phir paanch namazen padhe — mera khayal hai Aap ne kaha: Jama'at mein — to us ke gunah gira hain jaise is darakht ke patte jhadi aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne padha: Aur din ke donon kinaron aur raat ke shuruaatii hisson mein namaz qayam karo; Beshak nekiyan buraiyon ko mitaatii hain"
"690","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, us se Jis ne Abu Usman ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne tiddiyon ka zikr hua, aur Aap ne farmaya: Allah ki makhlooq mein sab zyada; main na unhen halal karta hun na haraama. Abu al-Awwam ne yeh hadees Abu Usman se, Salman se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat ki"
"691","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, Ibrahim se, Abdur Rahman bin Yazid se, unhon ne kaha: Ahle-Kitab ke ek aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se ek aadmi se kaha: Tumhare sathi ne tumhen sikhaya hai, yahan tak ke tumhen qazae-hajat sikhai unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne hamen apne satar se qible ki taraf munh karne ya use peeth dene se mana kiya, aur hamen hukm diya ke teen patthron se istinja karen mein na haddi ho na gobara. al-A'mash ne yeh hadees Ibrahim se, Abdur Rahman bin Yazid se, Salman se riwayat ki"
"692","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Hashim se, zazaama se, Salman se, unhon ne kaha: Taurat mein: Khane ki barkat us se pahle wuzu hai Main ne is ka zikr Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya, aur Aap ne farmaya: Khane ki barkat us se pahle aur us ke baad wuzu hai"
"693","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Dawud Ibn Abi al-furaata ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Zaid al-Abdi ne mujhe bayan kiya, Abu Shuraih se, Abu Muslim se, jo Zaid bin suvaana ke aazad-karda the, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Salman al-faarisii ko dekha ke Unhon ne ek aadmi ko dekha jo wuzu mein apne mouze utaaranaa chahta tha, aur Salman ne use apne mouzon, apni amame aur apne balon par masah ka hukm diya Salman ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko apni topiyan aur apne mouzon par masah karte dekha"
"694","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Murrah ne mujhe khabar di, Abu al-Bakhtari ko Bani Abs ke ek aadmi se riwayat karte suni, unhon ne kaha: Main Salman ke sath tha, aur Unhon ne Kisra ke khazanon ka zikr kiya unhon ne kaha: Jis ne tumhen diya aur Ata kiya aur use tumhare liye khola woh apna khazana rokta hai, jabke Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) zinda the aur woh subah karte the na dinar na dirham na mudd khana un ke paas hote hue — to yeh kyun hai, Aey Bani Abs ke bhai? Unhon ne kaha: Phir woh gaahe jate khalihaanon ke paas se guzre, aur kaha: Jis ne tumhen diya aur Ata kiya aur use tumhare liye khola woh apna khazana rokta hai, jabke Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) zinda the aur woh subah karte the na dinar na dirham na mudd khana un ke paas hote hue — to yeh kyun hai, Aey Bani Abs ke bhai?"
"695","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shujaaa bin al-Waleed ne ham se bayan kiya, qaabuusa Ibn Abi zibyaana se, un ke walid se, Salman se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Salman, mujh se nafrat na karo, kahin tum apna deen na chhod do main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main tum kaise nafrat kar sakta hun, jabke tumhare sath Allah ne hamen hidayat di? Aap ne farmaya: Tum Arabon se nafrat karte ho, aur is tarah mujh se nafrat karte ho"
"696","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id al-Maqburi se, un ke walid se, Ubaidullah bin Adi bin al-Khiyar se, Salman al-Khair se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Jume ko ghusl kare, apne tel se tel lagae, apne ghar ke itra se itra lagae, phir Jume ki namaz mein aae, do ke darmiyan judai na kare, namaz padhe, aur jab imam bole sune aur khamosh rahe — use us ke aur agle Jume ke darmiyan muaf kiya jata hai"
"697","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ziyad bin Ilaqah se, unhon ne kaha: Main Jarir bin Abdullah al-Bajali ke paas hazir tha jab al-Mughirah bin Shu'bah halaak hue, aur Jarir ko khutba dete suna unhon ne kaha: Apne ameer ke liye shafa'at karo, kyunke woh afiyat pasand karta tha; suno aur ita'at karo yahan tak ke tumhare paas ameer aaye jahan tak aage ki baat hai: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se Islam par bai'at ki, aur Unhon ne mujh par har Musalman ki khairkhwahi shart ki is masjid ke Rabb ki qasam, main waqaee tum mukhalisa hun"
"698","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, Ziyad bin Ilaqah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jarir bin Abdullah ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo logon par raham na kare, Allah us par raham nahin karta"
"699","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Jarir bin Abdullah ke sath muhim mein the aur bhook ne hamen roka Jarir ne Mu'awiyah ko likha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo logon par raham na kare, Allah us par raham nahin karta Mu'awiyah ne likha ke woh laut unhon ne kaha: Aur Unhon ne unhen rasada di Abu Ishaq ne kaha: Mujhe jo Unhon ne unhen diya us mein se ooni chadar hulla"
"700","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Ubaidullah bin Jarir se, un ke walid se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi qaum nahin mein gunah kiye jaen, woh karne wale se zyada qawi aur zyada tadaad wale hote hue, phir woh use na badalen, magar Allah Ta'ala unhen azab se gher leta hai"
"701","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin mudrika se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu zaraa bin Amr bin Jarir ko Jarir bin Abdullah al-Bajali se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Jarir, logon ko sunaao — ya'ni Hajjat-Wada mein Aap ne farmaya: Mere baad kafir kar na jao, ek-doosre ki gardenen marte hue"
"702","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdul-Malik bin Umair se, al-Mundhir bin Jarir se, Jarir se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen chhote mimbar par khutba diya, hamen sadqe ki taraghiiba dete hue aur hamen chehre se mana karte hue"
"703","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, Tameem bin Salamah se, Abdur Rahman bin Hilal al-Absi se, Jarir se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo narmi se mahrum hua woh bhalai se mahrum hua"
"704","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hushaim ne ham se bayan kiya, Ismail Ibn Abi Khalid se, ash-Sha'bi se, Jarir bin Abdullah al-Bajali se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Sadqa vasuula karne wala tumhare paas aae to woh tum razi hue baghair na jae"
"705","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, Ibrahim se, Hammam bin al-Haris se, Jarir bin Abdullah al-Bajali se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mouzon par masah kiya Ibrahim ne kaha: Yeh hadees unhen khush karti thi, kyunke Jarir ka Islam Surah-Ma'idah ke nuzuula ke baad tha"
"706","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek aur Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, Usman bin Umair se, zazaama se, Jarir bin Abdullah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Lahd wali qabr banao aur shakha wali na banao; kyunke lahd hamare liye hai aur shakha doosron ke liye"
"707","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Aun Ibn Abi Juhaifah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne al-Mundhir bin Jarir ko apne walid Jarir bin Abdullah se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath subah-savere baithe the, jab nange paon, nange jism log aae, Habarah ooni kapde pahne mein cheda kate the, burdah un par — ya unhon ne kaha: Talwaren pahne — mein aksar Muzar se, lekin sab Muzar se Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka chehra badalte dekha us mufalisii par jo Aap ne mein dekhi Aap dakhil hue, phir nikle, Bilal ko hukm diya, jinhon namaz ki azan di, aur Aap ne Zuhr ki namaz padhi Aap ne khutba diya, farmate hue: Aey logo, apne Rabb se daro Jis ne tumhen ek jaan se paida kiya — aayat ke anta tak phir farmaya: Aey iman walon, Allah se daro, aur har jaan dekhe jo Us ne kal ke liye aage bheja — aayat ke anta tak aadmi apne dinar, apne dirham, apne kapde, apne sa' gehn, apne sa' khajoor se Sadqa de — yahan tak ke farmaya: Chahe aadhi khajoor Ansar mein se ek aadmi thaili lekar aaya jise us ka hath mushkil se utha sakta tha — lekin utha nahin sakta tha — aur use Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko diya log sadqon mein peeche aae, aur Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne khane aur kapde ke do dher dekhe Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka chehra kheechnne laga jaise sunaharaa. Aap ne farmaya: Jo Islam mein achchi sunnat jari kare use us ka ajr aur us ke baad us par amal karne wale ka ajr hai, un ke ajron mein se kuch ghataae baghair aur jo Islam mein buri sunnat jari kare us par us ka bojh aur us ke baad us par amal karne wale ka bojh hai, un ke bojhon mein se kuch ghataae baghair"
"708","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman bin Mu'az ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim se, Abu Wa'il se, Jarir bin Abdullah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, jinhon farmaya: Muhajireen aur Ansar duniya aur aakhirat mein ek-doosre ke dost hain"
"709","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne ham se bayan kiya, Yunus bin Ubaid se, Sa'id al-asalaa se, Abu zaraa bin Amr bin Jarir se, Jarir bin Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se achanak nazar ke bare mein poocha, aur Aap ne farmaya: Apni nazar musafir karo"
"710","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor bin Abdur Rahman al-ghudaanii se, ash-Sha'bi ko suni, Jarir bin Abdullah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, jinhon farmaya: Chori hua ghulam — us se koi namaz qabool nahin hoti yahan tak ke apne maalikon ke paas aur"
"711","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Murrah ne mujhe khabar di, Ibn Abi Laila ko kehte suni: Zaid bin Arqam hamare janazon par namaz padhte the, chaar takbiren kehte hue; ek din paanch kahin un se us ke bare mein poocha gaya, aur kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne paanch kahin"
"712","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Murrah ne mujhe khabar di, Abu Hamzah ko kehte suni: Ansar ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, har qaum ke pairukar hain, aur Ham ne sab tumhari pairwi ki hai; Allah se hamare liye dua karo ke woh hamare pairukaron ko ham mein se bana Aap ne aisa kiya aur un ke liye dua ki Amr ne kaha: Main ne woh Ibn Abi Laila se bayan kiya, aur unhon ne kaha: Zaid bin Arqam ne is ka da'wa kiya"
"713","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Murrah ne mujhe khabar di, Ibn Abi Laila ko kehte suni: Ham Zaid bin Arqam ke sath baithte the, kehte hue: Hamen bayan karo, hamen bayan karo woh kehte the: Ham boodhe ho gae hain aur bhool gae hain, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karna bhaari hai"
"714","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Murrah ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Hamzah ko suna, Zaid bin Arqam se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mere hauz par aane walon ke sau hazaar — ya sattar hazaar — hisson mein se ek hissa nahin ho; aur woh us din aath ya nau sau the"
"715","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Murrah ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Hamzah ko suna, Zaid bin Arqam se, unhon ne kaha: Sab pahle Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath namaz padhne wale Ali the"
"716","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, an-Nazr bin Anas ko suni, Zaid bin Arqam se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Yeh baitul-khala shaitanon ke hazir hone ki jagah hain; jab tum mein se ek baitul-khala aae to kahe: Main narr aur ki shaitanon se Allah ki panah mangta hun"
"717","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, an-Nazr bin Anas ko suni, Zaid bin Arqam se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Allah, Ansar, Ansar ke beton, aur Ansar ke beton ke beton ko muaf karo"
"718","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid se, an-Nazr bin Anas se, ke Anas ne bete khoye, to Zaid bin Arqam ne unhen likha ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Allah, Ansar, Ansar ke beton, aur Ansar ke beton ke beton ko muaf karo"
"719","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Zaid bin Arqam se kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne kitni muhimen ladin? Unhon ne kaha: Unnis muhimen."
"720","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Zaid bin Arqam se kaha: Tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath kitni muhimen ladin? Unhon ne kaha: Satrah muhimen."
"721","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Zaid bin Arqam se kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne sab pehli kaun-si muhim larii? Unhon ne kaha: Zu al-ushairaa, ya Zu al-usairaa."
"722","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isra'il ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Usman bin al-Mughirah ne ham se bayan kiya, Iyas Ibn Abi ramalaa ash-Shami se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Mu'awiyah ko Zaid bin Arqam se poochte dekha: Kya Tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath ek din mein do Eidein jama hote ke? Unhon ne kaha: Han unhon ne kaha: Aap ne Kya kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Aap ne Eid ki namaz padhi, phir Jume ke bare mein ijazat di, farmate hue: Jo chahe padhe"
"723","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Khalid al-Hazza se, ek aadmi se, Zaid bin Arqam se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen zaatula-janba ka ilaaj hindustaanii uuda aur tel se karne ka hukm diya"
"724","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Qasim ash-Shaibani se, Zaid bin Arqam se, ke Unhon ne logon ko go ke sath baithe dekha; jab suraj nikla to woh sutoonon ki taraf namaz ke liye daure. Zaid bin Arqam ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tauba karne walon ki namaz hai jab oont ke bachche garmi se jalen."
"725","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Habib Ibn Abi Sabit ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu al-Minhal ko kehte suna: Main ne Zaid bin Arqam aur al-Bara bin Azib se sarraafii ke bare mein poocha main mein se ek se poochta, aur woh kehta: Doosre se poocho, kyunke woh mujh se behtar hai Main ne donon se poocha, aur Unhon ne mujhe bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Sona chandi ke badle qarz bechne se mana farmaya"
"726","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Abu Abdullah ash-Shami se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Mu'awiyah ko khutba dete suna, kehte hue: Aey Sham walon, al-Ansari — ya'ni Zaid bin Arqam — ne mujhe bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat ka ek giroh hamesha haq par ladta rahega yahan tak ke Allah ka hukm aae, aur main tumhen Wahy samajhta hun, Aey Sham vaalo."
"727","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Habib Ibn Abi Sabit se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Maimun Ibn Abi Shabeeb ko al-Mughirah bin Shu'bah se riwayat karte suna ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo mujh se hadees bayan kare jabke woh samajhta ho ke woh jhooti hai, to woh jhuuthon mein se ek hai"
"728","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sabit Abu Zaid — ya kisi aur — ne ham se bayan kiya Asim al-Raziyallahu se, Bakr se, al-Mughirah bin Shu'bah se, unhon ne kaha: Do mamle hain jin ke bare mein main logon mein se kisi se nahin poochta: Aadmi ki apne maatahaton mein se aadmi ke peeche namaz, kyunke Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Abdur Rahman bin Auf ke peeche namaz padhte dekha; aur mouzon par masah, kyunke Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko un par masah karte dekha"
"729","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi az-Zinad ne ham se bayan kiya apne walid se, Urwah bin al-Mughirah se, al-Mughirah bin Shu'bah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne mouzon ke oopri hisse par masah kiya"
"730","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek, Abu Awanah, Qais aur Shaiban ne ham se bayan kiya Ziyad bin Ilaqah se, al-Mughirah bin Shu'bah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz padhte the yahan tak ke un ke qadam suuja jate unhon ne kaha: Un se kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, Kya tum aisa karte ho jabke Allah ne tumhare aage-peeche ke gunah muaf kar diye hain? Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya main shukraguzaara banda na banuun?"
"731","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shaiban bin Abdur Rahman ne ham se bayan kiya Ziyad bin Ilaqah se, al-Mughirah bin Shu'bah se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Ibrahim, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke bete wafat pae to suraj grahana hua, to logon ne kaha: Suraj Ibrahim ki maut se grahana hua hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) nikle aur farmaya: Aey logo, suraj aur chand kisi ki maut ya zindagi ke liye grahana nahin hote, lekin woh Allah, Aziz Wajleel ki nishaniyon mein se do nishaniyan hain; to jab aisa ho to namaz padho yahan tak ke saaf ho"
"732","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya Ziyad bin Ilaqah se, unhon ne kaha: Al-Mughirah bin Shu'bah ne hamen namaz padhai aur pehli do rak'aton mein khade hue, to Unhon ne unhen Subhanallah kaha, lekin woh apni namaz mein jari rahe jab woh farigh hue to do sajde kiye phir salam phera, aur kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne usi tarah kiya"
"733","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mansoor ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibrahim ko Ubaid bin nadalaa se, al-Mughirah bin Shu'bah se riwayat karte suna, ke Hudhail ke ek aadmi ki do biwiyan thin, aur mein se ek ne doosri ko kheme ke dande se mara aur us ka hamal gira diya unhon ne kaha: Kya tum use zimmedar thaharaate ho Jis ne na khaya na piya na cheekhe na paida par awaz nikali? Kaha gaya: Kya woh Jahiliyat ke sajaa jaisa sajaa kalaam hai? Unhon ne kaha: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us mein ghurran ka faisla kiya — ghulam ya bandi — aur use aurat ke asbah par diya"
"734","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Mansoor se, Mujahid se, aqqaara bin al-Mughirah bin Shu'bah se, un ke walid se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us ne waqaee Allah par tawakkul nahin kiya jo ruqya ya khujate maange."
"735","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Aun as-Saqafi Muhammad bin Ubaidullah ne mujhe khabar di, al-Mughirah bin Shu'bah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne lambi moonchh wale aadmi ko dekha, to Aap ne miswak aur ustaraa mangwaya, miswak ko moonchh ke neeche rakha, aur us ke upar se kataraa."
"736","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id bin Abdur Rahman ne ham se bayan kiya Muhammad bin Sireen se, Amr bin Wahb as-Saqafi se, al-Mughirah bin Shu'bah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko amame aur mouzon par masah karte dekha"
"737","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Tuamaa bin Amr al-jaafarii ne ham se bayan kiya Umar bin bayan se, Urwah bin al-Mughirah bin Shu'bah se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo sharab beche, woh suar bhi kaat beche"
"738","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Fuzalah ne ham se bayan kiya Ziyad bin Jubair se, un ke walid se, al-Mughirah bin Shu'bah se, unhon ne kaha — aur main Ise Nabi se marfu' ke siwa nahin janta: Sawar janaze ke peeche rahe, aur paidal chalne wala us mein jahan chahe ho: Us ke samne qareeb, ya us ke daayen qareeb, ya us ke baayen qareeb"
"739","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Fuzalah ne ham se bayan kiya Ziyad bin Jubair bin hayya se, un ke walid se, al-Mughirah bin Shu'bah se, unhon ne kaha — aur main Ise Nabi se marfu' ke siwa nahin samajhta, unhon ne kaha: Gire hue hamal par namaz padhi jati hai, aur us ke walidah-baap ke liye bakhshish aur rehmat ki dua ki jati hai"
"740","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Fuzalah ne ham se bayan kiya Ziyad bin Jubair se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Ham an-Nu'man bin Muqarrin ke sath nikle yahan tak ke al-ilja Zu al-haajiba tak pahunche Unhon ne hamen bheja: Mere paas aadmi bhejo taake main us se baat karun unhon ne kaha: Us din logon ne al-Mughirah bin Shu'bah ko cunaa. mere walid ne kaha: Jaise main kana aadmi ko apni dhal ke sath dekh raha hun, aur dekho, woh al-Mughirah bin Shu'bah the ham al-ilja tak pahunche aur unhon ne kaha: Allah, Aziz Wajleel ne hamare darmiyan Nabi bheja jis se Allah ne fath ka wa'da kiya; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen jo khabar di, Ham ne use theek waisa paya jaisa Unhon ne hamen khabar di"
"741","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ishaq ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne al-Bara bin Azib ko kehte suna: Sab pahle jo hamare paas Madinah mein aae — ya'ni hijrat mein — Mus'ab bin Umair aur bin Umm Maktoom the, aur woh Quran padhate the phir Sa'd, Bilal aur Ammar aaye phir Umar bin al-Khattab bees aadmiyon ke sath aaye phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aae, aur Main ne Madinah walon ko kisi cheez par izafa khush hote nahin dekha jitna Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke aane par khush hue; galiyon mein baandiyaan kaho rahi thin: Rasulullah aa gae! Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) nahin aae yahan tak ke main pahle hi padh chuka tha: Apne Parwardigar, buland ke naam ki tasbih kar, aur: Raat ki qasam jab ghalib, al-Mufassal ki suraton mein se"
"742","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne al-Bara ko kehte suna: Jab yeh aayat nazil hui: Ghar baithne wale mu'min barabar nahin, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Zaid bin Sabit ko bulaya aur us par likhne ke liye kandhe ki haddi mangavaaii, aur bin Umm Maktoom aae aur apni maazuurii zikr ki, to yeh aayat nazil hui: Maazuuron ke liye"
"743","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne al-Bara ko kehte suna: Logon ko Khaibar ke din gadhe mile — ya'ni paaltu gadhe — to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne munadi ko hukm diya Jis ne elan kiya: Haandiyan ulat do"
"744","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Umar Ibn Abi Zaidah ne ham se bayan kiya Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne al-Bara ko suna — aur ek aadmi ne un se kaha: Aey Abu Umarah, Kya tum Hunain ke din Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bhaage? Al-Bara ne kaha: Lekin Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) nahin bhaage. Hawazin tiirandaaza qaum the; jab ham un se mile aur un par hamla kiya to woh bhaage, to log maal-ghanimat ki taraf mude jabke Unhon ne teeron se hamara samna kiya aur log bhaage. Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko us din dekha Abu Sufyan bin al-Haris khaccara ki Langoat pakde hue, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apne safed khaccara par, aur Nabi farmate hue: Main Nabi hun, jhoot nahin; main Abdul-Muttalib ka beta hun"
"745","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne al-Bara ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ansar ke ek aadmi ko hukm diya ke jab woh apne bistar par jae to kahe: Aey Allah, Main ne apne ko Tere hawale kiya, apna chehra Teri taraf phera, apna muamla tumhein saunpa, aur apni peeth Tere sahare lagai, Teri ummeed aur Tere dar se; tujh se koi panah ya farar nahin siwae Teri taraf; main Teri Kitab par iman laya jo Tu ne utari aur Tere Rasulullah par jise Tu ne bheja Aap ne farmaya: Agar woh mare to fitrat par mara"
"746","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Abu Ishaq se, al-Bara se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam), jab apne bistar par jate to apna hath apne rukhsar ke neeche rakhte aur farmate: Aey Allah, mujhe apne azab se bacha jis din Tu apne bandon ko uthae"
"747","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne al-Bara ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko shagaaf kapda tohfe mein diya gaya, aur woh use chhoone aur us ki narmi par ta'ajjub karne lage Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jannat mein Sa'd bin Mu'az ke ruumaalon mein se ruumaala is se Narmi hai"
"748","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Abu Ishaq se, al-Bara bin Azib se — unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Kya Tum ne yeh un se suna? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin — ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) raste mein baithe logon ke paas aae aur farmaya: Agar tumhen karna hi ho to salam laotao, mazloom ki madad karo, aur rasta woh"
"749","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Abu Ishaq se, al-Bara se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Khandaq ke din hamare sath khodate dekha, yahan tak ke Main ne dekha mitti ne un ke pet ki safedi dhak di thi — ya unhon ne kaha: Un ke baal — aur woh kaho rahe the — Shu'bah ne apni riwayat mein kaha: Meri hafze, aur likhita nuskhe mein unhon ne kaha: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farmate hain: Abainaa, abainaa, us ke sath apni awaz buland karte hue"
"750","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Abu Ishaq se, al-Bara se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Quraish ke mushrikon se sulah ki to Aap ne un ke darmiyan dastaaveza likha: Yeh hai jis par Muhammad, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ittefaq hue hain unhon ne kaha: Agar ham jante ke tum Allah ke Rasulullah ho to ham tum na ladte! Aap ne Ali se kaha: Use mitaao, lekin Unhon ne inkar kiya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use apne hath se mitaayaa aur likha: Yeh hai jis par Muhammad bin Abdullah ittefaq hue hain Unhon ne un par shart ki ke woh teen din thaharenge aur Makkah mein hathiyar ke sath dakhil na honge siwae julubbaana as-silaaha ke Shu'bah ne kaha: Main ne Abu Ishaq se kaha: Julubbaana as-silaaha Kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Talwar us ki myaana mein ya us par jo us mein hai"
"751","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Abu Ishaq se, al-Bara se, unhon ne kaha: Jabke ek aadmi raat ko Surah-Kahf padh raha tha, Us ne apni sawari ko laqis hote dekha — ya unhon ne kaha: Us ke ghode ko laqis hote — phir Us ne dekha aur dekho, dhundha jaisi kuch — ya unhon ne kaha: Badal tarah Us ne is ka zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kiya, jinhon farmaya: Woh sakiinaa hai jo Quran ke liye utarii, ya jo Quran par nazil"
"752","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Abu Ishaq se, al-Bara se, unhon ne kaha: Jab sharab ki hurmat nazil hui to unhon ne kaha: Un ka Kya jo us ke haram hone se pahle use peete the? Phir yeh aayat nazil hui: Iman dene walon aur nek amal karne walon par jo Unhon ne khaya us mein koi gunah nahin"
"753","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Ar-Rabi bin al-Bara bin Azib ne mujhe apne walid se khabar di ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam), jab safar se lautte to farmate: Lautte hue, Tauba karte hue, ibadat karte hue, apne Rabb ki tareef karte hue"
"754","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Abu Ishaq se, al-Bara se, unhon ne kaha: Ansar, jab safar se lautte to aadmi apne darwaze ki taraf se dakhil na hota, to yeh aayat nazil hui: Aur neki yeh nahin ke tum gharon mein un ki qafle se dakhil ho, lekin neki us mein hai jo Allah se dare; aur gharon mein un ke darwazon se dakhil ho"
"755","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah bin Yazid al-Ansari ko khutba dete suna, kehte hue: Al-Bara bin Azib — jo jhoote na the — ne mujhe bayan kiya ke jab woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath namaz padhte aur ruku se apne sar uthate to mein se koi sajdah na karta yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko sajdah karte dekhte, phir woh sajdah karte"
"756","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Abu Ishaq se, jinhon al-Bara ko kehte suna: Mujhe Badr ke din Ibn Umar ke sath jo samjha gaya"
"757","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya Abu Ishaq se, al-Bara se, ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Madinah aae to Aap ne solah mahine baitul-Maqdis ki taraf namaz padhi phir yeh aayat Aap par nazil hui: To apna chehra Masjid-haram ki taraf pher woh nazil hui jabke kuch log baitul-Maqdis ki taraf namaz padh rahe the, aur jab Unhon ne use namaz mein suna to namaz mein hi apne chehre Kaabe ki taraf pher liye"
"758","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hudaij bin Mu'awiyah ne ham se bayan kiya Abu Ishaq se, al-Bara se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath pandrah muhimon mein hissa liya"
"759","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne al-Bara ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) daramiyaane qad ke the, kandhon ke darmiyan ke, logon mein sab bade aur sab phir; un ke baal un ke kaanon tak pahunchte the, un par surkh kapda tha, aur Main ne un se zyada phir kuch nahin dekha"
"760","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek aur Hudaij ne ham se bayan kiya Abu Ishaq se, al-Bara se, unhon ne kaha: Kuch log baitul-Maqdis ki taraf namaz padhte hue mare, to unhon ne kaha: Hamare sahaba ka Kya jo baitul-Maqdis ki taraf namaz padhte hue mare? Phir Allah, Aziz Wajleel ne nazil kiya: Aur Allah tumhare iman ko kabhi zaya nahin karega — ya'ni baitul-Maqdis ki taraf tumhari namaz"
"761","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ayyub bin Jabir ne ham se bayan kiya Abu Ishaq se, al-Bara bin Azib se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki thaile ki safedi dekhi jabke woh sajdah kar rahe the"
"762","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Waki ne ham se bayan kiya Abu Ishaq se, al-Bara se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) dushman se lad rahe the jab lohe mein dhaka aadmi aaya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us ke samne Islam pesh kiya aur woh Musalman hua unhon ne kaha: Kaun-sa amal afzal hai ke main use karun? Aap ne farmaya: Un logon se lado jise tum aae ho to woh un se ladai yahan tak ke qatl kiya gaya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us ne thoda kiya aur bahut ajr paya"
"763","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair ne ham se bayan kiya Abu Ishaq se, al-Bara se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Uhud ke din logon ke tiirandaazon par Abdullah bin Jubair ko muqarrar kiya, aur woh pachaas aadmi the, aur un se farmaya: Apni jagah thehro, use na chhodo, chahe tum parindon ko hamen ucakate dekho al-Bara ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, Main ne aurton ko dekha un ki paazeben zahir, un ke kapde dhiile, pahaad carhate hue jab jo hua hua aur log luuta rahe the to woh chale gaye Abdullah bin Jubair, un ke ameer ne kaha: Tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke hukm ka Kya karoge? Lekin woh chalte rahe, aur jo hua hua jab raat aai to Abu Sufyan bin Harb aaya aur kaha: Kya Muhammad tum mein hain? Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use jawab na do phir us ne kaha: Kya Muhammad tum mein hain? Unhon ne use jawab na diya phir us ne kaha: Kya Muhammad tum mein hain? Teesri martaba, aur Unhon ne use jawab na diya phir us ne kaha: Kya Abu Quhafa ka beta tum mein hai? Unhon ne use jawab na diya — Us ne Ise teen martaba kaha phir us ne kaha: Kya al-Khattab ka beta tum mein hai? Us ne Ise teen martaba kaha aur Unhon ne use jawab na diya us ne kaha: Jahan tak inakaa miskeen hai, tum un se chutakaaraa pa cuke. Umar apne ko rok na sake aur kaha: Tum ne jhoot kaha, Aey Allah ke dushman; yahan Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hain, aur Abu Bakr aur main zinda hain, aur tumhare liye ham se bura din hai us ne kaha: Badr ke din ke badle din, aur jang bari-bari hoti hai aur us ne kaha: Hubala buland ho! Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use jawab do unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, ham Kya kahen? Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Allah sab buland aur sab azeem hai us ne kaha: Hamare paas al-Uzza hai aur tumhare paas koi Uzza nahin! Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use jawab do unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, ham Kya kahen? Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Allah hamara maula hai aur tumhara koi maula nahin phir Abu Sufyan ne kaha: Tum logon mein chehre dekhoge jis ka Main ne hukm nahin diya, aur woh mujhe napasand nahin hua"
"764","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair ne ham se bayan kiya Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Al-Bara se kaha gaya: Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka chehra talwar jaisa tha? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin, lekin chand tarah"
"765","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya Abu Ishaq se, al-Bara se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Zu al-Zulqa'dah mein umrah kiya"
"766","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Adi bin Sabit al-Ansari se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne al-Bara bin Azib ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ansar ke bare mein farmaya: Un se mu'min ke siwa koi muhabbat nahin karta aur munafiq ke siwa koi nafrat nahin karta; jo un se muhabbat kare, Allah us se muhabbat karta hai, aur jo un se nafrat kare, Allah us se nafrat karta hai unhon ne kaha: To Main ne Adi se kaha: Tumhen al-Bara se Kis ne bayan kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Al-Bara ne nafs mujhe khabar di"
"767","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Adi bin Sabit se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne al-Bara ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya jab un ke bete Ibrahim wafat pae: Jannat mein us ki doodh pilane wali hai"
"768","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Adi ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne al-Bara ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hassan bin Sabit se farmaya: Un ki hajw karo — ya'ni mushrikon ki, ya unhon ne kaha: Un par hamla karo — aur Jibreel tumhare sath hain"
"769","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Adi bin Sabit se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne al-Bara aur Ibn Abi Aufa ko riwayat karte suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne paaltu gadhon ke gosht se mana farmaya, to haandiyan ulat di gaen"
"770","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Adi bin Sabit se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne al-Bara ko kehte suna: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko al-Hasan ko apne kandhe par rakhte dekha, aur Aap ne farmaya: Jo mujh se muhabbat kare, woh un se muhabbat kare"
"771","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Adi bin Sabit se, jinhon al-Bara ko kehte suna: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath safar mein tha, aur Aap ne Maghrib mein doosri rak'at mein padha: Anjiira aur thoda ki qasam"
"772","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya al-A'mash se, Abdullah se, jo Quraish ke aazad-karda the, Abdur Rahman Ibn Abi Laila se, al-Bara bin Azib se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se oont ke gosht se wuzu ke bare mein poocha gaya, to Aap ne us ka hukm diya; aur oonton ke baithne ki jaghon mein namaz ke bare mein poocha gaya, to Aap ne us se mana kiya"
"773","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya al-A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah ko suna, jo Quraish ke aazad-karda the, Ibn Abi Laila se, al-Bara se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bakri ke gosht se wuzu ke bare mein poocha gaya, to Aap ne us se wuzu ki ijazat di; aur un ki baithne ki jaghon mein namaz ke bare mein poocha gaya, to Aap ne us ki ijazat di"
"774","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Hakam ne mujhe khabar di ke jab Matar bin main ne Kufa par qabzaa kiya to Unhon ne Abu Ubaidah bin Abdullah ko logon ko namaz padhane ka hukm diya, to Unhon ne logon ko namaz padhai, aur jab woh ruku se sar uthate to qiyam lamba karte Main ne is ka zikr Ibn Abi Laila se kiya, jinhon al-Bara bin Azib se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki namaz — jab woh namaz padhte, phir ruku karte, aur jab ruku se sar uthate, aur jab sajdah karte, aur jab sajde se sar uthate, donon sajdon ke darmiyan — tool mein taqariibana barabar hoti thi"
"775","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Murrah ne mujhe bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Laila ko al-Bara se riwayat karte suni, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Fajr ki namaz aur Maghrib ki namaz mein qunut padhte the"
"776","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Talha bin Musarrif se, Abdur Rahman bin Ausaja se, al-Bara bin Azib se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Quran ko apni aavaazon se khubsurat karo Shu'bah ne kaha: Main yeh alfaz bhool gaya tha yahan tak ke Woh-Dahhak bin Muzahim ne mujhe us ki yaad dilaaii."
"777","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Isa bin Abdur Rahman ne ham se bayan kiya Talha al-Yami se, Abdur Rahman bin Ausaja se, al-Bara se, unhon ne kaha: Ek dehati Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mujhe aise amal ki khabar do jo mujhe jannat mein dakhil kare Aap ne farmaya: Chhota chahe tumhara khutba ho, Tum ne bada sawal kiya hai! Jaan aazad karo aur gardan churaao. unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya woh ek hi nahin? Aap ne farmaya: Nahin; jaan aazad karna hai ke tum akele karo, aur gardan chhudana hai ke tum us ki qeemat mein madad karo; aur doodh wali bakri mufta dena, aur zalim rishtedar se neki rokna unhon ne kaha: Aur jo aisa na kar sake? Aap ne farmaya: To bhooke ko khilao aur pyase ko pilaie unhon ne kaha: Aur agar main na kar rakhun? Aap ne farmaya: Neki ka hukm do aur burayi se roko unhon ne kaha: Aur jo aisa na kar sake? Aap ne farmaya: To apni zaban ko bhalai ke siwa se roko"
"778","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Talha bin Musarrif se is hadees ke bare mein bees se zyada martaba poocha — agar koi aur hota to woh tees martaba kalima unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdur Rahman bin Ausaja ko al-Bara bin Azib se riwayat karte suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo chandi ka hadiya de — ya unhon ne kaha: Chandi — ya tang raste se rehnumai kare, ya doodh pilaye, to woh us ke liye jaan ya gardan aazad karne jaisa hoga; aur jo kahe: Allah ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin, akela baghair Shareek, usi ki badshahat hai aur usi ki tareef hai, aur woh har cheez par qadir hai, das martaba, to woh us ke liye jaan ya gardan aazad karne jaisi hongi"
"779","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Talha bin Musarrif se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdur Rahman bin Ausaja ko al-Bara bin Azib se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare paas aate the jab ham namaz ke liye khade hote aur hamare kandhe aur seene ponchhte the, farmate hue: Ikhtilaf na karo, kahin tumhare dil ikhtilaf na karen; Allah, Aziz Wajleel aur us ke farishte pehli saf par — ya unhon ne kaha: Agli safon par — salat bhejte hain"
"780","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Jabir se, ash-Sha'bi se, al-Bara se, ke jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke bete Ibrahim wafat pae to Aap ne farmaya: Jannat mein us ki doodh pilane wali hai jo use doodh pila hai"
"781","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya bayan se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne ash-Sha'bi ko al-Bara se riwayat karte suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qurbani ke din khutba diya aur farmaya: Sab pehli cheez jis se ham apne is din ki aaghaaz karte hain yeh hai ke ham namaz padhte hain, phir lautte hain aur zabah karte hain; jo aisa kare Us ne hamari sunnat pa, aur Jis ne namaz se pahle zabah kiya, woh sirf gosht hai jo Us ne apne gharwalon ko pesh kiya, qurbani se us ka koi miskeen nahin mere mamu Abu Burdah bin niyaara, jinhon namaz se pahle zabah kiya tha, khade hue aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mere paas bakri ka bachcha hai jo mujhe bade bakri se zyada pasandeeda hai! Aap ne farmaya: Use zabah karo, lekin woh tumhare baad kisi ke liye kabhi kafi nahin hogi"
"782","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Murrah ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Sa'd bin Ubaidah ko suna, al-Bara se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek aadmi ko hukm diya, jab woh raat ko apna bistar le to kahe: Aey Allah, Main ne apne ko Tere hawale kiya, apna chehra Teri taraf phera, apna muamla tumhein saunpa, aur apni peeth Tere sahare lagai, Teri ummeed aur Tere dar se; tujh se koi panah ya farar nahin siwae Teri taraf; main Teri Kitab par iman laya jo Tu ne utari aur Tere Rasulullah par jise Tu ne bheja Aap ne farmaya: Agar woh mare to fitrat par mara"
"783","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Alqamah bin Marsad se, Sa'd bin Ubaidah se, al-Bara se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, us ke qaul Allah iman walon ko pakka baat se Sabit rakhta hai ke bare mein — Aap ne farmaya: Qabr mein jab us se sawal kiya jae"
"784","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Ash'as se, unhon ne kaha: Mu'awiyah bin Suwaid bin Muqarrin ne mujhe khabar di, al-Bara bin Azib se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen saat ka hukm diya aur saat se mana kiya: Unhon ne hamen beemar ki iyadat, janazon ke peeche chalna, salam lautaanaa, chheenkne wale ko dua dena, qasam khane wale ki qasam poori karna, mazloom ki madad karna, aur dawat dene wale ki dawat qabool karne ka hukm diya; aur hamen sone ki anguthi — ya unhon ne kaha: Sone ki mohar — sone-chandi ke bartan, shagaaf ziinaposha, qassi ke kapde, istabraq, resham aur dibaj se mana kiya"
"785","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jarir ne ham se bayan kiya Lais se, Amr bin Murrah se, Mu'awiyah bin Suwaid bin Muqarrin se, al-Bara bin Azib se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath the aur Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum jante ho iman ka kaun-sa dasta mazboot hai? Ham ne kaha: Namaz Aap ne farmaya: Namaz achchi hai, lekin woh woh nahin ham ne kaha: Roza, aur Aap ne waisa hi kaha, yahan tak ke Ham ne jihad zikr kiya, aur Aap ne waisa hi kaha phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Iman ka mazboot dasta Allah ke liye muhabbat aur Allah ke liye nafrat hai"
"786","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ubaidullah bin Iyadh bin Laqit ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid ne mujhe bayan kiya, al-Bara se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Jab tum sajdah karo to apna hath rakho aur apni kuhniyan chalo"
"787","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Sulaiman bin Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ubaid bin Fairuz ko kehte suna: Main ne al-Bara bin Azib se poocha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) qurbani ke janwaron mein Kya napasand karte the ya mana karte the? Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare darmiyan is tarah khade hue — aur mera hath un ke hath se chhota hai — aur farmaya: Chaar kafi nahin: Kana jis ka kanapan zahir ho, beemar jis ki beemari zahir ho, langda jis ka langdapan zahir ho, aur tooti haddi wala jis mein gooda na ho main ne kaha: Main napasand karta hun ke dant mein aib ho ya seeng mein aib ho ya kaan mein aib ho unhon ne kaha: Jo tum napasand karo use chhod do, lekin use kisi par haram na karo"
"788","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Habib Ibn Abi Sabit se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu al-Minhal ko kehte suna: Main ne al-Bara bin Azib aur Zaid bin Arqam se sarraafii ke bare mein poocha main mein se ek se poochta aur woh kehta: Doosre se poocho, kyunke woh mujh se behtar aur zyada janne wala hai to Main ne donon se poocha aur Unhon ne mujhe bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne chandi sone ke badle qarz bechne se mana farmaya"
"789","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hushaim aur Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya Abu Balj se, Ziyad Abu al-Hakam al-Bajali se, al-Bara bin Azib se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Musalman apne bhai se mile aur us se musafaha kare, aur woh Allah, Aziz Wajleel ki tareef karen aur us se bakhshish mangne to Allah donon ko muaf karta hai"
"790","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Salamah bin Kuhail se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Juhaifah ko al-Bara se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Abu Burdah ne namaz se pahle zabah kiya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Use badlo unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mere paas bakri ke bachche ke siwa kuch nahin jo bade bakri se behtar hai! Aap ne farmaya: Use us ki jagah rakho, lekin woh tumhare baad kisi ke liye kabhi kafi nahin hogi"
"791","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya al-A'mash se, al-Minhal bin Amr se, zazaada se, al-Bara bin Azib se Abu Dawud ne kaha: Aur Amr bin Sabit ne hamen bayan kiya, use al-Minhal bin Amr se, zazaada se, al-Bara bin Azib se suni — aur Abu Awanah ki riwayat donon mein zyada kamil hai al-Bara ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Ansar ke ek aadmi ke janaze ke liye nikle ham qabr tak pahunche is se pahle ke lahd khodii jae Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) baithe aur ham un ke gird baithe jaise hamare siron par parinde hon — Amr bin Sabit ne kaha: Baithe hue, aur Abu Awanah ne yeh nahin kaha — aur Aap apni nazar uthane lage, aasman ki taraf dekhte hue, aur apni nazar musafir karte hue, zameen ki taraf dekhte hue phir farmaya: Main qabr ke azab se Allah ki panah mangta hun, Ise martaba-martaba kehte hue phir farmaya: Jab mu'min banda aakhirat ke dara par aur duniya se kata hua hota hai to farishta aata hai aur us ke sar ke paas baithta hai, kehta hua: Nikal, Aey itminan wali jaan, Allah ki bakhshish aur us ki raza ki taraf us ki jaan nikalti hai aur behti hai jaise mashkize ki boondon behti hai — Amr ne apni riwayat mein kaha, jo Abu Awanah ne nahin kaha: Chahe tum us ke siwa dekho — aur jannat ke farishte utarte hain, safed chehron wale jaise un ke chehre suraj hon, jannat ke kafanon mein se kafanon aur us ke itra mein se hanuuta par, aur woh baithte hain jahan tak nazar jae jab farishta use pakarataa hai to woh use palaka jhapakne ke liye us ke hath mein nahin chhodte — aur Wahy us ka qaul hai, Aziz Wajleel: Hamare farishte use lete hain, aur woh us nahin karte Aap ne farmaya: Us ki jaan sab miithii khushbu jaisi nikalti hai jo kabhi pa gayi, aur farishte us ke sath carhate hain woh zameen-aasman ke darmiyan kisi giroh ke paas se nahin guzarte magar woh kehte hain: Yeh rooh Kya hai? Kaha jata hai: Falan — us ke behtareen naamon se — yahan tak ke woh us ke sath sab nichle aasman ke darwaze tak pahunchte hain aur us ke liye khola jata hai, aur har aasman mein Allah ke muqarrab use ruksat karte hain, yahan tak ke woh saatwen aasman tak laya jata hai woh farmata hai: Us ka naamae-a'mal illiyyiina mein likho — aur tumhen Kya ma'loom illiyyiina Kya hai? Likha hua daftara, jise muqarrab dekhte hain — to us ka naamae-a'mal illiyyiina mein likha jata hai phir kaha jata hai: Use zameen ki taraf laotao, kyunke Main ne un se wa'da kiya ke usi se Main ne unhen paida kiya, usi mein main unhen lautaauungaa, aur usi se main unhen doosri martaba dunga woh zameen ki taraf diya jata hai aur us ki rooh us ke mukammal mein ne jati hai us ke paas do farishte aate hain, daant mein sakht; woh use daantate hain aur bithate hain, kehte hue: Tumhara Rabb kaun hai? Tumhara deen Kya hai? Woh kehta hai: Mera Rabb Allah hai aur mera deen Islam hai woh kehte hain: Us aadmi ke bare mein Kya kehte ho jo tum mein bheja gaya? Woh kehta hai: Woh Allah ke Rasulullah hain woh kehte hain: Tum kaise jante ho? Woh kehta hai: Woh hamare paas hamare Rabb ki taraf se wazeh daliilon ke sath aae, to main un par iman laya aur un ki sach ki Aap ne farmaya: Aur Wahy us ka qaul hai, Aziz Wajleel: Allah iman walon ko pakka baat se duniya ki zindagi aur aakhirat mein Sabit rakhta hai Aap ne farmaya: Aasman se munadi pukarta hai: Mere bande ne sach kaha, to use jannat se pehnao, us ke liye us mein se bichaao, aur use us mein us ka guzarne dikhaao. use jannat se pahnaya jata hai, us ke liye us mein se bichaayaa jata hai, use us mein us ka guzarne dikhaayaa jata hai, us ki qabr us ke liye jahan tak nazar jae faasla ki jati hai, aur us ka amal us ke samne khubsurat chehre, miithii khushbu aur umdah kapdon wale aadmi ki surat mein pesh kiya jata hai, kehta hua: Khush ho jo Allah, Aziz Wajleel ne tumhare liye tayyar kiya hai; Allah ki raza aur baghon mein khush ho mein hamesha ki nemat hai woh kehta hai: Allah tumhen bhalai ki khushkhabri de; tum kaun ho? Tumhara chehra woh chehra hai jo bhalai ke sath aaya hai woh kehta hai: Yeh tumhara din hai jis ka tum wa'da kiya gaya tha, aur woh muamla jis ka tum wa'da kiya gaya tha; main tumhara nek amal hun Allah ki qasam, Main ne tumhen sirf Allah ki ita'at mein tez aur Allah ki nafarmani mein peeth jana, to Allah tumhen bhalai se jaza de woh kehta hai: Aey Rabb, qayamat qayam kar taake main apne gharwalon aur maal ki taraf lautuun. Aap ne farmaya: Aur agar woh badkar ho, aur aakhirat ke dara par aur duniya se kata hua ho, to farishta aata hai aur us ke sar ke paas baithta hai, kehta hua: Nikal, Aey khabees jaan; Allah ke gussa aur gusse ki khushkhabri le siyahi chehron wale farishte mote kapdon ke sath utarte hain jab farishta use pakarataa hai to woh khade hote hain aur use palaka jhapakne ke liye us ke hath mein nahin chhodta Aap ne farmaya: Woh us ke mukammal mein dhansa jati hai, aur woh use nikalta hai, us ke sath pasliyan aur haddiyon phaarate hue, jaise tar oon mein bahut kaanton wali bade siikha. woh farishte se li jati hai aur sab gandi hawa jaisi nikalti hai jo kabhi pa gayi woh zameen-aasman ke darmiyan kisi giroh ke paas se nahin guzarti magar woh kehte hain: Yeh khabees rooh Kya hai? Woh kehte hain: Falan — us ke badtareen naamon se — yahan tak ke woh sab nichle aasman tak pahunchte hain aur us ke liye khola nahin jata woh farmata hai: Use zameen ki taraf laotao; Main ne un se wa'da kiya ke usi se Main ne unhen paida kiya, usi mein main unhen lautaauungaa, aur usi se main unhen doosri martaba dunga Aap ne farmaya: Woh aasman se giraayaa jata hai Aap ne farmaya: Aap ne yeh aayat padhi: Aur jo Allah ke sath shirk kare, jaise woh aasman se gaya Aap ne farmaya: Woh zameen ki taraf diya jata hai, us ki rooh us mein ne jati hai, aur us ke paas do farishte aate hain, daant mein sakht; woh use daantate hain aur bithate hain, kehte hue: Tumhara Rabb kaun hai? Tumhara deen Kya hai? Woh kehta hai: Main nahin jaanta woh kehte hain: Us aadmi ke bare mein Kya kehte ho jo tum mein bheja gaya? Woh us ka naam yaad nahin kar sakta, kehta hua: Main nahin janta; Main ne logon ko woh kehte suna Aap ne farmaya: Kaha jata hai: Tum ne na jana — aur us ki qabr us par tang ki jati hai yahan tak ke us ki pasaliyaan apne mein dhansa jati hain, aur us ka amal us ke samne bura chehre, gandi hawa aur bura kapdon wale aadmi ki surat mein pesh kiya jata hai, kehta hua: Allah aur us ke gusse se azab ki khushkhabri le woh kehta hai: Tum kaun ho? Tumhara chehra woh chehra hai jo burayi ke sath aaya hai woh kehta hai: Main tumhara bura amal hun Allah ki qasam, Main ne tumhen sirf Allah ki ita'at mein peeth aur Allah ki nafarmani mein tez jaanaa. Amr ne apni riwayat mein al-Minhal se, zazaada se, al-Bara se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kaha: Us par baharaa-guungaa farishta muqarrar kiya jata hai jis ke paas hathauraa hota hai — agar pahaad ko us se mara jata to woh mitti ho jata — ya unhon ne kaha: Mitti haddiyan — aur woh use us se aisi cota marte hai jise saqalaina ke siwa tamam makhlooq sunatii hai; phir rooh us mein ne jati hai aur woh use doosri cota marte hai"
"792","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Simak bin Harb se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir bin Samurah ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Ma'iz ko do martaba karte dekha, phir unhen rajm ka hukm dete hue"
"793","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Simak bin Harb se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir bin Samurah ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khutba dete suna, farmate hue: Qayamat se pahle jhoote honge — phir Aap ne ek baat kahi jo main na samjha, to Main ne apne walid se kaha: Aap ne Kya kaha? Unhon ne kaha: Un se bacho"
"794","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Simak bin Harb se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir bin Samurah ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Yeh deen hamesha qayam rahega; Musalmanon ka ek giroh us ke liye laregaa yahan tak ke qayamat qayam ho"
"795","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Simak bin Harb se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir bin Samurah ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khade khutba dete dekha, phir baithte hue, phir khade kar khutba dete hue"
"796","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Simak bin Harb se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir bin Samurah se kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Kya karte the jab Fajr ki namaz padhte the? Unhon ne kaha: Woh apni baithne ki jagah mein baithte the yahan tak ke suraj nikalataa."
"797","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Simak bin Harb se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke kandhe par mohar dekhi ande tarah"
"798","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Simak se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir ko kehte suna: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath bin Woh-dahadaaha ke janaze mein the, jabke woh ghode par the jo un ke sath kuudataa tha, aur ham un ke gird jaldi kar rahe the"
"799","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais ne da'wa kiya Simak bin Harb se, Jabir bin Samurah se riwayat karte hue, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ghode par sawari sirf un ke dafan se farigh hone ke baad ki"
"800","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Simak bin Harb se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir bin Samurah ko kehte suna: Woh Madinah ko yasriba kehte the, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us ka naam Taibah rakha"
"801","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Simak se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir bin Samurah ko suna, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke safed balon ka zikr karte hue, kehte hue: Jab woh us mein tel lagate to woh na dikhataa, aur jab tel na lagate to woh dikhataa."
"802","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Simak bin Harb se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir bin Samurah ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Zuhr aur Asr mein padhte the: Raat ki qasam jab ghalib, aur us ke jaisi, aur Fajr ki namaz mein us se lamba padhte the"
"803","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Simak bin Harb se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir bin Samurah ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha jab Ma'iz bin Malik ko rajm kiya gaya — chhote qad mazboot mukammal wale aadmi jab woh unhen rajm se farigh hue to farmaya: Jab bhi ham Allah ke raste mein muhim par nikalte hain, mein se ek peeche rah jata hai, ek ke mimiyaane jaisa mimiyaataa hua, mein se ek ko mutthi bhar khajur deta hua Beshak, agar Allah mujhe mein se kisi par qaboo de to main use ibrat banaauungaa."
"804","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Simak ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir bin Samurah ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki aankhen halke rang ki surkhi liye hue, eriyaan patli, aur munh kushada tha"
"805","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Simak bin Harb ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Saur ko Jabir bin Samurah se riwayat karte suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bakri ke gosht se wuzu ke bare mein poocha gaya aur Aap ne us ki ijazat di; un se bakriyon ke baithne ki jaghon mein namaz ke bare mein poocha gaya — ya unhon ne kaha: Un ki raat ki baithne ki jaghon, Abu Dawud ko shak hua — aur Aap ne us ki ijazat di; un se oont ke gosht se wuzu ke bare mein poocha gaya aur Aap ne us ka hukm diya; aur un se oonton ke baithne ki jaghon mein namaz ke bare mein poocha gaya aur Aap ne us se mana kiya, use napasand karte hue"
"806","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya Simak se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir bin Samurah ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khutba dete suna, farmate hue: Islam hamesha ghalib rahega yahan tak ke barah khalifa — phir Aap ne ek baat kahi jo main na samjha, to Main ne apne walid se kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Kya farmaya? Unhon ne kaha: Sab Quraish se"
"807","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya Simak bin Harb se, Jabir se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ma'iz ko rajm kiya, aur kodon ka zikr na kiya"
"808","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya Simak bin Harb se, Jabir se Hammad ne kaha: Aur Sayyar bin Salamah ne mujhe Abu Barzah al-Aslami se bayan kiya — mein se ek ne kaha: Bilal suraj dhalate azan dete the, aur doosre ne kaha: Bilal suraj nisfunnahaara se guzarne par azan dete the"
"809","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek ne ham se bayan kiya Simak se, Jabir bin Samurah se, unhon ne kaha: Bilal azan ko us ke waqt se aage na karte the, halanke woh kabhi iqamat thodi der karte the"
"810","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek aur Qais ne ham se bayan kiya Simak bin Harb se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir bin Samurah se kaha: Kya tum Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath baithe? Unhon ne kaha: Haan; woh lamba khamosh aur kam chamakne wale the un ke sahaba kabhi un ki maujudgi mein ek-doosre ko sheara sunate the, aur apne maamalaata ki baat, aur woh hanste the, aur shayad woh muskuraye"
"811","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya Simak se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jabir bin Samurah se kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khutba kaise dete the? Unhon ne kaha: Jo tumhen bayan kare ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) baithkar khutba dete the, use jhuthalaao; Main ne unhen khade kar khutba dete dekha main ne kaha: Un ka khutba kya tha? Unhon ne kaha: Woh muatadila tha; woh Allah ki Kitab ki aayaat padhte aur aisi baat kehte jise woh logon ko nasihat karte"
"812","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya Simak se, Jabir bin Samurah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Zuhr padhte the tumhari namaz jaisi, Asr tumhari namaz jaisi, Maghrib tumhari namaz jaisi, aur Isha thodi der karte the"
"813","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne ham se bayan kiya Simak se, Jabir se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Zuhr aur Asr mein padhte the: Aasman aur raat ko aane wale ki qasam, aur: Taaron wale aasman ki qasam"
"814","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya Simak se, Jabir bin Samurah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Yahudi aadmi aur Yahudi aurat ko rajm kiya"
"815","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek ne ham se bayan kiya Simak se, Jabir se, ke ek aadmi ki al-Harrah mein untni thi aur Us ne use ek aadmi ke paas amanat rakhi, halanke woh beemar thi jab woh marne wali thi to us ki biwi ne us se kaha: Kaash tum use zabah karte aur ham us mein se khate! Us ne inkar kiya, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur is ka zikr Aap se kiya Aap ne farmaya: Kya tumhare paas tumhen kafi hai? Us ne kaha: Nahin Aap ne farmaya: To use khao — halanke woh mar chuki thi unhon ne kaha: Ham ne us ki charbi, gosht aur ghee mein se koi bees din khaya phir woh us ke Malik se mila, Jis ne us se kaha: Tum ne use kyun na zabah kiya? Us ne kaha: Mujhe tum haya aai"
"816","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek ne ham se bayan kiya Simak se, Jabir bin Samurah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) donon Eidain ke liye azan nahin dilavaate the"
"817","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek ne ham se bayan kiya Simak se, Jabir bin Samurah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Lailatul-Qadr ko aakhri das raaton mein talash karo"
"818","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek ne ham se bayan kiya Simak bin Harb se, Jabir bin Samurah se, ke ek aadmi ne teer ki nok se khudakushii ki, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us par namaz na padhi"
"819","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek ne ham se bayan kiya Simak bin Harb se, Jabir bin Samurah se, unhon ne kaha: Jab ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aate to jahan pahunchte baithe jate"
"820","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sulaiman bin Mu'az ne ham se bayan kiya Simak bin Harb se, Jabir bin Samurah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Makkah mein ek pathar hai jo un raaton mein mujhe salam karta tha mein main bheja gaya; main use pahchanta hun jab us ke paas se guzarne hun"
"821","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya Simak bin Harb se, Jabir bin Samurah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Khusaro ka safed mahal Musalmanon ke giroh se fath hoga"
"822","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya Simak se, Jabir se, unhon ne kaha: Bilal suraj dhalate azan dete the, kabhi iqamat thodi der karte hue aur kabhi thodi jaldi karte hue; jahan tak azan ka miskeen hai, woh use us ke waqt se aage na karte the"
"823","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shaiban ne ham se bayan kiya Ash'as Ibn Abi ash-riwayat se, Jaafar Ibn Abi Saur se, Jabir bin Samurah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamen Aashura ka roza rakhne ka hukm dete the, hamen us par ubhaarate hue aur hamare bare mein us ki parataala karte hue jab Ramazan farz kiya gaya to Unhon ne hamen na us ka hukm diya na us se mana kiya, na hamare bare mein us ki parataala ki"
"824","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya Aaiz bin nasiiba se, Jabir bin Samurah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko namaz mein apni ungli se ishara karte dekha; jab Aap ne salam phera to Main ne unhen farmate suna: Aey Allah, main tujh se tamam bhalai mangta hun, jo main us mein janta hun aur jo main nahin janta, aur main tujh se tamam burayi se panah mangta hun, jo main us mein janta hun aur jo main nahin jaanta"
"825","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya al-A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne al-Musayyab bin Rafi' ko Tameem bin Tarafah se, Jabir bin Samurah se riwayat karte suna, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne logon ko apne hath uthate dekha aur farmaya: Unhon ne apne hath uthae hain jaise woh bidake ghodon ki dummen hon; namaz mein sukoon se Hazrat"
"826","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya Simak bin Harb se, Jabir bin Samurah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Jume ko khutba dete dekha, Quran se padhte hue aur logon ko nasihat karte hue"
"827","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya mujaalida se, ash-Sha'bi se, an-Nu'man bin Bashir se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Adam ke bete mein gosht ka tukda hai; agar woh durust ho to us ke baqi mukammal durust hai, aur agar woh bigaraa ho to us ke baqi mukammal bigaraa hai — aur woh dil hai"
"828","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya mujaalida se, ash-Sha'bi se, an-Nu'man bin Bashir se, ke un ke walid ne unhen hadiya diya, chahte hue ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) us ki gawahi den Aap ne farmaya: Kya Tum ne apni tamam aulaad ko diya jaisa Tum ne use diya? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhara farz hai ke apni aulaad mein aadil karo, jaise un ka farz hai ke tum neki karen"
"829","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya al-mujaalida se, ash-Sha'bi se, unhon ne kaha: An-Nu'man bin Bashir, Rahimahullah ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Mu'minon ki misaal aur un ki se muhabbat, ulafata aur rehmat ki misaal mukammal jaisi hai; jab us ka hissa shikayat kare to baqi hissa bekhvaabii aur bukhar se jawab deta hai"
"830","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya Simak bin Harb se, jinhon an-Nu'man bin Bashir ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) saf seedhi karte the yahan tak ke use teer ya neze jaisa banaate. jab Aap ne samjha ke Ham ne woh un se seekha aur samjha to Aap ne ek aadmi ko alag khade dekha us ka seena saf se baahara. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Allah ke bando, tum apni safen seedhi karoge, ya Allah, Aziz Wajleel tum phoot daalegaa."
"831","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Simak bin Harb se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne an-Nu'man bin Bashir ko khutba dete suna apne ooni kapde pahne hue, kehte hue: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khutba dete suna, farmate hue: Main tumhen aag se daraataa hun — is hadd tak ke agar aadmi falan jagah hota to us ki awaz sunta"
"832","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya Simak bin Harb se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne an-Nu'man bin Bashir ko Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Mu'minon ki misaal mukammal jaisi hai; jab us ka hissa dukhe to baqi hissa jawab deta hai"
"833","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya Simak bin Harb se, an-Nu'man bin Bashir se, unhon ne kaha: Agar safar mein aadmi ke paas us ki sawari ho us ke Tosha aur pani par, aur woh bhataka jae, aur woh uuncaaii par chadhe aur dekhe lekin kuch na dekhe; jabke woh aisa ho, Us ne use dekha, us ke Tosha aur pani par — to Allah apne bande ki Tauba par us se zyada shadeed khush hota hai jitna sawari wala apni sawari par Abu Dawud ne Ise Hammad se marfu' nahin kiya, jabke bin al-asbahaanii ne Ise Shareek se, Simak se, an-Nu'man bin Bashir se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se marfu' kiya"
"834","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya Ibrahim bin Muhammad bin al-muntashira se, un ke walid se, Habib bin Salim se, an-Nu'man bin Bashir se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Jume ki namaz aur donon Eidain mein padhte the: Apne Parwardigar, buland ke naam ki tasbih kar, aur: Kya tumhare paas badal jane wali ki khabar aai?"
"835","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hushaim ne ham se bayan kiya Abu Bishr se, Habib bin Salim se, ke ek aurat an-Nu'man bin Bashir ke paas aai aur kaha: Mere shauhar ne meri bandi se meri ijazat ke baghair sohbat ki an-Nu'man ne kaha: Mere paas is mein faisalakun hukm hai jo Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se liya: Agar Tum ne use ijazat na di hoti to main use rajm karta, aur agar Tum ne use ijazat di hoti to main use sau kode deta logon ne us se kaha: Afsos tum par, tumhare bachche ke baap ko rajm kiya jaega! To woh aai aur kaha: Main ne use ijazat di thi, lekin ghairat ne mujhe us par ubhara jo main ne kaha! To Unhon ne use sau kode lagaye"
"836","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hushaim ne ham se bayan kiya Abu Bishr se, Habib bin Salim se, an-Nu'man bin Bashir se, unhon ne kaha: Main logon mein is namaz ke waqt ke bare mein sab janne wala hun — ya'ni aakhri raat ki namaz; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) use teesri raat chand ke padhte the"
"837","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne an-Nu'man bin Bashir ko khutba dete suna, kehte hue: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Dozakhiyon mein azab mein sab halka aadmi hai jis ke paon ke gaddhon mein do angaare — ya angare — honge jise us ka dimaagha ubalegaa."
"838","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Murrah ne mujhe khabar di, Salim Ibn Abi al-Ja'd ko kehte suni: Main ne an-Nu'man bin Bashir ko kehte suna: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Tum apni safen seedhi karoge, ya Allah, Aziz Wajleel tum phoot daalegaa."
"839","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Asim se, Abu Qilabah se, an-Nu'man bin Bashir se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, ke Aap ne grahana mein namaz padhi, do martaba ruku aur sajdah karte hue"
"840","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Mansoor se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Zarr ko yusaia al-Hazrami se, an-Nu'man bin Bashir se riwayat karte suna, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Dua ibadat hai tumhare Rabb ne farmaya: Mujh se mango; main tumhen jawab dunga"
"841","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya Jabir al-Ju'fi se, Abu Azib se, an-Nu'man bin Bashir se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, unhon ne kaha: Qisas sirf lohe ke hathyar se hai"
"842","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya Jabir al-Ju'fi se, Abu Azib se, an-Nu'man bin Bashir se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath the aur unhen farmate suna: Qayamat se pahle andherii raat ke phir jaise fitne honge; aadmi subah mu'min hoga aur Sham kafir, aur Sham mu'min hoga aur subah kafir; qaum duniya ki thodi qeemat par aakhirat ka apna hissa becengii."
"843","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya Alqamah bin Marsad se, Sulaiman bin Buraidah al-Aslami se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Fajr ki namaz padhi, phir ek dehati ne surkh oont ke liye pukara — masjid mein kehte hue Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum na paao. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Yeh masajid sirf usi ke liye banai gayin jis ke liye woh banai gaen"
"844","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya Alqamah bin Marsad se, Sulaiman bin Buraidah se, un ke walid se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne namazen ek hi wuzu se padhin"
"845","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Alqamah bin Marsad ne ham se bayan kiya Sulaiman bin Buraidah se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Kya jannat mein ghode hain? Kyunke main unhen pasand karta hun! Aap ne farmaya: Agar tum yeh pasand karte ho to tumhare paas surkh yaqoot ka ghoda laya jaega jo jannat mein tumhen lekar uregaa jahan tum chaho aur ek aadmi ne un se kaha: main oont pasand karta hun; Kya jannat mein oont hain? Aap ne farmaya: Aey Allah ke bande, agar tum jannat mein dakhil kiye gae to tumhare liye us mein woh hoga jo tumhari jaan chahe aur tumhari aankhen khush hon"
"846","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya Alqamah bin Marsad se, Sulaiman bin Buraidah se, un ke walid se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qabron ki ziyarat ki ijazat di"
"847","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Aban ne ham se bayan kiya Alqamah bin Marsad se, Sulaiman bin Buraidah se, un ke walid se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, ke Aap ne Ma'iz ko chaar martaba diya"
"848","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Musanna bin Sa'id ne ham se bayan kiya Qatadah se, Abdullah bin Buraidah se, unhon ne kaha: Buraidah al-Aslami ne khuraasaana mein marte aadmi ki iyadat ki aur us ki peshani par pasiinaa dekha Buraidah ne kaha: Allahu Akbar! Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Mu'min peshani par paseene ke sath marta hai"
"849","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Uyainah bin Abdur Rahman ne ham se bayan kiya apne walid se, Buraidah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ek din paidal nikla aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha, samajhte hue ke woh qazae-hajat ka irada karte hain, to main un ke samne se guzra yahan tak ke Unhon ne mujhe dekha Unhon ne mujhe bulwaya aur main un ke paas aaya; Unhon ne mera hath pakda aur ham sath chale ek aadmi hamare samne namaz padh raha tha, bahut ruku aur sajde karte hue Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum samajhte ho woh shauhrat kar raha hai? Main ne kaha: Allah aur us ke Rasulullah behtar jante hain Unhon ne mera hath chhoda aur farmaya: Tum par phir hidayat lazim hai, kyunke jo is deen se takkara milayega, woh us par ghalib jayega"
"850","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya Yahya se, Abu Qilabah se, ke Abu al-Malih ne unhen bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ham Buraidah al-Ansari ke sath badal wale din muhim mein the, aur unhon ne kaha: Jaldi namaz padho, kyunke Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna — ya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Asr ki namaz chhore, us ka amal batil kiya gaya"
"851","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Savvaaba bin Utbah al-Mahri ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Buraidah al-Aslami ne ham se bayan kiya apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Fitr ke din nahin nikalte the yahan tak ke khate, aur qurbani ke din nahin khate the yahan tak ke zabah karte"
"852","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shareek ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakr al-ahamarii ne mujhe khabar di, bin Buraidah al-Aslami se, un ke walid se, ke Khuza'ah ka ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein mara, aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas us ki wirasat laya gayi Aap ne farmaya: Dekho Kya koi waris hai Unhon ne talash kiya lekin us ke liye koi waris na paya, aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khabar di gayi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use Khuza'ah ke sab bade ko do"
"853","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya Ibrahim as-sakasakii se, Abdullah Ibn Abi Aufa se, ke ek aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main Quran achchi tarah nahin janta; Kya Quran mein se kuch hai jo kafi ho? Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kaho: Subhanallah, Alhamdulillah, La ilaha illallah, Allahu Akbar, aur La hawla wala quwwata Allah hai phir aadmi hata, phir wapas aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, yeh Allah ke liye hai; mere liye Kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Aey Allah, mujhe muaf kar, mujh par raham kar, mujhe afiyat de, mujhe hidayat de, aur mujhe rizq de aadmi ne unhen apne hath par das ginaya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jahan tak is ka miskeen hai, Us ne apne hath bhalai se bhar liye"
"854","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Sulaiman ash-Shaibani se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah Ibn Abi Aufa ko suna, jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahabi the, kehte hue: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne surkh banane ki nabeez se mana farmaya main ne kaha: Aur safed? Unhon ne kaha: Main nahin jaanta"
"855","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Muhammad Ibn Abi al-mujaalida se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Burdah aur Abdullah bin Shaddad ne salaf ke bare mein ikhtilaf kiya, to Unhon ne mujhe Ibn Abi Aufa ke paas bheja aur Main ne un se poocha unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein gehn, jau, kishmish aur khajoor ke liye salaf karte the, un logon se jin ke paas woh na hota unhon ne kaha: To Ham ne bin Abza se poocha aur Unhon ne waisa hi kaha"
"856","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya ash-Shaibani se, Ibn Abi Aufa se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne paaltu gadhon ke gosht se mana farmaya"
"857","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Qais ne ham se bayan kiya Ubaid bin al-Hasan se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Abi Aufa ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apni dua mein farmate the: Aey Allah, Tere liye tareef hai aasman bhar, zameen bhar, aur us ke baad jo Tu chahe bhara. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Qais ne apni riwayat mein kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) yeh kehte the jab ruku se sar uthate"
"858","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Abu yaafuura se, jinhon Ibn Abi Aufa ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath saat muhimon mein hissa liya, un ke sath tiddiyan khate hue"
"859","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Amr bin Murrah se, jinhon Ibn Abi Aufa ko kehte suna: Jab ghar Sadqa bhejte to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) un par barkat ki dua karte mere walid ne Sadqa diya, to Aap ne farmaya: Aey Allah, Abu Aufa ke gharwalon par barkat bhej"
"860","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Murrah ne mujhe khabar di, Ibn Abi Aufa ko suni, jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahabi the — jinhon baiate-rizavaana dekhi thi — kehte hue: Us din ham terah sau the, aur Aslam us din Muhajireen ka aathvaan hissa the"
"861","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-haarisha bin Sulaim al-kuufii ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Talha al-Yami ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah Ibn Abi Aufa se poocha: Kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne wasiyat ki? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin main ne kaha: Unhon ne hamen vasiiyaton ka hukm kyun diya jabke Unhon ne wasiyat na ki? Unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne Allah, Aziz Wajleel ki Kitab ki wasiyat ki"
"862","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-hasharaja ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id bin jumahaana ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main Abdullah Ibn Abi Aufa ke paas aaya, jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahabi the, aur Unhon ne mujh se kaha: tum kaun ho? Woh us waqt nabina the main ne kaha: Main Sa'id bin jumahaana hun unhon ne kaha: Tumhare walid ko Kya hua? Main ne kaha: Azaariqaa ne unhen qatl kiya unhon ne kaha: Allah un par raham kare; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen bayan kiya ke woh aag ke kutte hain"
"863","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Firas se, mudrika bin Umarah se, Ibn Abi Aufa se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Banda zina nahin karta jabke use mu'min kar kare, na chori karta hai jabke use mu'min kar churaye, na sharab peeta hai jabke use mu'min kar piye, na kiimatii luuta luutataa hai mu'min wajah"
"864","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Hakam ne ham se bayan kiya ek aadmi se, Ibn Abi Aufa se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, usi taraha."
"865","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya Ubaid bin al-Hasan se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah Ibn Abi Aufa ko kehte suna: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) is dua se dua karte the: Aey Allah, Tere liye tareef hai aasman bhar, zameen bhar, aur us ke baad jo Tu chahe bhara. Shu'bah ne kaha: Aur Main ne majazaaa bin zahir ko kehte suna: Main ne Ibn Abi Aufa ko is dua ka zikr karte suna, us mein karte hue: Aey Allah, mujhe barf, ole aur thande pani se pak kar; Aey Allah, mujhe gunahon aur khaton se saaf kar jaise safed kapda mail se saaf kiya jata hai"
"866","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibrahim al-hajarii ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Abi Aufa ko un ki beti ke janaze mein khaccara par sawar dekha woh vaavailaa karne wali aurton ke paas se guzre aur kaha: Nohaa ki ciikhon se bacho, kyunke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us se mana farmaya; tum mein se ek apne aansuon se bahaae."
"867","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya Ghailan bin Jarir al-miavalii se, Mutarrif bin Abdullah bin ash-Shikhkhir se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Imran bin Husain ke sath Ali Ibn Abi Talib ke peeche namaz padhi jab woh sajdah karte to Allahu Akbar kehte, jab sar uthate to Allahu Akbar kehte, aur jab donon sajdon se uthte to Allahu Akbar kehte jab ham namaz se farigh hue to Imran ne mera hath pakda aur kaha: Inhon ne hamen Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki namaz yaad dilaaii — ya unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne hamen Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki namaz padhai — Ghailan ko shak hua"
"868","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Humaid bin Hilal al-Adawi ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Mutarrif bin Abdullah bin ash-Shikhkhir ko Imran bin Husain se, Rahimahullah riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne mujh se kaha: Kya main tumhen hadees na sunaauun jis se Allah tumhen nafa de? Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hajj aur umrah jama kiya, phir use mana na kiya, na us ke mana mein Quran tarah; aur farishte mujhe salam karte the, lekin jab Main ne apne ko lagaye to woh mujh se band hua, aur jab Main ne use chhoda to woh mujh par aaya"
"869","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya Yazid ar-rishka se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Mutarrif ko Imran bin Husain se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kaha gaya: Kya jannatiyon dozakhiyon se pehchane jate hain? Aap ne farmaya: Han unhon ne kaha: To amal karne wale kis liye amal karte hain? Aap ne farmaya: Har ek us ke liye amal karta hai jis ke liye woh paida kiya gaya aur aasan kiya gaya"
"870","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jaafar bin Sulaiman Woh-dubaii ne ham se bayan kiya, Yazid ar-rishka ne ham se bayan kiya, Mutarrif bin Abdullah bin ash-Shikhkhir se, Imran bin Husain se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ali ko lashkar mein bheja, aur Unhon ne un se kuch dekha jise Unhon ne napasand kiya chaar aadmi ittefaq hue aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Ali ke kiye ki khabar dene ka ahd kiya Imran ne kaha: Jab ham safar se lautte to apne gharwalon ke paas na jate yahan tak ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aate, unhen salam karte, aur unhen dekhte chaar aadmi aae; mein se ek khada hua aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya Tum ne nahin dekha ke Ali ne aisa-aisa kiya? Aap ne us se munh phera phir doosra khada hua aur waisa hi kaha, aur Aap ne us se munh phera phir teesra khada hua aur waisa hi kaha, aur Aap ne us se munh phera phir cauthaa khada hua aur waisa hi kaha Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Unhen aur Ali ko Kya! Ali mujh se hain aur main un se hun, aur woh mere baad har mu'min ke wali hain"
"871","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Mutarrif se, Imran bin Husain se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khujate se mana farmaya, lekin hamen lagaye gaya, aur ham na kamyab hue na falah pae"
"872","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Mutarrif se, Imran bin Husain se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Mahine ke siraara ke roze rakho Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ya'ni iftar ke baad"
"873","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu at-Tayyah se, Mutarrif bin Abdullah se, ke un ki do biwiyan thin woh mein se ek ke paas aae aur us ne kaha: Kya tum falaanii se aae ho, ya'ni us ki doosri biwi? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin, lekin main Imran bin Husain ke sath tha, jinhon khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jannat mein sab kam aurten hain"
"874","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu al-ashahaba, Jarir bin Hazim, salma bin zuraira, Hammad bin naajiiha aur Sakhr bin Juwairiyah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Raja se, Imran bin Husain aur Ibn Abbas se, Rahimahullah jinhon kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ne jannat mein dekha aur us ke aksar wale ghareeb the, aur Main ne aag mein dekha aur us ke aksar wali aurten thin"
"875","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, al-Hasan se, Imran bin Husain se, ke ek buddha Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Allah ke Rasulullah, mera beta mar gaya; us ki wirasat mein mera hissa Kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Tumhare liye chathaa. jab woh hata to Aap ne use lautaakara bulaya aur farmaya: Tumhare liye doosra chathaa. jab woh hata to Aap ne use lautaakara bulaya aur farmaya: Doosra chhata zyada taqseem hai"
"876","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, al-Hasan se, Imran bin Husain se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam), safar mein hote hue, donon aayaton se apni awaz buland ki: Aey logo, apne Rabb se daro, us ke qaul lekin Allah ka azab shadeed hai tak unhon ne kaha: To Unhon ne sawariyan daudaain aur jana ke woh kuch kehne wale hain jab woh un ke gird jama hue to Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum jante ho woh kaun-sa din hai? Unhon ne kaha: Allah aur us ke Rasulullah behtar jante hain Aap ne farmaya: Woh din hai jab Allah, Aziz Wajleel Adam se farmata: Aey Adam, Utho aur aag ka wafd bhejo. woh kahenge: Mere Rabb, aag ka wafd Kya hai? Woh farmata: Har hazaar mein se nau sau ninyanve aag mein aur ek jannat mein to woh mayus hue yahan tak ke mein se koi apne dant na dikhaataa tha jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne woh dekha to farmaya: Amal karo aur khushkhabri pao; us zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, tum do makhaluuqon ke sath ho jo kisi cheez mein zahir nahin hoti magar use zyada tadaad wali banaatii hain, yaajuuja-maajuuja aur Adam ki aulaad aur ibaliisa ki aulaad mein se halaak hone walon ke sath amal karo aur khushkhabri pao; us zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, tum logon mein oont ke pahlu par tila ya janwar ki agli taang par nishan jaise ho"
"877","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Amir Salih bin rustama ne ham se bayan kiya, Kaseer bin shinazira se, al-Hasan se, Imran bin Husain se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) kam hi hamare darmiyan khade hote the baghair hamen sadqe ki taraghiiba diye aur hamen chehre se mana kiye unhon ne kaha: Musale mein se hai ke aadmi apni naak katne ki Nazr mane, aur musale mein se hai ke aadmi paidal Hajj karne ki Nazr maane. to agar tum mein se ek paidal Hajj ki Nazr mane to woh qurbani ka janwar de aur sawar ho"
"878","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu hurraa ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hasan se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) safar mein the aur woh soe, aur na jage yahan tak ke suraj nikal aaya Unhon ne namaz padhi, aur kaha: Allah ke Rasulullah, Kya ham apni namaz mein kuchh karen? Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah tumhen sood se mana karta hai phir bhi tum use qabool karta hai! Aur yeh hadees Hisham bin Hassan se, al-Hasan se, Imran bin Husain se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bhi riwayat ki jati hai"
"879","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu qazaaa se, al-Hasan se; aur Hammad bin Salamah ne, Humaid se, al-Hasan se, Imran bin Husain se, Hammad ne Ise Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se marfu' kiya Abu Dawud ne kaha: Mujhe yeh Shu'bah se marfu' yaad nahin Aap ne farmaya: Islam mein na daud mein aage jahan ki dhakkaa-mukkii hai, na ohade se nafa uthana, na shighar nikaaha."
"880","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abdul-waris ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin az-Zubair al-hanzalii se, un ke walid se, Imran bin Husain se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Gusse mein koi Nazr nahin, aur us ka kaffara qasam ka kaffara hai"
"881","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid se, Abu nazaraa se, Imran bin Husain se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Makkah mein do rak'aten padhin phir salam phera, aur farmaya: Aey Makkah walon, apni namaz poori karo, kyunke ham musafir log hain"
"882","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Jamrah ne mujhe khabar di, kehte hue: Main ne zahadaama bin muzarriba ko Imran bin Husain se riwayat karte suna, jinhon kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein behtareen meri piirhii hai, aur Unhon ne Hisham ki hadees jaisi kuch baat zikr ki"
"883","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Azaraa bin Sabit al-Ansari ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Yahya bin Uqail ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Ya'mur se, Abu al-Aswad Woh-dualii se, kehte hue: Imran bin Husain ne mujhe khabar di ke Juhainah ya Muzainah ke ek aadmi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha aur kaha: Allah ke Rasulullah, jo log karte hain, Kya woh un ke liye muqaddar muamla hai us taqdeer se jo un se pahle guzar, ya kuch jise tum un ke paas jane jis se un par hujjat qayam ho? Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Lekin woh jo un ke liye muqaddar kiya gaya aur un ke liye taqseem gaya us taqdeer se jo pahle guzarii. unhon ne kaha: Phir unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasulullah, to woh amal kyun karte hain? Aap ne farmaya: Amal karo, kyunke har ek us ke liye aasan kiya gaya hai jis ke liye woh paida kiya gaya aur Aap ne yeh aayat padhi: Jaan ki qasam aur Jis ne use durust kiya, phir use us ki burai aur parahezagaarii ki ilhaama ki"
"884","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu at-Tayyah se, Hafs al-Laisi se, Imran bin Husain se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mitti ke banane ki nabeez se mana farmaya"
"885","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Abu Qilabah se, Abu al-Muhallab se, Imran bin Husain se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas al-Uqaili beriyon mein laya gaya"
"886","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Abu Qilabah se, Abu al-Muhallab se, Imran bin Husain se, ke ek aadmi ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein apne chhe ghulam aazad kiye Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un ke darmiyan qura dala, do aazad kiye, aur chaar ghulam rakhe"
"887","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Wuhaib ne ham se bayan kiya, Khalid se, Abu Qilabah se, Abu al-Muhallab se, Imran se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, usi tarah"
"888","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Abu Qilabah se, Abu al-Muhallab se, Imran bin Husain se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne sahaba ke do aadmiyon ko jo mushrikon ke hathon mein the ek qaidi aadmi ke badle churaayaa."
"889","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Khalid al-Hazza se, Abu Qilabah se, Abu al-Muhallab se, Imran bin Husain se, jinhon kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Zuhr ya Asr teen rak'aten padhin phir salam phera Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se bin al-Khirbaq ek aadmi ne kaha: Kya namaz chhoti ki gayi? Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne poocha, aur woh waisa hi tha jaisa unhon ne kaha tha unhon ne kaha: To Aap ne ek rak'at padhi, phir salam phera, phir do sajde kiye, phir salam phera"
"890","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, ke Abu Qilabah ne unhen khabar di, Abu al-Muhallab se, Imran bin Husain se, ke Juhainah ki ek aurat Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aai jabke woh zina se hamla thi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us ke saraparasta ko us ke sath achcha sulook ka hukm diya, aur farmaya: Jab woh apna bojh janam to use mere paas aao Us ne aisa kiya Aap ne us ke bare mein hukm diya, to us ke kapde us par mendhiyan bandhe gae, phir Aap ne us ke bare mein hukm diya aur use rajm kiya gaya phir Aap ne us par namaz padhi Umar ne un se kaha: Allah ke Rasulullah, Kya tum us par namaz padhte ho jabke Us ne zina kiya? Aap ne farmaya: Us ne aisi Tauba ki hai ke agar woh Madinah walon mein aadha jae to unhen gher le Kya Tum ne is se behtar kuch paya ke Us ne apne ko Allah ke liye ki kiya?"
"891","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Harb bin Shaddad ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, ke Abu Qilabah ne unhen khabar di, ke Abu al-Muhallab ne unhen khabar di, Imran se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhara bhai Najashi mar gaya, to us par namaz padho unhon ne kaha: To ham un ke peeche safabanda hue jaise murdon ke liye safabanda hote hain, aur Ham ne us par namaz padhi jaise murdon par namaz padhte hain"
"892","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, jinhon Abu miraayaa ko suna, Imran bin Husain se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah, Aziz Wajleel ki nafarmani mein koi ita'at nahin"
"893","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, jinhon Zurarah ko suna, Imran bin Husain se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne sahaba ke sath Zuhr padhi aur farmaya: Tum mein se Kis ne apne Parwardigar, buland ke naam ki tasbih padhi? Ek aadmi ne kaha: Diya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe ma'loom hua ke ek aadmi mujh se us mein takkara le raha tha Shu'bah ne kaha: To Main ne Qatadah se kaha: Jaise Unhon ne use napasand kiya! Unhon ne kaha: Agar woh use napasand karte to us se mana karte"
"894","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Zurarah se, Imran bin Husain se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein behtareen woh piirhii hai mein main bheja gaya, phir jo un ke baad aayenge, phir jo un ke baad aayein phir aisi qaum pahunchegi jo Nazr manegi lekin poori na karegi, khayanat karegi aur un par etibaara na kiya jaega, gawahi degi halanke un se mangi na gayi ho, aur mein motapa phailegaa."
"895","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, kehte hue: Main ne Abu as-Sawwar ko Imran bin Husain se riwayat karte suna, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Haya sirf bhalai aati hai bushaira bin Ka'b ne kaha: Hikmat mein kaha jata hai: Haya ka hissa waqar hai, aur haya ka hissa za'f hai! Imran ne kaha: Main tumhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karta hun aur tum mujhe kitabon se bayan karte ho!"
"896","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Khalid bin Rabah Abu al-Fazl ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu as-Sawwar al-Adawi ne ham se bayan kiya, ke Imran bin Husain ne unhen khabar di, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Haya tamam bhalai hai"
"897","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Subaih se, bin Sireen se, unhon ne kaha: Murdon par ronaa, ke use us ke liye azab diya jata hai, Imran bin Husain ke samne zikr kiya gaya unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne yeh farmaya"
"898","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Yazid bin Ibrahim ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Main ne Muhammad bin Sireen se Imran bin Husain ki hadees ke bare mein poocha, aur unhon ne kaha: Imran ne al-Hakam al-Ghifari se kaha, donon Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahabi the: Kya tum woh din jante ho jis din Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah, Aziz Wajleel ki nafarmani mein koi ita'at nahin? Unhon ne kaha: Han Imran ne kaha: Allahu Akbar, Allahu khabar"
"899","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Uqbah bin Khalid ya Khalid bin Uqbah, shak Abu Dawud se hai, ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Raja al-utaaridii ne ham se bayan kiya, Imran bin Husain se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) safar mein the Aap utre aur soe, aur Bilal se kaha: Hamen hamari namaz ke liye jagaao. woh na jage siwae un ki qafle aur kandhon par suraj ki garmi se Aap ne farmaya: Is jagah se chalo to woh chale, phir utre, aur Aap ne Bilal se kaha: Tumhen hamen jagaane se Kis ne roka? Unhon ne kaha: Jis ne tumhen sulaayaa Us ne mujhe sulaayaa. unhon ne kaha: To Unhon ne mitti se tayammum kiya, aur Aap ne Bilal ko hukm diya, jinhon azan di, aur Unhon ne do rak'aten padhin, phir woh khade hue aur Unhon ne subah ki namaz padhi"
"900","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid se, Abu nazaraa se, jinhon kaha: Ek jawan ne Imran bin Husain se safaron mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki namaz ke bare mein poocha unhon ne kaha: Is jawan ne mujh se safaron mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki namaz ke bare mein poocha, to unhen mujh se yaad rakho: Main kisi safar mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath nahin gaya magar Aap ne do rak'aten padhin yahan tak ke aur main un ke sath Hunain aur Taif mein hazir tha, aur Aap ne do rak'aten padhin phir Main ne un ke sath Hajj aur umrah kiya, aur Aap ne do rak'aten padhin, phir farmaya: Aey Makkah walon, namaz poori karo, kyunke ham musafir log hain phir Main ne Abu Bakr ke sath Hajj aur umrah kiya, aur Unhon ne do rak'aten padhin, phir farmaya: Aey Makkah walon, poori karo, kyunke ham musafir log hain phir Main ne Umar ke sath Hajj aur umrah kiya, aur Unhon ne do rak'aten padhin, phir farmaya: Namaz poori karo, kyunke ham musafir log hain phir Main ne Usman ke sath Hajj aur umrah kiya, aur Unhon ne do-do rak'aten padhin, phir Usman ne namaz poori ki"
"901","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Qurrah bin Khalid ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Sireen se, Abdur Rahman Ibn Abi Bakrah se, un ke walid se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mere baad gumrah kar na jao, ek-doosre ki gardenen marte hue"
"902","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abdul-Malik bin Umair ne mujhe khabar di, kehte hue: Main ne Abdur Rahman Ibn Abi Bakrah ko suna, ke un ke walid ne unhen likha jabke woh sijistaana mein the: Do aadmiyon ke darmiyan faisla na karo jabke tum gusse mein ho, kyunke Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Koi aadmi do aadmiyon ya do jhagarane walon ke darmiyan faisla na kare jabke woh gusse mein ho"
"903","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Abdullah Ibn Abi Raziyallahu se, Abdur Rahman Ibn Abi Bakrah se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya agar Muzainah, Juhainah, Aslam aur Ghifar Bani Tameem, Asad, Ghatfan aur Bani Amir bin Sa'sa'ah se behtar hon? Woh nuqsan aur barbaadii wale honge us zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, woh un se behtar hain"
"904","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Bishr se, jinhon Abdur Rahman Ibn Abi Bakrah ko apne walid se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Muzainah, Juhainah, Aslam aur Ghifar Bani Tameem, Asad, Ghatfan aur Bani Amir bin Sa'sa'ah se behtar hain"
"905","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Khalid al-Hazza se, kehte hue: Main ne Abdur Rahman Ibn Abi Bakrah ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne ek aadmi ka zikr hua aur Unhon ne us ki achchi tareef ki Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us aadmi se farmaya: Afsos tum par, Tum ne apne sathi ki gardan kaat di, Ise teen martaba kehte hue phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar tum mein se ek ko apne bhai ki tareef kare ho to kahe: Main falan ko samajhta hun, agar woh us mein woh janta ho, aur main Allah, Aziz Wajleel ke samne kisi ko pak nahin thaharaataa."
"906","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Khalid al-Hazza aur Salim bin Ubaidullah bin Salim se, Abdur Rahman Ibn Abi Bakrah se, un ke walid se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, jinhon farmaya: Eid ke do mahine naaqisa nahin: Ramazan aur Zu al-hijjaa."
"907","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah aur Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid se, Abdur Rahman Ibn Abi Bakrah se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Kaha gaya: Allah ke Rasulullah, kaun-se log behtareen hain? Aap ne farmaya: Woh jis ki umar lambi aur amal husn hon kaha gaya: Allah ke Rasulullah, phir kaun-se log badtareen hain? Aap ne farmaya: Woh jis ki umar lambi aur amal bure hon"
"908","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid se, Abdur Rahman Ibn Abi Bakrah se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Dajjal ke walidah-baap tees saal rehte hain baghair un ke liye bachcha paida hue phir un ke liye ladka paida hota hai, kana, sab zyada nuqasaanadeha aur sab kam nafa; us ki aankhen soti hain lekin us ka dil nahin sotaa. unhon ne kaha: Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us ke baap ka sifat bayan kiya: Lamba aadmi, gosht mein laghar, jaise us ki naak conca ho; aur us ki walidah lambi aurat, bade seene hai Abu Bakrah ne kaha: To Ham ne Madinah mein Yahud mein paida hue navajaata ki khabar suni main aur az-Zubair bin al-Awwam gae aur us ke walidah-baap ke paas dakhil hue, aur mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka bayan hazir tha ham ne kaha: Kya tumhara bachcha hai? Unhon ne kaha: Ham tees saal rahe baghair hamare liye bachcha paida hue, phir hamare liye bachcha paida hua, sab zyada nuqasaanadeha aur sab kam nafa; us ki aankhen soti hain lekin us ka dil nahin sotaa. ham un se nikle aur dekho woh tha, dhoop mein chadar mein jis leta, gunagunaataa hua Us ne apna sar khola aur kaha: Tum donon ne Kya kaha? Ham ne kaha: Kya Tum ne suna? Us ne kaha: Main sota hun, lekin mera dil nahin sotaa."
"909","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ali bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdur Rahman Ibn Abi Bakrah se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Ziyad ke sath Mu'awiyah ke paas wafd kar aae, aur Abu Bakrah hamare sath the ham un ke paas dakhil hue, aur Mu'awiyah ne un se kaha: hamen hadees bayan karo jo Tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suni; shayad Allah hamen us se nafa de unhon ne kaha: Haan; Allah ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) husn khwab pasand karte the aur un ke bare mein poochte the ek aadmi ne kaha: Allah ke Rasulullah, Main ne khwab dekha: Main ne dekha jaise aasman se meezan utari gayi, aur tum aur Abu Bakr tole gae, aur tum Abu Bakr se bhaari hue phir Abu Bakr aur Umar tole gae, aur Abu Bakr Umar se bhaari hue phir Umar aur Usman tole gae, aur Umar Usman se bhaari hue phir meezan uthai gayi! Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) us se naakhusha hue, phir farmaya: Nubuwwat ki khilafat, phir Allah badshahat dega jise caahegaa. Mu'awiyah gusse hue aur hamen gardanon se dhakelakara nikaalaa. Ziyad ne Abu Bakrah se kaha: Kya tumhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki koi hadees bayan karne ko na mili siwae is ki? Unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, main unhen is ke siwa kuch bayan nahin karunga yahan tak ke un se juda hun Ziyad ijazat mangte rahe yahan tak ke ham dakhil kiye gaye Mu'awiyah ne kaha: Abu Bakrah, hamen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se hadees bayan karo; shayad Allah hamen us se nafa de! Unhon ne kaha: To Main ne unhen phir waisi hi bayan ki jaisi meri pehli hadees thi Mu'awiyah ne un se kaha: tumhara baap na rahe, tum hamen karte ho ke ham Badshah hain! Ham Badshah hone par razi hain"
"910","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Al-Aswad bin Shaiban ne ham se bayan kiya, bahara bin marraara al-bakraavii se, Abu Bakrah se, unhon ne kaha: Jabke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath chal raha tha, aur doosra aadmi mere sath tha, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare darmiyan chal rahe the, woh do qabron par aaye Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: In qabron ke donon wale ab apni qabron mein azab diye ja rahe hain tum mein se kaun mujhe in khajooron se khajoor ki dal pahunchayega? Main apne sathi se daudaya aur us se aage hua, khajoor ki dal torii, aur use Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas laya Aap ne use upar se do hisson mein ciiraa, aadhi ek par aur aadhi doosri par rakhi, aur farmaya: Un ke liye halka hoga jab tak mein koi namii rahe unhen gheebat aur peshab ke liye azab diya ja raha hai"
"911","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abdul-Jalla ne ham se bayan kiya: Jaafar bin Maimun ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abdur Rahman Ibn Abi Bakrah ne mujhe khabar di, kehte hue: Main ne apne walid se kaha: Abba, main tumhen har subah dua karte sunta hun: Aey Allah, mujhe mere mukammal mein afiyat de; Aey Allah, mujhe meri samaat mein afiyat de; Aey Allah, mujhe meri basarat mein afiyat de; Tere siwa koi ma'bood nahin, Ise Sham ko teen martaba aur subah ko teen martaba kehte hue, aur kehte hue: Aey Allah, main kufr aur faqr se Teri panah mangta hun; Aey Allah, main qabr ke azab se Teri panah mangta hun; Tere siwa koi ma'bood nahin, Ise Sham ko teen martaba aur subah ko teen martaba kehte hue! Unhon ne kaha: Haan, mere bete; Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko un ke sath dua karte suna, to main un ki sunnat par chalna pasand karta hun"
"912","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abdul-Jalla ne ham se bayan kiya: Jaafar bin Maimun ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abdur Rahman Ibn Abi Bakrah ne mujhe khabar di, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ahem ki dua ke bare mein farmaya: Aey Allah, main Teri rehmat ki ummeed rakhta hun, to mujhe palaka jhapakne ke liye mere nafs ke hawale na kar, aur mere tamam kaam durust kar; Tere siwa koi ma'bood nahin"
"913","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Al-hasharaja bin Nubatah al-kuufii ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sa'id bin jumahaana ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdur Rahman Ibn Abi Bakrah se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat ka giroh Basrah ek zameen mein utaregaa, jahan un ki tadaad aur khajur barhengii. phir Bani qantuuraa, ke chehron aur chhoti aankhon wale aayenge yahan tak ke un ke dijalaa ek pul par utarenge. Musalman teen grohon mein bantenge: Ek giroh oonton ki dummen pakdega aur seharaa se ja liye, aur halaak hoga; ek giroh apne liye milayega aur kufr karega, yeh aur woh barabar; aur ek giroh apne gharwalon ko apni qafle ke peeche rakhega aur laregaa; un ke shaheed shaheed hain, aur Allah, Aziz Wajleel baqi ko fath dega"
"914","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abd Rabbihi bin Sa'id se, kehte hue: Main ne Abu Abdullah ko Sa'id Ibn Abi al-Hasan se khabar dete suna, ke Abu Bakrah un ke paas gawahi ke bare mein aaye ek aadmi apni jagah se un ke liye utha, aur Abu Bakrah ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar aadmi tumhare liye apni jagah se uthe to us mein na baitho, ya unhon ne kaha: Aadmi ko us ki jagah se na uthao phir us mein baitho, aur apna hath us ke kapde par na poncho jis ka tum Malik nahin"
"915","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: bin Fuzalah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hasan se, Abu Bakrah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne grahana ki namaz do rak'aten padhin"
"916","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Imran al-Qattan ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, al-Hasan se, Abu Bakrah se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use dekhne roza rakho aur use dekhne iftar karo; agar woh tum chhup jae to ginti tees din poori karo"
"917","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: bin Fuzalah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hasan se, Abu Bakrah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne namaz padhi, aur al-Hasan aae aur un ki peeth par sawar hue, to Aap ne unhen narmi se utara jab Aap apni namaz se farigh hue to unhen gale lagaya aur diya unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasulullah, Tum ne al-Hasan ke sath kuch kiya jo tum nahin karte the! Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mera yeh beta sardar hai; Allah, Aziz Wajleel us ke sath Musalmanon ke do grohon mein sulah karaaegaa."
"918","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid se, al-Hasan se, Abu Bakrah se, Rahimahullah jinhon kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne raat ki namaz aath raaten der ki Abu Bakrah ne kaha: Agar tum is namaz mein jaldi karte to hamare raat ke qiyam ke liye behtar hota! To Aap ne aisa kiya"
"919","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu hurraa ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hasan se, Abu Bakrah se, ke woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas pahunche jabke hue hue, aur saf se pahle ruku kiya jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apni namaz se farigh hue to farmaya: Yeh Kis ne kiya? Abu Bakrah ne kaha: Main ne kiya Aap ne farmaya: Allah tumhari hirs badhae, lekin doharaanaa nahin"
"920","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu hurraa ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hasan se, Abu Bakrah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne sahaba ke sath Khawf ki namaz padhi: Aap ne do rak'aten padhin, phir yeh un ki jaghon par gae, aur woh aae, aur Aap ne un ke sath do rak'aten padhin to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye chaar thin, aur logon ke liye do-do"
"921","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Uyainah bin Abdur Rahman bin jaushana ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abu Bakrah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Kabhi kamyab na hogi qaum jo apna muamla aurat ke hawale kare"
"922","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Uyainah ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abu Bakrah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo mu'ahid ko haq qatl kare, Allah ne us par jannat haram ki"
"923","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Uyainah ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abu Bakrah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Koi gunah zyada haqdar nahin ke us ka azab us ke karne wale ke liye duniya mein jaldi kiya jae, aakhirat mein us ke liye jama par, zulm aur qata rehmi se"
"924","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Uyainah ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Abu Bakrah ke samne Lailatul-Qadr ka zikr hua, aur Abu Bakrah ne kaha: Jahan tak mera miskeen hai, main use sirf aakhri das mein talash karta hun, us hadees ke baad jo Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suni; Main ne unhen farmate suna: Use aakhri das mein talash karo: Nau bache, ya saat bache, ya paanch bache, ya teen bache, ya aakhri raat Abu Bakrah Ramazan ke pahle bees mein namaz padhte the jaise saal ke baqi mein padhte the, aur jab aakhri das dakhil hote to maal karte"
"925","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Uyainah bin Abdur Rahman bin jaushana ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Mere walid ne mujhe khabar di, kehte hue: Abu Bakrah ke liye mitti ke banane mein nabeez banai jati thi Abu Barzah ghairahaazirii se aae jis mein woh ghaib the, aur Abu Bakrah ke ghar utre is se pahle ke apne ghar jaen, lekin Abu Bakrah ko ghar mein na paya woh un ki maisaa ek biwi ke samne ruke, un se Abu Bakrah aur un ki haalat ke bare mein poocha, aur dekha aur nabeez wala matakaa dekha unhon ne kaha: Is banane mein Kya hai? Us ne kaha: Abu Bakrah ke liye nabiiza. unhon ne kaha: Kaash Tum ne use mashkeeza mein rakha hota! Phir woh chale gaye Us ne nabeez ko mashkeeza mein منتقل karne ka hukm diya, aur use latkayein Abu Bakrah aae, aur Us ne unhen Abu Barzah aur un ke aane ke bare mein khabar, phir Unhon ne mashkeeza dekhi aur kaha: Yeh mashkeeza Kya hai? Us ne kaha: Abu Barzah ne aisa-aisa kaha, to Main ne tumhari nabeez ko mashkeeza mein منتقل kiya unhon ne kaha: Main us mein se kuch nahin piuungaa; Allah ki qasam, agar tum shehed ko banane mein rakho to woh mujh par haram hogi, aur agar tum sharab ko mashkeeza mein rakho to woh mere liye halal ho jaegi! Ham jante hain hamen kis se mana kiya gaya: Hamen Sallallahu, naqeer, lakdi aur ghade se mana kiya gaya jahan tak Sallallahu ka miskeen hai: Ham, Taif mein Saqeef ke log, kadduu lete the, us mein angoor ke uskhool khodate the, use dafan karte the, aur use chhodte the yahan tak ke woh khamiira hoti aur thaharatii. jahan tak naqeer ka miskeen hai: Yamama ke log khajoor ke tane ki nas khodate the, us mein pakeeza aur kachchi khajur phaarate the, aur use chhodte the yahan tak ke woh khamiira hoti aur thaharatii. jahan tak lakdi ka miskeen hai: Banane mein hamare paas sharab laya jati thi jahan tak ghade ka miskeen hai: Yeh bartan mein yeh taarakola hai"
"926","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Uyainah bin Abdur Rahman ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main Abdur Rahman bin Samurah ke janaze mein tha Ziyad aur un ke kuch aazad-karda janaze ke samne Aediyon par chalte the, kehte hue: Aahista, aahista, Allah tumhen barkat de! Abu Bakrah al-baade ki galiyon mein se ek mein un se mile, apne khaccara par un par hamla kiya aur kode se un par mara, aur kaha: Rasta do; us zaat ki qasam Jis ne Abu al-Qasim (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke chehre ko izzat di, Ham ne apne ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein us ke sath taqariibana sarapata daudte dekha"
"927","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, Rib'i bin Hirash se, Abu Bakrah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar aadmi apne bhai par hathyar taan to donon jahannam ke kinare par hain; agar woh use qatl kare to donon us mein sath gira hain"
"928","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sabit Abu Zaid aur Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, donon Asim se, Abu Usman se, Abu Bakrah se, unhon ne kaha: Mere kaanon ne use Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna aur mere dil ne use yaad rakha Aap ne farmaya: Jo apne baap ke siwa ka da'wa kare, jante hue ke woh us ke baap ke siwa hai, us par jannat haram hai"
"929","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid se, Uqbah bin suhabaana se, Abu Bakrah se, us ke qaul pahle logon ka giroh aur baad walon ka giroh ke bare mein, unhon ne kaha: Donon is ummat ke hain aur al-Hajjaj ne yeh hadees Hammad bin Salamah se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se marfu' riwayat ki"
"930","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Humaid bin Mihran ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'd bin Aws se, Ziyad bin kusaiba se, unhon ne kaha: bin Amir nikle aur baariika kapde pahne mimbar par chadhe Abu Bilal ne kaha: Apne ameer ko dekho faasiqon ka libas pahne! Abu Bakrah ne mimbar ke neeche se kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo Allah ki saltanat ki tauhiina kare, Allah use zaleel karega"
"931","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ma'bad bin Khalid se, Zaid bin Uqbah se, Samurah bin Jundub se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Jume ki namaz mein padha: Apne Parwardigar, buland ke naam ki tasbih kar, aur: Kya tumhare paas badal jane wali ki khabar aai?"
"932","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdul-Malik bin Umair se, Zaid bin Uqbah se, Samurah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mangna kharoncen hain jise aadmi apna chehra kharochta hai; jo chahe apna chehra bachae, aur jo chahe chhore, siwae ke aadmi us mamle mein mange jis se woh gunjaish nahin sakta, ya hakim se maange. Zaid bin Uqbah ne kaha: To Main ne Ise al-Hajjaj bin Yusuf se bayan kiya, aur unhon ne kaha: Mujh se mango, kyunke main hakim hun"
"933","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdul-Malik bin Umair se, Husain Ibn Abi al-hurra se, Samurah bin Jundub se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sab behtareen jis se tum apna ilaj karte ho hijaamaa hai"
"934","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Firas ne mujhe khabar di, kehte hue: Main ne ash-Sha'bi ko suna, kehte hue: Main ne Samurah bin Jundub ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne subah ki namaz padhi aur farmaya: Kya yahan falan ke beton mein se koi hai? Tumhara sathi jannat ke darwaze par apne zimme qarz se roka gaya hai"
"935","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya: Abu Dawud ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne da'wa kiya, Firas se, ash-Sha'bi se, Samurah bin Jundub se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne do martaba pukara aur farmaya: Yahan falan ke beton mein se kaun hai? Kisi ne unhen jawab na diya phir teesri mein ek aadmi khada hua aur kaha: Main hun Aap ne farmaya: Tumhen pehli do martaba mujhe jawab dene se Kis ne roka? Main ne tumhara naam sirf bhalai ke liye zikr kiya: Tumhara sathi jannat ke darwaze par apne zimme qarz se roka gaya hai unhon ne kaha: To Us ne us ke liye ada kiya yahan tak ke kisi ne us se kuch na manga"
"936","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, mujaalida aur Ismail se, ash-Sha'bi se, ke unhon ne kaha: Agar tum chaho to use Allah ke azab ke hawale karo, aur agar tum chaho to use churaao."
"937","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hilal bin Yasaf ko ar-Rabi bin umailaa se, Samurah se khabar dete suna, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne ladke ka naam Aflah, na Rabah, na Yasar, na naajiha rakho, kahin kaha jae: Kya woh yahan hai? Aur kaha jae: Nahin"
"938","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hakam aur Habib Ibn Abi Sabit se, Maimun Ibn Abi Shabeeb se, Samurah bin Jundub se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Yeh safed kapde pahno, kyunke woh zyada pak aur behtar hain, aur apne murdon ko mein kafan do"
"939","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Al-Hakam ne mujhe khabar di, Ibn Abi Laila se, Samurah bin Jundub se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo mujh se hadees bayan kare jise woh jhoot samjhe woh jhuuthon mein se ek hai"
"940","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Simak bin Harb ne mujhe khabar di, kehte hue: Main ne al-Muhallab Ibn Abi sufaraa ko kehte suna: Main ne Samurah bin Jundub ko khutba dete suna, apne khutbe mein kehte hue: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne suraj nikalne se pahle namaz se mana farmaya, kyunke woh shaitan ke donon seengon ke darmiyan nikalta hai, ya shaitan ke donon seengon par"
"941","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Savaadaa bin Hanzhalah al-Qushairi ne mujhe khabar di; Unhon ne Samurah bin Jundub ko khutba dete suna, kehte hue: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Na Bilal ki pukarte tumhen dhoka de, na yeh safedi, yahan tak ke Fajr is tarah phate."
"942","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Muhammad bin Sulaim ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Savaadaa bin Hanzhalah al-Qushairi ne ham se bayan kiya, Samurah bin Jundub se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Na Bilal ki pukarte tumhen sahar se roke, na lambi subah, lekin aasman par phaili subaha."
"943","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Salamah bin Kuhail se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hilal bin Yasaf ko Samurah bin Jundub se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se khabar dete suna, jinhon farmaya: Agar main tumhen hadees bayan karun to us mein kuchh na karo chaar behtareen kalaam mein se hain, aur woh Quran mein se hain, aur tumhen nuqsan na dega tum kis se shuru karo: Subhanallah, Alhamdulillah, La ilaha illallah, aur Allahu khabar"
"944","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Salamah bin Kuhail se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hilal bin Yasaf ko Samurah bin Jundub se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se khabar dete suna, jinhon farmaya: Apne ladke ka naam Aflah, na naajiha, na Rabah, na Yasar rakho"
"945","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Qudamah bin vabaraa se, Samurah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo baghair uzr Jume ko chhore, woh dinar Sadqa de; agar na pae to aadha dinar"
"946","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Husain se, Abdullah bin Buraidah se, Samurah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne aurat par namaz padhi aur us ke darmiyan mein khade hue"
"947","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, al-Hasan se, Samurah bin Jundub se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, jinhon farmaya: Agar do wali nikah karen to nikah pahle wale ka hai; aur agar aadmi do aadmiyon ko maal beche to woh pahle wale ka hai"
"948","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, al-Hasan se, Samurah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ghar ke padosi ko ghar ka zyada haq hai"
"949","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, al-Hasan se, Samurah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo apne ghulam ko qatl kare, ham use qatl karte hain; jo use kaate, ham use katwae hain; jo use khassi kare, ham use khassi karte hain"
"950","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, al-Hasan se, Samurah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo zameen ke gird deewar ghere, woh us ki hai"
"951","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, al-Hasan se, Samurah se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne munadi ko hukm diya, Jis ne baarish wale din pukara: Namaz gharon mein hai"
"952","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, al-Hasan se, Samurah ya Uqbah se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, jinhon farmaya: Ghulam ke aib ki zimma chaar din hai"
"953","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, al-Hasan se, Samurah se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Har ladka apni aqeeqa ke liye girwi hai"
"954","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, al-Hasan se, Samurah se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo mahram rishtedar ka Malik ho woh aazad hai"
"955","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, al-Hasan se, Samurah se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ki lanat, na Allah ke gussa, na aag se lanat karo"
"956","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Imran ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, al-Hasan se, Samurah se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi apne bhai par kaha na badhae, na us ke paigham par paigham bheji"
"957","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: bin Fuzalah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hasan se, Abdullah bin al-Mughaffal se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen bakriyon ke baaron mein namaz padhne ka hukm diya, aur oonton ke baithne ki jaghon mein namaz na padhne ka, kyunke woh shaitanon se paida kiye gaye"
"958","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, jinhon Uqbah bin suhabaana ko suna, Abdullah bin al-Mughaffal al-Muzani se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khazfa se mana farmaya aur farmaya: Woh na shikar pakarataa hai na dushman ko nuqsan pahunchata hai; khazfa dant todta hai aur aankh phodta hai"
"959","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mu'awiyah bin Qurrah se, Abdullah bin al-Mughaffal se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne fath ke din Surah-fath padhi, dhuna kehte hue agar log mujh par jama na hote to main tumhen use us awaz mein sunaataa."
"960","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Al-Hasan bin Wasil ne ham se bayan kiya, Mu'awiyah bin Qurrah se, Abdullah bin al-Mughaffal al-Muzani se, unhon ne kaha: Sab pahle jise Main ne Islam mein mouze pahne dekha al-Mughirah bin Shu'bah the; woh hamare paas aae jabke ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath the do siyahi mouze pahne hue Ham ne unhen dekha aur un par ta'ajjub kiya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Unhen mouzon ki bahutaayata hogi; unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasulullah, ham Kya karen? Aap ne farmaya: Un par masah karo aur namaz padho"
"961","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah aur Sulaiman bin al-Mughirah al-qaisii ne ham se bayan kiya, donon Humaid bin Hilal al-Adawi se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah bin al-Mughaffal ko suna, Rahimahullah kehte hue: Khaibar ke din charbi ki thaili utari gayi Main ne use liya aur tilawat, aur kaha: Yeh meri hai; main us mein se kisi ko kuch nahin dunga! Main mutawajjuh, aur dekho Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) the, to main un ke samne sharmindaa hua Sulaiman ne apni hadees mein kaha, aur yeh Shu'bah ki hadees mein nahin, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh tumhari hai Abu Dawud ne kaha: Jaise maal-ghanimat se"
"962","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sabit bin Yazid Abu Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim al-Raziyallahu se, al-fudaila ar-Raqashi se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah bin al-Mughaffal se poocha, kehte hue: Is mashroob mein se Kya hamare liye haram hai? Unhon ne kaha: Sharaaba. unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Kya yeh Quran mein hai? Unhon ne kaha: Main tumhen sirf Wahy bayan karta hun jo Main ne Muhammad Rasulullah se, ya Rasulullah Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suna, chahe Unhon ne risaalata se shuru kiya ya naam se unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Mere liye kafi hai, ya'ni unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne lakdi se mana farmaya unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Lakdi Kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Hara aur safed matakaa, aur naqeer aur muzaffata. unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ghade Kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Jis mein taarakola dala gaya ho, bartan ya anya. aur dubbaa. unhon ne kaha: To Main ne chhoti mashkeeza khareedi, us mein nabeez banai, aur use latkayein Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ufaiqaa mashkeeza jaisi hai"
"963","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Sa'id bin Jubair se, bin Mughaffal se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khazfa se mana farmaya"
"964","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sayyar bin Salamah Abu al-Minhal se, ke Unhon ne Abu Barzah ko suna, aur mere walid ne un se poocha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath tumhari namaz kaisi thi? Unhon ne kaha: Woh hamare sath dopehar padhte the, jise tum Zuhr kehte ho, jab suraj dhalta; hamare sath Asr padhte the jabke suraj zinda hota, aur main bhool gaya Unhon ne Maghrib ke bare mein Kya kaha; woh hamare sath Isha padhte the, use raat ke tihai tak der karne ki parwah na karte hue; woh us se pahle Sona aur us ke baad baat napasand karte the; aur woh hamare sath Fajr padhte the, aur ham mein se ek nikalta apne padosi ko pahchante hue; aur woh us mein saath se sau tak padhte the"
"965","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak bin Harb se, Jabir bin Samurah se, Hammad ne kaha: Aur Sayyar bin Salamah ne mujhe khabar di, Abu Barzah se mein se ek ne kaha: Bilal pukarta the jab suraj dhalta, aur doosre ne kaha: Jab suraj nisfunnahaara se guzar chuka hota"
"966","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Jameel bin Murrah se, Abu al-wadi as-sahataanii se, unhon ne kaha: Ham apni muhim par nikle aur par par utre ek aadmi ne ghode ke badle ghulam khareeda ham baqi din-raat rahe jab kooch ka waqt hua to aadmi apne ghode ke paas zeen kasane khada hua, aur aadmi ne use bai par roka donon Abu Barzah al-Aslami ke paas jhagda jane, jinhon kaha: Kya tum donon razi ho ke main tumhare darmiyan Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke hukm se faisla karun? Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne faisla kiya ke donon saudaagaron ko ikhtiyar hai jab tak woh juda na hon Hammad ne kaha: Yahi hai jo mujhe yaad raha Hammad ne kaha: Hisham bin Hassan ne is sanad mein kaha: Abu Barzah ne kaha: Aur main tumhen juda nahin dekhataa."
"967","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Azraq bin Qais se, Shareek bin Shihab se, unhon ne kaha: Main chahta tha ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se aadmi se milun taake un se Khariji ke bare mein poochhun main Eid ke din Abu Barzah al-Aslami se un ke kuch sahaba mein mila, aur un se kaha: Kya Tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Khariji ke bare mein kehte suna? Abu Barzah ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko apne kaanon se suna aur apni aankhon se dekha Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas maal laya gaya aur Aap ne use baantaa. katii balon wala kala aadmi, do safed kapde pahne aaya; Aap ne apne daayen walon aur apne baayen walon ko diya aur use kuch na diya woh un ke peeche se aaya aur kaha: Allah ki qasam, Muhammad, Tum ne aadil nahin kiya! Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ki qasam, tum mere baad mujh se zyada adil kisi ko na paoge, Ise teen martaba kehte hue phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aakhri zamane mein qaum niklegi, jaise yeh mein se hai; woh Quran padhenge, lekin woh un ke halaqon se na guzrega; woh Islam se hain jaise teer shikar se nikalta hai; un ki nishani mundna hai; woh nikalte rahenge yahan tak ke mein se aakhri Dajjal ke sath nikle jab tum un se milo to unhen qatl karo; woh makhlooq mein badtareen hain"
"968","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit se, Kinanah bin Nu'aim al-Adawi se, Abu Barzah al-Aslami se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apni muhimon mein se ek mein the jab Aap pada se farigh hue to farmaya: Kya tum kisi ko khote ho? Unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, ham falan aur falan ko khote hain Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Dekho, Kya tum kisi ko khote ho? Unhon ne kaha: Ham falan aur falan ko khote hain Aap ne farmaya: Lekin main julaibiiba ko khotaa hun; use talash karo Unhon ne use saat ke paas paya jinhein Us ne qatl kiya tha aur phir Unhon ne use qatl kiya Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko laya gaya aur khabar di gayi woh un ke paas aae aur farmaya: Us ne saat qatl kiye, phir Unhon ne use qatl kiya! Woh mujh se hai aur main us se hun; Us ne saat qatl kiye aur Unhon ne use qatl kiya! Woh mujh se hai aur main us se hun, Ise do ya teen martaba kehte hue phir Aap ne apni kalaiyon se is tarah kaha, aur unhen phailaayaa; woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki kalaiyon par rakhe gae yahan tak ke un ke liye qabr khodii gayi dafan tak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki kalaiyon ke siwa un ka koi bistar na tha unhon ne kaha: Aur Unhon ne ghusl ka zikr na kiya"
"969","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin Zaid se, al-Mughirah Ibn Abi Barzah se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Ghifar ko muaf kare, aur Allah Aslam ko salamti de"
"970","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sukaina bin Abdul-Aziz ne ham se bayan kiya, Sayyar bin Salamah se, Abu Barzah se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Imam Quraish se hain, jab tak woh teen se amal karen"
"971","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Azraq bin Qais se, unhon ne kaha: Main al-Ahwaz mein cattaana par baitha tha jab namaz padhta buddha aaya, apni sawari ki Langoat apne hath mein bandhe hue janwar peeche hata, aur woh us ke sath peeche gaya hamare sath Khariji ka aadmi use bura dene wahan jab woh apni namaz se farigh hua to kaha: Main ne tumhari baat suni Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath falan muhim mein jihad kiya, un ke hukm aur un ki aasani ko dekha, aur apne janwar ko pakaranaa mere liye use us ke tabele jane dene aur mujhe takleef dene se aasan hai unhon ne kaha: Aur wahan Abu Barzah al-Aslami the"
"972","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Zaid Ibn Abi Laila Abu al-muallaa al-Adawi ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Main ne al-Hasan ko kehte suna: Ubaidullah bin Ziyad Ma'qil bin Yasar ke paas dakhil hue, aur Ma'qil bin Yasar ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo Musalmanon ki qeematon mein se kisi cheez mein dakhil ho taake use un ke par badhae, Allah par lazim hai ke use qayamat ke din aag ke sab bade hisse mein kare"
"973","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: bin Fuzalah, Abbad bin Rashid aur Abu al-ashahaba ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hasan se, unhon ne kaha: Ubaidullah bin Ziyad Ma'qil bin Yasar ke paas dakhil hue, aur kaha: Mujhe hadees bayan karo jo Tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suni; shayad Allah mujhe nafa de! Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo ra'iyat par muqarrar kiya jae aur unhen dhoka dete hue mare, Allah ne us par jannat haram ki"
"974","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abbad bin Rashid aur al-mubarak bin Fuzalah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hasan se, Abbad ne kaha: Main ne al-Hasan ko kehte suna: Ma'qil bin Yasar al-Muzani ne mujhe khabar di, kehte hue: Meri bahan thi jis ka mujh se nikah manga gaya, aur main mardon ko us se rokta raha, yahan tak ke mera chachazad aaya aur Us ne mujh se use manga, to Main ne us ka us se nikah kiya woh sath rahe jab tak Allah ne chaha, phir Us ne use talaq di jis mein ruju' tha, phir use chhoda yahan tak ke us ki iddat khatm hui phir woh taalibon ke sath use mangta aaya main ne kaha: Kisi, meri bahan mujh se mangi gayi aur main mardon ko us se rokta raha; Tum ne mujh se use manga, to Main ne tum par use tarjeeh di aur tumhara us se nikah kiya, phir Tum ne use talaq di phir Tum ne use na manga yahan tak ke us ki iddat khatm hui jab Talib use mangte aae to tum use mangte aae! Nahin, Allah ki qasam, jis ke siwa koi ma'bood nahin, main kabhi us ka tum nikah nahin karunga Ma'qil ne kaha: Mere bare mein yeh aayat nazil hui: Aur jab tum aurton ko talaq do aur woh apni muddat ko pahunchen to unhen apne shauharon se nikah se na roko jab woh apne mein bhalai se razi hon unhon ne kaha: Aur Allah, Aziz Wajleel us ki us ki hajat aur us ki us ki hajat janta tha, to yeh aayat nazil hui main ne kaha: Sunne aur maananaa! To Main ne us ka us se nikah kiya aur apni qasam ka kaffara diya"
"975","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ibn al-Mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, Sulaiman at-Taimi se, ek aadmi se, us ke walid se, Ma'qil bin Yasar se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne murdon par ya-seen padho"
"976","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Jaafar bin Sulaiman ne ham se bayan kiya, muallaa al-qaraduusii se, Mu'awiyah bin Qurrah se, Ma'qil bin Yasar se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Fitne mein ibadat meri taraf hijrat jaisi hai"
"977","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Jaafar bin Sulaiman ne ham se bayan kiya, muallaa al-qaraduusii se, Mu'awiyah bin Qurrah se, Ma'qil bin Yasar se, ke do aadmiyon ne un ke samne zameen par jhagda kiya unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo qasam khae taake us se apne bhai ka maal kaate woh Allah, Aziz Wajleel se liye jabke woh us se ghadabnak hai"
"978","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Al-Musanna bin Auf ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ubaidullah se, Ma'qil se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne fadiikha se mana farmaya"
"979","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne hamein khabar di, al-Aswad bin Qais se, jinhon Jundub ko kehte suna: Jibreel Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se der hue, to ek aurat ne kaha: Main dekhta hun ke un ka sathi un se der hua hai! To Allah, Aziz Wajleel ne nazil kiya: Subah ki roshan ki qasam, aur raat ki jab ghalib, tumhare Rabb ne tumhen na chhoda na woh ghadabnak hai"
"980","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Aswad se, jinhon Jundub ko kehte suna: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko qurbani ke din khutba dete dekha Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se Jis ne namaz se pahle zabah kiya, woh apni qurbani ki jagah doosri dohrae; aur Jis ne zabah nahin kiya, woh Allah ke naam se zabah kare"
"981","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Aswad se, jinhon Jundub ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz ke liye nikle aur un ki paon ki ungli thokar khayi aur khoon bahaa. Aap ne farmaya: Tum sirf ungli ho Jis ne khoon bahaye; tumhen jo pahunchi Allah ke raste mein tha"
"982","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Anas bin Sireen se, jinhon Jundub al-Bajali ko kehte suna: Jo subah ki namaz padhe woh Allah, Aziz Wajleel ki hifazat mein hai; jo Allah ki hifazat mein Allah ki jaye kare, Allah use munh ke bal aag mein daalegaa. aur Bishr bin al-mufazzala ne yeh hadees Khalid al-Hazza se, Anas bin Sireen se, Jundub se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat ki"
"983","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Humaid se, al-Hasan se, Usman Ibn Abi al-Aas se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen masjid mein gunbada mein kiya taake un ke dil narm hon jab Unhon ne Islam qabool kiya to Unhon ne un par shart ki ke unhen jang ke liye jama na kiya jae, na un par ushra liya jae, na taiksa. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhen na jama kiya jaega, na tum ushra liya jaega, na taiksa, aur us deen mein koi bhalai nahin jis mein ruku na ho Abu Dawud ne kaha: bin Fuzalah ne kaha: Main ne al-Hasan ko is hadees mein karte suna ke Saqeef ne kaha: Ham tumhen woh denge us mein pasandeedgi ke baavajuuda."
"984","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Amr bin Murrah ne mujhe khabar di, kehte hue: Main ne Sa'id bin al-Musayyab ko suna, kehte hue: Usman Ibn Abi al-Aas ne khabar di, kehte hue: Aakhri jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe wasiyat ki, Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum logon ki imamat karo to un ke liye namaz halki karo"
"985","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu mashaara ne ham se bayan kiya, Yazid bin Khusaifah al-Madani se, Amr bin Abdullah bin Ka'b bin Malik al-Ansari se, un ke walid se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar tum mein se ek shikayat kare to woh apna hath wahan rakhe jahan woh dard mehsoos kare, phir kahe: Main Allah ki izzat aur har cheez par us ki qadir se panah mangta hun us burayi se jo main mehsoos karta hun, yeh saat martaba kehte hue aur Malik bin Anas yeh hadees Yazid bin Khusaifah se, Amr bin Abdullah bin Ka'b bin Malik se, Nafi' bin Jubair se, Usman Ibn Abi al-Aas se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain"
"986","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Bishr se, Nafi' bin Jubair bin Mut'im se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Main Muhammad hun, aur Ahmad, aur haashira, aur Nabi at-Tauba, aur Nabi al-malhamaa."
"987","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'd bin Ibrahim se, kehte hue: Mere ek bhai ne mujhe khabar di, mere walid se, Jubair bin Mut'im se, unhon ne kaha: Main Badr ke fidie ke liye Madinah aaya, aur woh waqt mushrik the unhon ne kaha: Main masjid mein dakhil hua jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Maghrib padh rahe the, us mein at-Toor padhte hue, aur mera dil jaise Quran ki tilawat se phat gaya"
"988","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Muhammad bin Jubair bin Mut'im se, Abu Dawud ne kaha: Main Ise sirf un ke walid se janta hun, ke ek aurat Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas kisi cheez ke bare mein aai jis ka Us ne Aap se zikr kiya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Mere paas jao us ne kaha: Allah ke Rasulullah, agar main aaun aur tumhen na paun to phir kis paas? Aap ne farmaya: Abu Bakr ke paas aur yeh hadees Sa'd bin Ibrahim se baghair shak riwayat ki gayi"
"989","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, apne mamu al-Haris bin Abdur Rahman se, Muhammad bin Jubair bin Mut'im se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Makkah-Madinah ke darmiyan raste mein the Aap ne farmaya: Yaman wale tumhare samne zahir hone wale hain jaise badal ke tukde, ya badal ka tukda; woh zameen walon mein behtareen hain Ansar ke ek aadmi ne kaha: Aur ham nahin, Allah ke Rasulullah? Woh khamosh rahe phir unhon ne kaha: Aur ham nahin, Allah ke Rasulullah? Woh khamosh rahe phir unhon ne kaha: Aur ham nahin, Allah ke Rasulullah? Woh khamosh rahe phir farmaya: Siwae tum, aahista awaz mein"
"990","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Malik bin Anas ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Muhammad bin Jubair bin Mut'im se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Maghrib mein at-Toor padhte suna"
"991","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Amr bin Murrah ne mujhe khabar di; Unhon ne Asim al-anazii ko bin Jubair bin Mut'im se, un ke walid se khabar dete suna, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam), jab namaz mein dakhil hote to takbir kehte Aap farmate: Allahu Akbar Kabeera, Ise teen martaba kehte hue; Alhamdulillah kaseera, Ise teen martaba kehte hue; Subhanallah subah-Sham, Ise teen martaba kehte hue; main Allah ki panah mangta hun maraduuda shaitan se, us ki phoonk, thook aur cubhana se"
"992","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Sulaiman bin Surad ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Jubair bin Mut'im ko kehte suna: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne janabat se ghusl ka zikr hua Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jahan tak mera miskeen hai, main apne sar par teen martaba karta hun"
"993","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, an-Nu'man bin Salim se, ek aadmi se, Jubair bin Mut'im se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Allah ke Rasulullah, tumhare sahaba da'wa karte hain ke Makkah mein hamare thehrne ka hamen koi ajr nahin! Aap ne farmaya: Tumhara ajr tumhen zaroor aayega chahe bil mein ho unhon ne kaha: Aap ne apna sar meri taraf jhukaayaa aur farmaya: Mere sahaba mein munafiq hain"
"994","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu al-Ahwas ne ham se bayan kiya, Husain bin Abdur Rahman se, Muhammad bin Talha bin Rukanah se, Jubair bin Mut'im se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri is masjid mein namaz hazaar namazon se behtar hai, ya unhon ne kaha: Sau, doosri jagah, siwae Masjid-haram ke"
"995","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Talha bin Abdullah bin Auf se, Abdur Rahman bin al-Azhar se, Jubair bin Mut'im se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Quraishi mein doosron ke do aadmiyon ki dogni taqat hai az-Zuhri se kaha gaya: Woh kyun? Unhon ne kaha: Rae ki pukhta se"
"996","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utbah se, Zaid bin Khalid al-Juhani se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar tum mein se ek ki bandi zina kare to woh use kode maare; agar woh dohrae to woh use kode maare; agar woh dohrae to woh use kode maare; agar chauthi martaba dohrae to woh use beche chahe baal ki mendhi ke badle"
"997","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Zam'ah ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah se, Zaid bin Khalid se, unhon ne kaha: Do jhagarane wale Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur kaha: Allah ke Rasulullah, ham tumhen Allah ki qasam dete hain magar ke tum hamare darmiyan Allah, Aziz Wajleel ki Kitab se faisla karo! Us ka mukhalif, us se zyada samajhdar, khada hua aur kaha: Haan, Allah ke Rasulullah; hamare darmiyan Allah ki Kitab se faisla karo aur mujhe bolne ki ijazat do! Aap ne use ijazat di us ne kaha: Allah ke Rasulullah, mera beta is ke paas mazdoor tha, aur Us ne us ki biwi se zina kiya mujhe kaha gaya ke mera beta rajm ka haqdar hai, to Main ne use sau bakriyon aur khadim se churaayaa. jab Main ne Ahle-ilm se poocha to Unhon ne mujhe khabar ke mera beta sau kodon aur saal bhar ki jilawatan-vatanii ka haqdar hai, aur is aadmi ki biwi rajm ki haqdar hai! Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai, main zaroor tumhare darmiyan Allah ki Kitab se faisla karunga: Sau bakriyan aur khadim tumhen kare jate hain; tumhara beta sau kodon aur saal bhar ki jilawatan-vatanii ka haqdar hai; jao, Unais, is aadmi ki biwi ke paas, aur agar woh iqrar kare to use rajm karo to woh subah us ke paas gaya, us se poocha, aur Us ne iqrar kiya, aur Us ne use rajm kiya"
"998","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Salih se, jo at-tavaamaa ke aazad-karda the, Zaid bin Khalid se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Maghrib padhte the, phir bazaar aate; agar ham teer nikalte to un ke girne ki jagah dekh rakhte the"
"999","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Zuhair bin Muhammad ne ham se bayan kiya, Zaid bin Aslam se, Zaid bin Khalid se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo wuzu kamil kare phir do rak'aten padhe mein ghafalata ke baghair woh muaf kiya jata hai aur Abu Amir yeh hadees Hisham bin Sa'd se, Zaid bin Aslam se, Ata bin Yasar se, Zaid bin Khalid se riwayat karte hain"
"1000","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Harb bin Shaddad ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, Abu Salamah se, Busr bin Sa'id se, Zaid bin Khalid se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Allah, Aziz Wajleel ke raste mein Mujahid ko tayyar kare, Us ne jihad kiya; aur jo us ke gharwalon mein us ki achchi durust kare Us ne jihad kiya"
"1001","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abdul-Aziz Ibn Abi Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Salih bin Kaisan se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah se, Zaid bin Khalid se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Murghe ko bura na do, kyunke woh namaz ke liye pukarta hai aur Abu Dawud ne doosri martaba kaha: Abdul-Aziz se, Salih se, Abdullah Ibn Abi Qatadah se, un ke walid se, aur yeh meri rae mein zyada Sabit hai"
"1002","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Zuhair bin Muhammad ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Sa'id se, Muhammad bin Yahya bin Habban se, un ke chacha Wasi bin Habban se, jinhon Rafi' bin Khadij ko suna; Unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Phal ya khajoor ke gude ke liye hath qat nahin"
"1003","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Ishaq se, Asim Ibn Umar bin Qatadah se, Mahmud bin Labid se, Rafi' bin Khadij se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Subah ki namaz ujaale mein padho, kyunke woh ajr mein bade hai"
"1004","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shareek ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Ata se, Rafi' se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo logon ki zameen mein un ki ijazat ke baghair kare use fasala mein se kuch nahin, siwae us ke kharce."
"1005","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Ibrahim ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdur Rahman bin huraira bin Rafi' bin Khadij se, Rafi' bin Khadij se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Bilal se farmaya: Subah ki namaz ujaale mein padho, yahan tak ke log apne teeron ke girne ki jagah dekh saken."
"1006","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Amr bin marazuuqa ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Yahya bin Abdul-Hameed al-Ansari ne mujhe khabar di, kehte hue: Mere dada ne mujhe khabar di, Rafi' bin Khadij se, ke unhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath un ki ek muhim mein teer wahan Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Rafi', agar tum chaho to main teer nikaaluun aur nok choduun, aur qayamat ke din tumhare liye gawahi dun ke tum shaheed ho to Aap ne aisa kiya"
"1007","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Zaidah bin Qudamah as-Saqafi ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne kaha: Woh qadarii ya mashhoor bidati ko bayan na karte; unhon ne kaha: Sa'id bin Masrooq as-Sauri ne ham se bayan kiya, abaayaa bin Rifa'ah bin Rafi' bin Khadij se, un ke dada Rafi' se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath tihaamaa ke Zu al-Zulhulaifah mein the, aur log bhooke hue aur oont-bakriyan pakariin. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) un ke paas aae haandiyan carhii huin; Aap ne haandiyon ke bare mein hukm diya aur woh ulat di gayin, phir Aap ne un ke darmiyan taqseem, das bakriyon ko oont ke barabar karte hue unhon ne kaha: Logon ke oonton mein se oont chori, aur logon mein ghode thode hi the; ek aadmi ne use teer mara aur rok diya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: In oonton mein shikar ki tarah vahashata hai; jo tum par ghalib aae, us ke sath aisa karo"
"1008","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Zaidah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id bin Masrooq se, abaayaa se, Rafi' se, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne kaha: Allah ke Rasulullah, ham kal dushman se milenge aur hamare paas chhuriyan nahin; Kya ham sarakandon se zabah karen? Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo khoon bahae aur us par Allah ka naam liya jae, khao; siwae dant aur naakhuuna. main tumhen us ke bare mein jayega: Jahan tak dant ka miskeen hai, woh haddi hai; jahan tak nakhun ka miskeen hai, woh Habsha ki chhuriyan hain Abu Dawud ne kaha: Zaidah ne kaha: Kya tum duniya mein is bab mein is se behtar koi hadees dekhte ho? Abu Dawud ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, woh behtareen hadeesein mein se hai"
"1009","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin dinar se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Umar ko kehte suna: Ham bataaii mein koi harj na dekhte the yahan tak ke bin Khadij ne da'wa kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us se mana farmaya"
"1010","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hakam se, Mujahid se, Rafi' bin Khadij se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne haql se mana farmaya Shu'bah ne kaha: Main ne al-Hakam se kaha: Haql Kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Tihai aur cauthaaii. Shu'bah ne kaha: Al-Hakam ne kaha: Jab Ibrahim ne yeh hadees suni to Unhon ne tihai aur chauthai napasand ki, lekin sone-chandi par zameen kirae par dene mein koi harj na dekha"
"1011","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, Ibrahim bin Abdullah bin Qariz se, as-Sa'ib bin Yazid se, Rafi' bin Khadij se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hijaamaa karne wale ki kamai khabees, zaaniyaa ka meher khabees, aur kutte ki qeemat khabiisa."
"1012","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Murrah se, jinhon Abu al-bakhatarii ko Abu Sa'id al-Khudri se khabar dete suna, unhon ne kaha: Jab yeh aayat, jab Allah ki madad aur fath aae, nazil hui to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use us ke aakhir tak padha, phir farmaya: Main aur mere sahaba ek taraf hain aur log doosri taraf; fath ke baad koi hijrat nahin Abu Sa'id ne kaha: To Main ne yeh hadees Marwan bin al-Hakam se bayan ki, jo Madinah ke malik the, aur unhon ne kaha: Tum ne jhoot kaha, jabke Rafi' bin Khadij un ke sath the main ne kaha: Yeh, agar chahe to tumhen bayan kar rakhte hain Rafi' ne kaha: Unhon ne sach kaha"
"1013","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdul-Malik bin Maisarah se, Mujahid se, Rafi' bin Khadij se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ke paas zameen ho, woh use apne bhai ko de aur kirae par na de aur Sufyan ne yeh hadees Mansoor se, Mujahid se, Usaid bin Zuhair se, Rafi' bin Khadij se riwayat ki"
"1014","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Balj Yahya bin Sulaim ne mujhe khabar di, kehte hue: Main ne abaayaa bin Rifa'ah bin Rafi' bin Khadij ko khabar dete suna ke un ke dada mare hijaamaa karne wala ladka, pani wala oont, zameen aur bandi chhod Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hukm diya ke hijaamaa karne wale ki kamai pani wale oont ke caare mein dali jae, bandi ki kamai se mana kiya, aur zameen ke bare mein farmaya: Use joto ya chhod"
"1015","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sufyan as-Sauri ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim bin Ubaidullah se, Ubaidullah Ibn Abi Rafi' se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko al-Hasan ke kaan mein azan dete dekha jab un ki walida Fatimah ne unhen jana, namaz ke sath"
"1016","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Kharijah bin Mus'ab ne ham se bayan kiya, Zaid bin Aslam se, Ata bin Yasar se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne aadmi se jawan oont qarz liya, phir aadmi adayegi mangta aaya, to Aap ne Abu Rafi' ko use ada karne ka hukm diya, aur unhon ne kaha: Mujhe umdah oont ke siwa kuch nahin milta! Aap ne farmaya: Use de do, kyunke tum mein behtareen — ya unhon ne kaha: Logon mein behtareen — woh hain jo adayegi mein behtareen hain aur al-qaanabii ne yeh hadees Malik se, Zaid bin Aslam se, Ata bin Yasar se, Abu Rafi' se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat ki"
"1017","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hakam se, Ibn Abi Rafi' se, Abu Rafi' se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Bani Makhzum ke aadmi ko sadqe par bheja, aur Unhon ne Abu Rafi' se kaha: Mere sath chalo taake tumhen us mein se kuch mile! Unhon ne kaha: Nahin, yahan tak ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas jaun aur un se puuchuun! To woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas gae aur un se poocha, aur Aap ne farmaya: Sadqa hamare liye halal nahin, aur qaum ka aazad-karda Unhin mein se hai"
"1018","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Abdur Rahman bin Ya'la at-taaifii ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin ash-Shuraid se, un ke walid se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Padosi ko apni zameen se lagi cheez ka zyada haq hai aur Sufyan ne yeh hadees Ibrahim bin Maisarah se, Amr bin ash-Shuraid se, Abu Rafi' se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat ki"
"1019","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya se, Ibn Abi Rafi' se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne chhota neza Abu Rafi' ko saunpa aur unhen Madinah ke kutte marne ka hukm diya, to Unhon ne ek kutte ke siwa unhen mara, phir woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae aur unhen khabar di, aur Aap ne use marne ka hukm diya aur al-qaanabii ne yeh hadees Raziyallahu bin Muhammad se, Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman bin Sa'd bin Zurarah se, Salim bin Abdullah se, Abu Rafi' se riwayat ki"
"1020","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, Mukhawwal se, Abu Sa'id se, Abu Rafi' se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) mere paas se guzre jabke main apne baal girah mein bandhe sajdah kar raha tha, to Aap ne use hue"
"1021","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Jaafar bin tammaama se, un ke dada al-Abbas bin Abdul-Muttalib se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne chehre par khujate se mana farmaya al-Abbas ne kaha: Main sirf sab door ki haddi par daaghataa hun, to Unhon ne cuutaron ke door kinare par daaghaa."
"1022","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Shu'aib bin al-habhaaba se, Abu al-Aliya se, ke al-Abbas ne baalaakhaanaa banaya, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use giraao. unhon ne kaha: Kya main lekin us ki qeemat Sadqa dun? Aap ne farmaya: Use giraao, teen martaba"
"1023","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Isra'il ne ham se bayan kiya, fudaila bin Amr al-fuqaimii se, Sa'id bin Jubair se, Abdullah Ibn Abbas se, al-Fazl Ibn Abbas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Hajj ka irada kare woh us mein jaldi kare, kyunke beemar beemar hota hai, bhatakii sawari bhatakatii hai, aur hajat pesh aati hai Abu Dawud ne is hadees mein shak zahir kiya, jabke doosron ne Ise baghair shak Abu Isra'il se, fudaila se, Abu Sa'id se, Abdullah Ibn Abbas se, al-Fazl se riwayat kiya"
"1024","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amir al-Raziyallahu se, Ata se, Ibn Abbas se, al-Fazl Ibn Abbas se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) talbiyah padhte rahe yahan tak ke Jamrat-Aqabah ko rajm kiya"
"1025","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zam'ah bin Salih ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Sulaiman bin Yasar se, Ibn Abbas se, ke Khats'am ki ek aurat Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas Hajjat-wa'da ke saal aai aur kaha: Allah ke Rasulullah, apne bandon par Allah ke Hajj ka farz mere walid ko pahunchi hai bahut boodhe aadmi ke taur par jo sawari par mazboot se baithe nahin rakhte; Kya un ke liye kafi hoga agar main un ki taraf se Hajj karun? Aap ne farmaya: Han is tarah Abu Dawud ne Ise riwayat kiya, jabke Abdur ne kaha: Ma'mar se, az-Zuhri se, Sulaiman bin Yasar se, Ibn Abbas se, al-Fazl se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se"
"1026","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, azaraa se, al-Hasan al-uraanii se, al-Fazl bin al-Abbas se, ke woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke peeche sawar hue, aur un ki sawari ne subah jate hue agli pair na uthaya yahan tak ke Unhon ne Jamrah ko rajm kiya"
"1027","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abdullah bin Jaafar se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko khiiraa taza khajooron ke sath khate dekha"
"1028","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Sufyan bin Uyainah ne ham se bayan kiya, Khalid bin Jaafar se, un ke walid se, ke jab Jaafar ki maut ki khabar Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aai to Aap ne farmaya: Jaafar ke gharwalon ke liye khana tayyar karo, kyunke un ke paas woh aaya hai jo unhen mashghool karta hai is tarah Abu Dawud ne kaha, jabke doosron ne kaha: Sufyan bin Uyainah se, Khalid bin Jaafar se, un ke walid se, Abdullah bin Jaafar se"
"1029","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Sabit Abu Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim al-Raziyallahu se, muvarriqa se, Abdullah bin Jaafar se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) safar se lautte to main aur al-Hasan un se milne jane jate, aur woh ham mein se ek ko apne aage aur doosre ko sawari par apne peeche bithaate."
"1030","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jis ne Abdullah bin Jaafar ko dekha Us ne mujhe khabar di, jabke Abdullah bin az-Zubair Abdullah bin Jaafar ke liye gosht kaat rahe the aur unhen khilaa rahe the, ke bin Jaafar ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Behtareen gosht peeth hai"
"1031","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, mahadii ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Abdullah Ibn Abi Raziyallahu se, al-Hasan bin Sa'd se, jo al-Hasan bin Ali ke aazad-karda the, unhon ne kaha: Jab Jaafar aur un ke sahaba ke qatl ki khabar Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas pahunchee to Aap ne Jaafar ke gharwalon ko teen din ki mohlat di, phir un ke paas aae aur farmaya: Mere bhai ke beton ko mere paas nikalo to teen nikale gae jaise woh cuuze hon: Abdullah, Aun aur muhammada. Aap ne naaii ko bulaya aur Us ne un ke sar muunde, aur farmaya: Jahan tak Aun ka miskeen hai, woh surat-siirata mein mujh se mushaabeha hai, aur jahan tak Muhammad ka miskeen hai, woh hamare chacha Abu Talib se mushaabeha hai Aap ne Abdullah ka hath pakda aur use uthaya aur farmaya: Aey Allah, Jaafar ke gharwalon mein un ki khilafat kar, aur Abdullah ko us ke daayen hath ke bai mein barkat de unhon ne kaha: Un ki walida un ke liye khushi zahir karne mani, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum un ke liye faqr se daratii ho jabke main duniya-aakhirat mein un ka saraparasta hun? Is tarah Abu Dawud ne Ise riwayat kiya, jabke Wahb bin Jarir ne Ise apne walid se, Muhammad Ibn Abi Raziyallahu se, al-Hasan bin Sa'd se, Abdullah bin Jaafar se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hamari walida hamen Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas laaiin."
"1032","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shaiban ne ham se bayan kiya, Jabir se, Muhammad bin Ali se, Abdullah bin Jaafar se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko zehr diye jane ke baad un ki gardan par hijaamaa kiya gaya"
"1033","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Zam'ah bin Salih ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mu'min ki rooh parinda hai jo jannat ke darakhton se lipatataa hai yahan tak ke Allah, Aziz Wajleel use us ke mukammal mein kare aur Abdur yeh hadees Ma'mar se, az-Zuhri se, bin Ka'b bin Malik se, un ke walid se riwayat karte hain"
"1034","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Sufyan ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, bin Ka'b bin Malik se, un ke chacha se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne aurton-bachchon ke qatl se mana farmaya"
"1035","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Salih Ibn Abi al-akhazara ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Abdur Rahman bin Ka'b bin Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ka'b ko kehte suna: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) muhim par jate to kisi aur ki taraf ishara karte"
"1036","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Salih Ibn Abi al-akhazara ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Abdur Rahman bin Ka'b bin Malik se — jo Ka'b ke nabina hone par un ke unhon the — unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ka'b ko apni khabar bayan karte suna jab woh Tabuk ki muhim mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se peeche rahe Ka'b ne kaha: Main kisi muhim mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se peeche na raha jis mein Aap ne kabhi jihad kiya siwae Tabuk ki muhim ke, halanke Main ne Badr mein hazri na di thi, aur Allah ne Badr se peeche rehne wale kisi ko malamat na ki; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) sirf Quraish ke qafile ki talash mein nikle the yahan tak ke Allah, Aziz Wajleel ne unhen un ke dushman se baghair wa'de mila aur Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Aqabah ki raat hazri di thi jab Ham ne apne mein Islam par bai'at ki, aur main us ki jagah Badr ki hazri na chahun, halanke Badr logon mein us se zyada mashhoor hai meri hadees mein se hai ke jab main Tabuk ki muhim mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se peeche raha to main kabhi izafa qawi ya maal na tha jitna jab main un se peeche raha; Allah ki qasam, mere liye do sawariyan kabhi jama na huin yahan tak ke Main ne unhen us muhim mein jama kiya Ka'b ne kaha: Jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se peeche rehne ka irada karta, main samajhta ke woh us ke liye chhupa rahega jab tak Allah, Aziz Wajleel us ke bare mein Wahy na utaare. unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) muhim par gae jab Madinah ke phal paka chuke the aur us ka saya khushagavaara tha, aur main un ki taraf kar tha, phir bhi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne woh simta batayi jis ka Aap irada karte the, halanke jab Aap muhim par jate to kisi aur ki taraf ishara karte the, yahan tak ke woh muhim aai; aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath log bahut the, jinhein koi mahfooz daftara gher nahin sakta tha — ya'ni diivaana. unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko door safar darapesha tha, aur ham bade tadaad the, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tayyar karne lage, aur main subah nikalta jaise tayyar karte hue, phir wapas kuch kiye baghair; phir main subah nikalta jaise tayyar karte hue aur kuch na karta unhon ne kaha: Muamla mere sath ki raha yahan tak ke log kooch mein jaldi hue, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne sath Musalmanon par subah kooch kiya, to Main ne kooch ka irada kiya lekin woh mere liye muqaddar na hua — kaash Main ne aisa kiya hota! Mujhe ghum hua ke jab main Rasulullah ke kooch ke baad logon mein nikla to Main ne kisi ko na dekha siwae nifaq se muttahama aadmi ya Muzdalifah mein se aadmi jise Allah ne uzr diya tha Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mera zikr na kiya yahan tak ke Tabuk pahunche, jahan Aap ne majlis mein — logon mein Mu'az bin Jabal par — Tabuk mein farmaya: Ka'b bin Malik ne Kya kiya? Bani salimaa ke ek aadmi ne kaha: Us ki do chadron aur apne pehluon ko dekhne ne use rok rakha hai, Ya Rasulullah! Mu'az ne kaha: Bura hai, Allah ki qasam, jo tum ne kaha; Allah ki qasam, Ya Rasulullah, main bhalai ke siwa kuch nahin janta! Jabke Rasulullah aise the, Aap ne saraaba se dhundale aadmi ko dekha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Abu Khaithamah ho aur woh Abu Khaithamah the, jinhon sa' ka Sadqa diya tha aur Munafiqon ne un ka mazaq diya tha, kyunke unhen apni maal ke siwa kuch na mila tha jab mujhe pahunchi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Tabuk se aae to mera ghum aur jhoot mujh par aaya, aur main kehne laga: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke gusse se kaise bacuungaa? Main ne us ke liye apne gharwalon mein se har aqalmand se madad mangi jab mujhe pahunchi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aane wale hain to jhoot mujh se gaya aur Main ne un ki sach ka azma kiya Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam), jab safar se lautte to masjid se shuru karte aur us mein do rak'aten padhte; jab Aap aisa karte to munafiq — cauraasii aadmi — un ke paas aate, uzr pesh karte aur un se kasamen khate, aur woh un ke zahir ko qabool karte, un ke liye bakhshish mangte, aur un ke raaz Allah par chhodta phir main aaya, aur jab Aap ne mujhe dekha to ghadabnak ki muskaana muskuraye, phir farmaya: Tumhen Kis ne peeche rakha? Kya Tum ne apni sawari nahin khareedi thi? Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Allah ki qasam, agar main duniya walon mein se kisi aur ke sath hota to main samajhta ke us ke gusse se gunjaish sakta hun, kyunke mujhe guftagu ki mahaarata di gayi hai; lekin Allah ki qasam, agar main aaj tumhen khabar bayan karun jis se tum mujh se razi ho to Allah jald tumhen mujh se ghadabnak karega, aur agar main aaj tumhen sachchi khabar bayan karun jis par tum mujh se ghadabnak ho to main Allah ke husn muamle ki ummeed rakhta hun nahin, Allah ki qasam, Ya Rasulullah, main kabhi izafa qawi ya maal na tha jitna jab main tum peeche raha; Allah ki qasam, mere liye do sawariyan kabhi jama na huin yahan tak ke Main ne unhen is muhim mein jama kiya! Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jahan tak is ka miskeen hai, Is ne mujhe sach khabar; khade raho yahan tak ke Allah tumhare bare mein faisla kare unhon ne kaha: To main khada hua, aur Bani salimaa mein se meri qaum ke aadmi meri taraf mude aur kaha: Allah ki qasam, Ham ne tumhen is se pahle Islam mein koi gunah karte na jana; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki bakhshish tumhare gunah ke liye kafi hoti — Kya Tum ne Rasulullah ko woh uzr pesh na kiya jo peeche rehne walon ne unhen pesh kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, woh mujhe malamat karte rahe yahan tak ke main taqariibana apne ko jhuthalaataa. unhon ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Kya kisi aur ko woh pesh aaya jo mujhe pesh aaya? Unhon ne kaha: Do aadmiyon ko tumhare sath woh pesh aaya jo tumhen kaha gaya main ne kaha: Woh kaun hain? Unhon ne kaha: Hilal bin Umayyah al-vaaqifii aur muraaraa bin ar-Rabi al-aamirii — Unhon ne do nek aadmiyon ka zikr kiya jinhon Badr mein hazri di thi, mein mere liye misaal hai unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ham se baat karne se mana farmaya, ham teen aadmiyon se, un se alag jo un se peeche rahe the unhon ne kaha: Log ham se rehte the aur ham se baat na karte the, to Allah ki qasam main nafs apne liye Ajnabiyon hua, aur zameen mere liye apne mein Ajnabiyon hui, to woh woh zameen na thi jise main janta tha jahan tak mere donon sahaba ka miskeen hai, Unhon ne iqrar kiya aur apne gharon mein baithe, jabke main logon mein sab chhota aur sab mazboot tha, to main Musalmanon ke sath namaz mein hazir hota aur bazaron mein ghoomne koi mujh se baat na karta tha main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aata aur un ke sath namaz padhta, phir unhen salam karta aur apne se kehta: Kya Unhon ne mujhe jawab mein apne honth hilaae? Main un ki taraf chori nazaren karta: Jab main apni namaz ki taraf murataa woh meri taraf mudte, aur jab main un ki taraf murataa woh mujh se munh pherte jab Musalmanon ki ham se yeh begaanagii mujh par lambi hui to main Abu Qatadah ke paas gaya — mere chachazad aur logon mein mujhe sab mahboob — aur un se baat ki, lekin Allah ki qasam Unhon ne mujh se baat na ki main ne kaha: Aey Abu Qatadah, main tumhen Allah ki qasam deta hun, Kya tum jante ho ke main Allah aur us ke Rasulullah se muhabbat karta hun? Unhon ne kaha: Allah aur us ke Rasulullah behtar jante hain unhon ne kaha: Meri aankhen beh nikleen, to main deewar par chadha aur chala gaya jabke main ek din bazaar mein tha, Sham ke Nabat mein se nabatii mere paas ghassaana ke Badshah ka khat lekar aaya, kehte hue: Mujhe Ka'b bin Malik ki rehnumai kaun karega? Log meri taraf ishara karne lage Main ne khat liya — aur main padha-likha tha, padh sakta tha — aur woh ghassaana ke Badshah ki taraf se tha, aur us mein: Amma ba'd: Hamen pahunchi hai ke tumhare sathi ne tumhen door kiya hai, aur Allah ne tumhen zillat ya nuqsan ke ghar mein nahin rakha, to ham se milo aur ham tumhen taskeen denge! Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Yeh bhi burayi mein se hai Main ne khat liya aur us ke sath tanduura ki taraf gaya aur use jalaayaa. jab chalis raaten guzrin jab se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ham se baat karne se mana farmaya tha, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka qasid mere paas aaya aur kaha: Rasulullah tumhen apni biwi se door rehne ka hukm dete hain main ne kaha: Kya main use talaq dun, ya us ke sath Kya karun? Unhon ne kaha: Us ke qareeb na jao to Main ne apni biwi se kaha: Apne gharwalon ke paas jao yahan tak ke Allah is mamle mein faisla kare — aur Unhon ne mere donon sahaba ko waisa hi bheja unhon ne kaha: Hilal bin Umayyah ki biwi aai aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Hilal zaya aadmi hain baghair khadim; Kya tum napasand karoge ke main un ki paas karun? Aap ne farmaya: Nahin, lekin woh tumhare qareeb na aaye us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Allah ki qasam, jab se jo hua hua, us mein se kisi ki taraf un ki koi tez nahin hui; woh sirf samne hain mere gharwalon mein se ek ne mujh se kaha: tum apni biwi ke bare mein Rasulullah se ijazat kyun nahin mangte, jabke Unhon ne Hilal ki biwi ko ijazat di hai? Main ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, main aisa nahin karunga, kyunke main jawan hun aur nahin janta Rasulullah Kya kahenge. unhon ne kaha: Jabke main aisa tha, pacaasaviin raat ki subah jab se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ham se baat karne se mana farmaya tha, Main ne hamare ghar ki chhat par Fajr ki namaz padhi, phir us haalat mein baitha jise Allah ne bayan kiya: Zameen un ke liye apni kushaada ke baavajuuda tang hui, aur un ki jaanein un ke liye tang huin, aur Unhon ne samjha ke Allah se koi panah nahin siwae usi ki taraf phir Main ne munadi ki awaz suni jo salaa par chadha tha, aur ek aadmi ghode par meri taraf sarapata aaya, aur awaz mere liye ghode se tez thi: Khushkhabri, Aey Ka'b bin Malik! Main sajde mein gira aur jana ke Faraj aaya hai jis ki awaz Main ne suni thi woh mere paas aaya, to Main ne donon kapde utare jo main pahne tha — Allah ki qasam mere paas un ke siwa kuch na tha — aur unhen use khushkhabri ke taur par pahnaya, phir do kapde qarz liye aur pahne, phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki taraf rawana Ka'b ne kaha: Umm-Salamah, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki biwi — jo mere mamle mein meharabaana thin — ne mujhe khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) us raat un ke sath the, aur jab raat ka tihai bacha to hamari Tauba un par nazil hui, aur Aap ne un se kaha: Aey Umm-Salamah, Ka'b bin Malik aur un ke donon sahaba ko muaf kiya gaya us ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya main use na dun aur use khushkhabri dun? Aap ne farmaya: To log tumhen gherenge aur baqi raat tumhen neend se mahrum karenge Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Fajr ki namaz ke baad hamari taraf Allah ke ruju' ka elan kiya unhon ne kaha: Munadi mere donon sahaba ki taraf gae, aur munadi meri taraf gaye Ka'b ne kaha: To main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki taraf nikla, Muhajireen-Ansar un ke gird; un ka chehra raushan hua jaise woh chand ka tukda ho — aur jab woh kisi cheez se khush hote to un ka chehra raushan hota Talha bin ubaidillaaha, Raziyallahu anhu mere liye khade hue, jaldi karte hue yahan tak ke Unhon ne mujhe mubarak di aur mujh se musafaha kiya; Allah ki qasam Muhajireen mein se un ke siwa koi khada na hua, aur Ka'b Ise Talha ke liye kabhi na bhuulate. unhon ne kaha: Musalman meri taraf Allah ke ruju' par mujhe mubarak dene lage, kehte hue: Allah ka tumhari taraf ruju' tumhen mubarak, Allah ka tumhari taraf ruju' tumhen mubarak, yahan tak ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas pahunchi jab Aap ne mujhe dekha to farmaya: Aao, Aey Ka'b, aur behtareen din ki khushkhabri lo jo tum par aaya hai jab se tumhari walidah ne tumhen janam main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya woh tum hai ya Allah se? Aap ne farmaya: Lekin, Allah se main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, meri Tauba mein se hai ke main apna sara maal Allah aur us ke Rasulullah ke liye sadqe ke taur par alag karun Aap ne farmaya: Aey Ka'b, apna kuch maal rakho, kyunke woh tumhare liye behtar hai main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main apna hissa basaunga jo Khaibar mein hai aur main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Allah, Aziz Wajleel ne mujhe sirf sach se nijaat di, aur meri Tauba mein se hai ke jab tak zinda rahun sach ke siwa na boluun. Ka'b ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, main kisi ko nahin janta jise Allah ne baat ki sach mein aazmaya jaisa Us ne mujhe aazmaya; Allah ki qasam, Main ne jab se woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kaha aaj ke din tak jaan jhoot nahin kaha, aur main ummeed rakhta hun Allah baqi mein meri hifazat karega unhon ne kaha: Phir Allah, Aziz Wajleel ne nazil kiya: Allah Nabi aur Muhajireen-Ansar par ruju' hua — donon aayaat sath"
"1037","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad Ibn Abi Humaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Humaidah bint Abi Ubaidah al-Ansariyah se, un ki walida se, Ka'b bin Malik al-Ansari se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mimbar par farmaya: Main nikla tumhen Lailatul-Qadr ki khabar dene ka irada karte hue lekin mujhe bhulaayaa gaya, to use aakhri das raaton mein, taaq raaton mein talash karo"
"1038","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibn al-Mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, Yunus bin Yazid ne hamein khabar di, az-Zuhri se, bin Ka'b bin Malik se, un ke walid se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Jumairat ko safar karte the"
"1039","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Ayyub bin Utbah ne ham se bayan kiya, Iyas bin Salamah bin al-Akwa se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo ham par talwar kheenche woh ham mein se nahin"
"1040","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Ya'la bin al-Haris ne ham se bayan kiya, Iyas bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamen Jume ki namaz padhate the, aur ham nikalte deewaron mein koi saya na hote jis mein saya len"
"1041","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah Ibn al-Mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, Ikrimah bin Ammar se, Iyas bin Salamah se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Abu Bakr, Raziyallahu anhu ke sath Hawazin ke par muhim par gaye main logon se aage pahaad par pahunchi aur logon ke giroh ko diya, aur Fazarah ki ek aurat ko pakda jis ki beti Arabon mein sab phir mein se thi, to Abu Bakr ne mujhe Fazari aurat ki beti zyada hisse ke taur par di jab ham pahunche to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se kaha: Aey Salamah, mujhe aurat do, tumhara baap Allah par qurban! Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Main ne use khola nahin! Aap ne kaha: Use mujhe do, tumhara baap Allah par qurban! Main ne kaha: Woh tumhari hai, Aey Allah ke farmaya unhon ne kaha: To Aap ne use Makkah walon ke paas bheja aur us ke badle qaidi chhudaya jo un ke hathon mein tha"
"1042","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Umar bin Rashid ne ham se bayan kiya, Iyas bin Salamah se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ghifar — Allah unhen muaf kare — aur Aslam — Allah, Aziz Wajleel unhen salamti de"
"1043","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Ayyub bin Utbah ne ham se bayan kiya, Iyas bin Salamah se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hamare paidal mein behtareen Salamah hain, aur hamare sawaron mein behtareen Abu Qatadah hain"
"1044","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Zam'ah bin Salih ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Sahl bin Sa'd as-Sa'idi se, ke ek aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke kamre mein jhaanka jabke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas lohe ki kanghi thi jis se woh apna sar khujaa rahe the, to Aap ne farmaya: Agar mujhe ma'loom hota ke tum dekh rahe ho to main khada hota taake use tumhari aankhon mein ghonpuun; ijazat sirf nazar ki wajah se muqarrar ki gayi"
"1045","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Kharijah bin Mus'ab ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Hazim al-Madani se, Sahl bin Sa'd se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Jume ko khush hote the, aur woh liye ke ham budhi aurat ke paas jate the jo hamare liye cukandara aur jau tayyar karti thin, aur ham use khate the phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein lautte the"
"1046","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Adi bin al-Fazl ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Hazim se, Sahl bin Sa'd se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke peeche namaz padhne walon mein aksar gaanthon wale the unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Gaanthon wale Kya hain? Unhon ne kaha: Mein se kisi ke paas ek hi kapde ke siwa na hota tha, jise woh apni gardan par bandhta tha"
"1047","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Zam'ah bin Salih ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Hazim se, Sahl bin Sa'd se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) wafat pae ooni chadar julaha ke paas chhore hue"
"1048","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Amir bin Sa'd se, Jarir bin Abdullah se, Mu'awiyah Ibn Abi Sufyan se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tirsath mein wafat pae, aur Abu Bakr, Raziyallahu anhu tirsath mein, aur Umar, Raziyallahu anhu tirsath mein"
"1049","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'd bin Ibrahim bin Abdur Rahman bin Auf se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ma'bad al-Juhani ko kehte suna: Mu'awiyah Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kam hi bayan karte the, lekin jumon ko un ki kuch baat hoti thi jo woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte the unhon ne kaha: Jis ke liye Allah bhalai chahe, use deen mein samajh deta hai; aur yeh maal meetha aur hara hai — jo use haq se le us ke liye us mein barkat di jati hai aur bahut zyada se tareef se bacho, kyunke se tareef zabah hai"
"1050","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Muhammad bin Aqeel se, Muhammad Ibn al-Hanafiyyah se, Mu'awiyah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Umar bhar ki atiya us ke walon ke liye jaiz hai"
"1051","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, al-Hakam bin Mina se, bin Jariyah se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Mu'awiyah ke darwaze par the, aur woh hamare paas nikle aur kaha: Tum Kya guftagu kar rahe the? Ham ne kaha: Ham Ansar aur un ki khabaron par guftagu kar rahe the Mu'awiyah ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo Ansar se muhabbat kare, Allah us se muhabbat karta hai, aur jo Ansar se nafrat kare, Allah us se nafrat karta hai"
"1052","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu at-Tayyah ne mujhe khabar di, Ma'bad al-Juhani se, unhon ne kaha: Mu'awiyah ne hamen khutba diya aur kaha: Un logon ko Kya jo namaz padhte hain — main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath raha aur unhen kabhi use padhte na dekha, aur Ham ne unhen us se mana karte suna — ya'ni Asr ke baad do rakaaten."
"1053","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Ishaq bin Yahya bin Talha ne ham se bayan kiya, Isa bin Talha se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Mu'awiyah ko kehte suna: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Talha mein se hain jinhon apni Nazr poori ki"
"1054","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, Muhammad bin Ibrahim at-Taimi se, Isa bin Talha se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Mu'awiyah ke sath the jab munadi ne namaz ke liye pukara, aur Unhon ne waisa kaha jaisa unhon ne kaha, phir kaha: Is tarah Main ne tumhare Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko suna"
"1055","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Hammad bin Salamah aur Yazid bin zuraia ne ham se bayan kiya, Habib bin ash-shaheed se, Abu Mijlaz se, unhon ne kaha: Mu'awiyah nikle, aur bin Amir un ke liye khade hue jabke bin az-Zubair baithe rahe, aur woh donon mein zyada muatadila the Mu'awiyah ne bin Amir se kaha: Baitho, kyunke Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo pasand kare ke aadmi us ke liye khade hon, woh aag mein apni jagah le"
"1056","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Mutarrif se, Mu'awiyah se, unhon ne kaha: Lailatul-Qadr Sattaiswin raat hai is tarah Abu Dawud ne kaha, aur mujhe pahunchi hai ke Mu'az bin Mu'az ne Ise marfu' kiya"
"1057","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Abu shaikh al-hunaaii se, ke Mu'awiyah ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba ke giroh se kaha: Kya tum jante ho ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ciite ki khaal ke ziinaposha se mana farmaya? Unhon ne kaha: Aey Allah, Han unhon ne kaha: Aur main gawahi deta hun unhon ne kaha: Kya tum jante ho ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Sona pahanne se mana farmaya siwae chhote phir mein? Unhon ne kaha: Aey Allah, Han unhon ne kaha: Kya tum jante ho ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Hajj-umrah jama karne se mana farmaya? Unhon ne kaha: Aey Allah, nahin unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, woh Beshak mein hai"
"1058","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Murrah se: Main ne Sa'id bin al-Musayyab ko kehte suna: Mu'awiyah Madinah aae aur hamen khutba diya, aur Unhon ne balon ki genda nikali aur kaha: Main na samajhta tha ke yeh Yahud ke siwa koi karta hai; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use jhoot kaha"
"1059","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Sa'id se, unhon ne kaha: Mu'awiyah ne hamen khutba diya aur kaha: Tum ne bura singaara ijaad kiya hai; Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne jhoot se mana farmaya Qatadah ne kaha: Woh hai jo aurten apne siron par citharon se lagati hain"
"1060","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Yazid bin tahamaana ar-Raqashi ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Sireen ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mu'awiyah ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Resham-oon ke kapde na pahno na ciite ki khaalen. Muhammad ne kaha: Jab Mu'awiyah Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se is ke jaisa bayan karte to un par shak na kiya jata aur Abu Dawud ne doosri martaba kaha: Jab Mu'awiyah Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bayan karte to un par shak na kiya jata"
"1061","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jarad ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Raja bin Haiwa ko Mu'awiyah se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ke liye Allah bhalai chahe, use deen mein samajh deta hai"
"1062","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah Ibn al-Mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, Musa bin ulaiya se, un ke walid se, Amr bin al-Aas se, unhon ne kaha: Madinah mein ghabrahat hui, aur log idhar-udhar jane lage, to main masjid mein dakhil hua aur wahan Salim the, Abu Huzaifah ke aazad-karda, mimbar par apni talwar ki petiyon mein baith baithe — Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka minbara. unhon ne kaha: To main Salim ke sath baitha, aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aae aur mimbar par chadhe aur farmaya: Aey logo, Kya tumhari panah Allah aur us ke Rasulullah ki taraf na thi? Kya tum aisa na karoge jaisa in do mu'min aadmiyon ne kiya?"
"1063","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah Ibn al-Mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, Musa bin ulaiya se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Amr bin al-Aas ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mere paas bheja: Apne hathyar pahno aur mere paas Donon to Main ne aisa kiya, aur un ke paas dakhil hua, aur Aap ne apni nazar meri taraf musafir ki aur uthai, aur mujh se kaha: Aey Amr, main tumhen muhim par bhejane ka irada karta hun, jis se Allah tumhen maal-ghanimat dega, aur main tumhare liye maal ka faraakha hissa baantuungaa. main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Allah ki qasam, Main ne maal ke liye Islam qabool nahin kiya! Aap ne farmaya: Aey Amr, nek aadmi ke liye nek maal Beshak umdah hai"
"1064","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Qurrah bin Khalid ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Sireen ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin al-Aas ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, logon mein tumhen sab mahboob kaun hai? Aap ne farmaya: Aaishaa. unhon ne kaha: Mera matlab mardon mein hai Aap ne farmaya: Un ke vaalida. unhon ne kaha: Aur yeh hadees Khalid se, Abu Usman se, Amr bin al-Aas se riwayat ki jati hai"
"1065","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin dinar se, Misr walon mein se ek aadmi se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Amr bin al-Aas ko dekha jab Muhammad Ibn Abi Bakr un ke paas jane gae — aur woh Misr par malik the — bandhe hue, aur Amr ne un se kaha: Kya tumhare paas amaana hai? Kya kisi ne tumhen amaana di? Unhon ne zikr na kiya ke un ke paas koi amaana hai Amr ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Musalmanon mein sab adna un ki taraf se amaana deta hai unhon ne kaha: To un ki gardan lagai gayi"
"1066","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Aswad bin Shaiban ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Naufal Ibn Abi akraba ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin al-Aas maut ke waqt sakht bechain mein the, to un ke bete Abdullah ne un se kaha: yeh bechain Kya hai, jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tumhen kaam par lagate the aur qareeb karte the? Unhon ne kaha: Aey mere bete, main tumhen us ke bare mein bataun unhon ne kaha: Woh aisa karte the, lekin Allah ki qasam main nahin janta Kya woh muhabbat se tha ya mujhe manaane se lekin main do aadmiyon ke bare mein gawahi deta hun jinhein Unhon ne duniya chhodi un se muhabbat karte hue: bin Umm-Abd aur bin sumayyaa."
"1067","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hakam se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Zakwan ko Amr bin al-Aas ke aazad-karda se riwayat karte suna ke Unhon ne unhen Ali ke paas Asma bint Umais ke bare mein ijazat mangne bheja, aur Unhon ne unhen ijazat di jab woh apni hajat se farigh hue to aazad-karda ne Amr se us ke bare mein poocha, aur unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen mana farmaya — ya Unhon ne mana farmaya — aurton ke paas un ke shauharon ki ijazat ke baghair dakhil hone se"
"1068","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Mughirah se, Ibrahim se, jinhon Alqamah ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Main Sham aaya aur masjid mein dakhil hua aur kaha: Aey Allah, mujhe nek sathi de jis ke sath baithuun. unhon ne kaha: To main aadmi ke sath baitha, aur woh Abu Woh-Darda the Unhon ne mujh se kaha: tum kahan se ho? Main ne kaha: Kufa walon mein se unhon ne kaha: Kya tum takiye-sivaaka wale sathi nahin? — Ya'ni bin masauuda. phir unhon ne kaha: Kya tum raaz ke rakhavaale nahin jise un ke siwa koi na janta tha? — Ya'ni huzaifaa. phir unhon ne kaha: Kya tum woh nahin jise Allah ne apne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki zaban par shaitan se mahfooz rakha? — Ya'ni ammaara. phir unhon ne kaha: Kya tum jante ho Abdullah kaise padhte the raat ki qasam jab ghalib — aur narr-ki? Main ne kaha: Woh padhte the raat ki qasam jab ghalib, din ki jab zahir ho Abu Woh-Darda ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, yeh mujh par lage rahe yahan tak ke taqariibana mujhe shak mein diya Abu Woh-Darda ne kaha: Is tarah ham padhte hain, aur is tarah Main ne use Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se padhte suna"
"1069","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Salim Ibn Abi al-Ja'd ko maadaana Ibn Abi Talha se, Abu Woh-Darda se riwayat karte suna, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum mein se koi raat mein Quran ka tihai padhne se aajiz hai? Kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, us ki taqat kaun rakhta hai? Aap ne farmaya: Padho kaho: Woh Allah, ek hai"
"1070","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: bin Sa'd ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Adi bin artaata ke bhatije se, ek aadmi se, Abu Woh-Darda se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhare liye mujhe sab zyada dar gumrah Khamsa ka hai"
"1071","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Salih ko Ata bin Yasar se, ek aadmi se, Abu Woh-Darda se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se us ke qaul jo iman jane aur darte rahe — un ke liye duniya ki zindagi mein khushakhabariyaan hain ke bare mein poocha Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh nek khwab hai jise Musalman dekhe ya jo us ke liye dekha jae"
"1072","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Yazid bin Khumair se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdur Rahman bin Jubair ko apne walid se, Abu Woh-Darda se riwayat karte suna, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khaime ke darwaze par zahir hamla aurat dekhi — ya unhon ne kaha: Chhote khaime — aur farmaya: Shayad is ka Malik us ke qareeb jata hai! Main ne use aisi lanat se lanat karne ka irada kiya jo us ke sath qabr mein dakhil ho woh use kaise wasiyat kar sakta hai jabke woh us ke liye halal nahin? Aur woh use kaise ghulam bana sakta hai jabke woh us ke liye halal nahin?"
"1073","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Qasim Ibn Abi Bazzah ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ata ko Umm-Darda se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya — ya Umm-Darda se, Abu Woh-Darda se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qayamat ke din meezan mein husn akhlaq se bhaari kuch nahin rakha jata"
"1074","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, khulaida al-asarii se, Abu Woh-Darda se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi suraj kabhi nahin nikla magar Allah, Aziz Wajleel us ke donon pehluon par do farishte bhejta hai pukarta hue, donon saqalaina ke siwa tamam makhlooq ko sunate hue: Aey Allah, kharch karne wale ke liye jald badal de, aur rokne wale ko nuqsan de aur koi suraj kabhi nahin dooba magar Allah, Aziz Wajleel us ke donon pehluon par do farishte bhejta hai pukarta hue, donon saqalaina ke siwa makhlooq ko sunate hue: Thoda jo kafi ho zyada se behtar hai jo ghafil kare"
"1075","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Abu Habibah at-Taayi se, Abu Woh-Darda se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Us ki misaal jo maut ke waqt Sadqa de ya ghulam aazad kare us ki tarah hai jo sera hone ke baad hadiya de"
"1076","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ata bin as-Sa'ib se, Abu Abdur Rahman as-Sulami se, Abu Woh-Darda se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Baap jannat ka darmiyan wala darwaza hai, to agar tum chaho to darwaze ki hifazat karo ya use zaya karo"
"1077","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdul-Aziz bin rufaia se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Zakwan Abu Salih ko kehte suna: Jab mehmaan Abu Woh-Darda ke paas utarta to woh kehte: Kya tum thehar rahe ho taake ham tumhari jinhon karen, ya ja rahe ho taake ham tumhen Tosha den? Agar woh kehta: Ja raha hun, to woh kehte: Main tumhen woh jayega jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne bataya main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, maal walon ne duniya-aakhirat le li; woh namaz padhte hain jaise ham padhte hain, maal karte hain jaise ham karte hain, zikr karte hain jaise ham karte hain, aur Sadqa dete hain jabke hamare paas dene ko kuch nahin! Aap ne mujh se kaha: Kya main tumhen aisi cheez na bataun jise agar tum karo to baad mein aane wala koi tumhen na paega, aur tum un se aage hoge jo tum pahle the? Tum har namaz ke baad Allah ki takabbur chauntis martaba bayan karo, us ki tasbih tentis martaba karo, aur us ki tareef tentis martaba karo; agar tum aisa karo to tum un se aage hoge jo tum pahle the, aur tumhare baad aane wala koi tumhen na paega siwae us ke jo waisa kahe jaisa Tum ne kaha"
"1078","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Yazid Ibn Abi Habib se, ke do aadmiyon ne Abu Woh-Darda ke samne balisht bhar zameen par jhagda kiya, to Abu Woh-Darda ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Agar tum zameen mein ho aur do aadmiyon ko balisht bhar zameen par jhagde suno to use chhod do to Abu Woh-Darda chale gae aur Sham gaye"
"1079","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Faraj bin Fuzalah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Khalid bin Yazid ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Halbas se, Umm-Darda se, Abu Woh-Darda se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, jinhon farmaya: Allah, Aziz Wajleel ne apni makhlooq ke liye paanch cheezen poori ki: Us ki umar, us ka amal, us ka nishan, us ki aaramgah, aur us ka rizqa."
"1080","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Salim Ibn Abi al-Ja'd se, maadaana Ibn Abi Talha se, Sauban se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo janaze par namaz padhe use qeerat hai, aur jo us ke sath rahe yahan tak ke us ka itmaama muqaddar ho use do qeerat hain"
"1081","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Murrah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Salim Ibn Abi al-Ja'd ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Sauban se kaha gaya, jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke aazad-karda the: Hamen bayan karo unhon ne kaha: Tum ne mujh par jhoot kaha aur mujh se woh kaha jo Main ne nahin kaha unhon ne kaha: Hamen bayan karo to unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Koi banda nahin jo Allah ko sajdah kare sajdah magar Allah, Aziz Wajleel use us se darja karta hai ya us se gunah hataataa hai"
"1082","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Abu Qilabah se, unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne Abu Asma ar-rahabii ka zikr kiya aur Sauban ka zikr kiya, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Behtareen dinar woh dinar hain jo aadmi apne Ahl par kharch kare, dinar jo woh Allah ke raste mein apni sawari par kharch kare, aur dinar jo woh Allah ke raste mein apne sahaba par kharch kare"
"1083","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Sabit Abu Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Asim se, Abu Qilabah se, Abu Asma se, Sauban se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beemar ki iyadat karne wala jannat ki fasala mein hai yahan tak ke woh aur"
"1084","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya ke Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer ne unhen bayan kiya ke Abu Qilabah ne unhen bayan kiya ke Abu Asma ne unhen bayan kiya ke Sauban ne unhen bayan kiya ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hijaamaa karne wale aur karane wale ne roza toraa."
"1085","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, Abu Sallam se, Abu Asma se, Sauban se, unhon ne kaha: Hubairah ki beti Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aai apne hath mein bade sone ki anguthi liye — bade anguuthiyaan — aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) us ka hath marne lage woh Fatimah ke paas unhen shikayat karti gayi Sauban ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Fatimah ke paas dakhil hue main un ke sath, aur Unhon ne apni gardan se sone ka haar utara tha, aur kaha: Yeh mujhe Abu Hasan ne tohfe mein diya tha — haar hath mein liye hue Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Fatimah, Kya tumhen khush karega ke log kahen: Fatimah bint Muhammad apne hath mein aag ki taar liye? Woh nikle aur baithe nahin Fatimah haar ke paas gayin aur use becha, us ki qeemat se ghulam khareeda aur aazad kiya woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas pahunchi, aur Aap ne farmaya: Alhamdulillah Jis ne Fatimah ko mere sath aag se nijaat di"
"1086","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Abu Qilabah se, Abu Asma se, Sauban se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Qayamat na pahunchegi yahan tak ke meri ummat ke qabeela mushrikon se milte aur but puujen, aur jab meri ummat par talwar rakhi jae to woh un se qayamat ke din tak na uthegii."
"1087","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu al-ashahaba ne ham se bayan kiya, Umar bin Ubaid at-Tamimi al-abshamii se, Sauban se, jo Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke aazad-karda the, unhon ne kaha: Qaum tumhare par ek-doosre ko bulane wali hain jaise log apne pyale par ek-doosre ko bulaye hain unhon ne kaha: Kaha gaya: Qillata ki wajah se? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin, lekin tum sailab ke jhag jaise jhag hoge; tumhare dilon mein za'f dali jaegi, aur tumhara dar tumhare dushman ke dilon se nikali jaega, tumhari duniya ki muhabbat aur maut ki nafrat ki wajah se Yunus ne kaha: Yeh hadees bin Fuzalah se, marazuuqa Abu Abdullah se, Abu Asma se, Sauban se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bhi riwayat ki gayi"
"1088","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu al-Judi se, Abu Balj se, Abu Shaibah al-Mahri se, Sauban se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko qai karte aur roza todte dekha"
"1089","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Qais ne mujhe bayan kiya, Abdur Rahman bin Yazid bin Mu'awiyah se, Sauban se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe ek cheez ki zamanat kaun dega, ke main qabool karun — ya main jannat ki zamanat dun? Sauban ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Main, Aey Allah ke farmaya Aap ne farmaya: Kisi se kuch na mango unhon ne kaha: Sauban kabhi apna koraa giraate aur nafs utarakara use uthate"
"1090","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Utbah ne ham se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin al-Muhajir se, Abbas bin Salim al-lakhamii se, ke Umar bin Abdul-Aziz ne Abu Sallam al-Habshi ke paas bheja — daaka se jane gae yahan tak ke woh un ke paas aae — aur kaha: Main ne tumhen liye bheja taake tum Sauban ki hauz wali hadees baraaheraasta sunun Abu Sallam ne kaha: Main ne Sauban ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Mera hauz adana abyana se ammaana al-balaqaa tak phailaa hai; us ke pyale aasman ke taaron ki tadaad jaise hain; us ka pani shehed se meetha hai — ya unhon ne kaha: Doodh se safed — jo us mein se ghoont piye woh us ke baad kabhi pyasa na hoga sab pahle mere paas us par meri ummat ke ghareeb aayenge Umar khade hue aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, woh kaun hain? Aap ne farmaya: Woh purani balon wale, ghubar phaad kapdon wale hain, jo naazon pate aurton se nikah nahin karte aur jin ke liye darabaaron ke darwaze nahin khole jate unhon ne kaha: Umar bin Abdul-Aziz ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, Main ne naazon pate aurton se nikah kiya hai — Fatimah bint Abdul-Malik — aur mere liye darabaaron ke darwaze khole gae hain; jab tak Allah mujh par raham na kare, Beshak Allah ki qasam main apne sar mein tel na lagaunga yahan tak ke woh bikhar jae, na apne mukammal se laga kapda dhouungaa yahan tak ke woh mein ho"
"1091","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, Salim Ibn Abi al-Ja'd se, Sauban se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, jinhon farmaya: Seedhe raho, halanke tum kabhi gher nahin sakoge; jano ke tumhare deen mein behtareen namaz hai, aur wuzu ki hifazat mu'min ke siwa koi nahin karta yeh hadees al-Waleed bin Muslim se, Abdur Rahman bin Sabit se, Hassan bin Atiyyah se, Abu Kabshah se, Sauban se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se bhi riwayat ki jati hai"
"1092","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail bin Ayyash ne ham se bayan kiya, Ubaidullah bin Ubaid al-kalaaaii se, Zuhair bin Salim ya bin Yasar se, Abdur Rahman bin Jubair se, Sauban se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, jinhon farmaya: Har bhool ke liye salam ke baad do sajde hain yeh hadees Abdur Rahman bin Jubair bin Nufair se, un ke walid se, Sauban se bhi riwayat ki jati hai"
"1093","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Abu al-Malih se, Auf bin Malik al-Ashja'i se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath safar mein the, aur ham qailula ke liye ruke, ham mein se har ek apni sawari ka agli pair phailaye hue phir main aadhi raat mein raha aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki sawari ke samne koi na tha, to main nikla aur wahan Mu'az bin Jabal aur Abdullah bin Qais khade the Main ne un se kaha: Kya Tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha? Unhon ne kaha: Nahin, jabke Main ne chakki ke garagaraahata jaisi awaz suni phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare paas aae aur farmaya: Mere Rabb, Aziz Wajleel ki taraf se aane wala mere paas aaya aur mujhe meri aadhi ummat ko jannat mein dakhil karne aur shafa'at ke darmiyan ikhtiyar diya, to Main ne shafa'at cunii. ham ne kaha: Ham tumhen Allah aur sohbat ki qasam dete hain ke hamen apni shafa'at walon mein banao! Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum meri shafa'at walon mein ho aadmi aane lage kehte hue: Ya Rasulullah, mujhe apni shafa'at walon mein banao! Aur woh farmate: Tum meri shafa'at walon mein ho jab woh un par jama hue to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aey Allah, main tumhein gawah banata hun ke meri shafa'at meri ummat mein se us ke liye hai jo baghair Allah ke sath kuch Shareek kiye hue"
"1094","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Faraj bin Fuzalah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Bakr Ibn Abi Maryam se, Habib bin Ubaid se, Auf bin Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Ansar ke ek aadmi ke janaze par namaz padhte dekha, aur unhen farmate suna: Aey Allah, use barkat de, use muaf kar, us par raham kar, use afiyat de aur muaf kar, use pani, barf aur ole se dho, use gunahon-khaton se saaf kar jaise safed kapda mail se saaf kiya jata hai, us ke ghar ko us ke ghar se behtar ghar aur us ke gharwalon se behtar gharwalon se badal, aur use qabr ke fitne aur aag ke azab se bacha Auf ne kaha: Main ne apne ko us jagah dekha kaash main Ansari ki jagah hota, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki un ke liye dua sunne ki wajah se yeh hadees Habib bin Ubaid se, Jubair bin Nufair se, Auf se bhi riwayat ki jati hai aur Main ne yeh hadees Abu Dawud se doosri jagah dekhi, al-Faraj bin Fuzalah se, unhon ne kaha: Ismah bin Rashid ne mujhe bayan kiya, Habib bin Ubaid se, Auf se"
"1095","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn al-Mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, Musa bin Ayyub al-ghaafiqii se, un ke chacha Iyas bin Amir se, Uqbah bin Amir se, unhon ne kaha: Jab apne Parwardigar, azeem ke naam ki tasbih kar nazil hui to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use apne ruku mein rakho jab apne Parwardigar, buland ke naam ki tasbih kar nazil hui to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use apne sajdon mein rakho"
"1096","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn al-Mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, Musa bin ulaiya se, un ke walid se, Uqbah bin Amir se, unhon ne kaha: Teen ghadiyan Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamen mein namaz padhne ya apne murdon dafan karne se mana karte the: Jab suraj chamakti nikle yahan tak ke woh chadhe, jab dopehar ka thaharaava thehre yahan tak ke suraj dhal, aur jab woh doobne ki taraf jhuke yahan tak ke woh duube."
"1097","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, baajaa al-Juhani se, unhon ne kaha: Uqbah bin Amir al-Juhani ne hamen bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apne sahaba mein qurbani ke janwar baante, aur mere hisse mein bakri ka bachcha aaya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use zabah karo"
"1098","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jarir Woh-dabbii ne ham se bayan kiya, bayan aur Ismail se, Qais Ibn Abi Hazim se, Uqbah bin Amir se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujh par aayaat nazil hui hain, jise bade dekhi nahin gayin — ya'ni donon muavvizataina."
"1099","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Faraj bin Fuzalah ne ham se bayan kiya, ek aadmi se, Abu Ali se, Uqbah bin Amir se, ke woh safar mein the, aur woh chahte the ke woh unhen namaz parhaaen lekin Unhon ne inkar kiya aur kaha: Tum mein se ek aage ho, yahan tak ke main tumhen bataun ke main tumhen kyun nahin parhaataa! Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo qaum ki imamat kare aur un ke sath namaz poori kare us ke liye aur un ke liye ajr hai; agar woh aisa na kare to un ke liye itmaama hai aur us ke liye kam hai"
"1100","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn al-Mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibrahim bin naashita se, Ka'b bin Alqamah se, Abu al-Haisam se, unhon ne kaha: Uqbah bin Amir se kaha gaya: Hamare padosi hain jo sharab peete hain aur aisa-aisa karte hain Unhon ne un se kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo aib dekhe aur chhupae woh us ki tarah hai jo dafan saala ko us ki qabr se zinda kare"
"1101","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya se, Abu Sallam se, Abdullah bin Zaid al-Azraq se, Uqbah bin Amir al-Juhani se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Allah, Aziz Wajleel ek hi teer se teen ko jannat mein dakhil karta hai: Us ka banane wala jo apne hunara se bhalai chahe, use chalane wala, aur use dene chhae"
"1102","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Yahya Ibn Abi Kaseer se, Abu Sallam se, Abdullah bin Zaid al-Azraq se, Uqbah bin Amir se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Teer calaao aur sawari karo, aur tumhara teer calaanaa mujhe tumhari sawari se zyada mahboob hai har cheez jis se aadmi dil bahalaae batil hai siwae aadmi ke apni shikar se teer chalane, apne ghode ko sadhaane, ya apni biwi se khelane ke, kyunke yeh haq mein se hain jo andazi siikhane ke baad chhore Us ne jo seekha us ka kufr kiya"
"1103","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ziyad bin mikharaaqa se, Shahr bin Haushab se, Uqbah bin Amir se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne wuzu kiya aur masjid mein dakhil hua jabke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khutba de rahe the, aur Main ne unhen farmate suna: Jo achcha wuzu kare, phir farz namaz padhe, us ki hifazat karte aur use samajhte hue yahan tak ke use poora kare, woh us din jaisa hai jis din us ki walidah ne use janam"
"1104","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Qais al-Juzami se, Uqbah bin Amir se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo ghulam aazad kare, aag se us ka fidya a'za ke badle a'za hai"
"1105","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah Ibn al-Mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, Usamah bin Zaid se, Yazid Ibn Abi Habib se, us se Jis ne Uqbah bin Amir ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen khutba diya aur padha aur un ke uska mein jitni taqat ho sake tayyar karo, aur farmaya: Beshak taqat andazi hai; Beshak taqat andazi hai"
"1106","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn al-Mubarak ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id bin Yazid Abu shujaaa se, Khalid Ibn Abi Imran se, hanasha se, Fuzalah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas haar laya gaya jis mein sone se juraa moti tha, aur ek aadmi ne use saat — ya nau — deenar mein khareeda, aur us ka Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se zikr kiya, jinhon farmaya: Nahin, yahan tak ke woh us se alag kiya jae"
"1107","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Imran ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Abu al-Malih se, Wasilah bin al-Asqa se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe Taurat ki jagah saat tivaala di gayin, zabuura ki jagah miiina, Injeel ki jagah masaanii, aur mujhe Mufassal se nawaza gaya"
"1108","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Faraj bin Fuzalah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Sa'd ash-Shami ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Wasilah bin al-Asqa ko dekha — jin ki sohbat thi — damishqa ki masjid mein joote pahne namaz padhte; Unhon ne apne baayen paon ke neeche thuukaa phir use zameen par ragaraa. jab woh namaz padh chuke to main ne kaha: Kya tum yeh karte ho jabke tum Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sahaba mein ho! Unhon ne kaha: Is tarah Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko karte dekha"
"1109","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Abu Qilabah se, ke Abu Sa'labah al-Khushani ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main aisi zameen mein hun jis ke log Ahle-Kitab hain jo suar khate hain aur sharab peete hain, to un ke bartanon-haandiyon ka Kya? Aap ne farmaya: Unhen chhodo jab tak tumhen un ke siwa koi bachna mile; jab tumhen un ke siwa koi bachna na mile to unhen pani se khangaalo — ya unhon ne kaha: Dho — phir mein pakao aur khao unhon ne kaha: Aur main samajhta hun unhon ne kaha: Aur liya"
"1110","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Abu Qilabah se, ke Abu Sa'labah ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main apna kutta bhejta hun aur woh shikar pakarataa hai? Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum apna sadhaa kutta bhejo aur Allah ka naam lo aur woh pakde to khao; aur jab tum apna anasadhaa kutta bhejo aur woh pakde, agar tum us ke zabah ko pao to khao, aur agar tum us ke zabah ko na pao to na khao"
"1111","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Abu Qilabah se, Abu Sa'labah se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne har nukiile dant wale darinde aur paaltu gadhon ka gosht khane se mana farmaya — ya unhon ne kaha: Paalatuu. aur Hushaim is hadees ka hissa Khalid se, Abu Qilabah se, Abu Asma se, Abu Sa'labah se riwayat karte hain"
"1112","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak bin Harb se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Alqamah bin Wa'il al-Hazrami ko apne walid se riwayat karte suna ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen zameen jaagiira mein di — main Ise sirf is tarah janta hun: Hazramaut mein"
"1113","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak bin Harb se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Alqamah bin Wa'il al-Hazrami ko riwayat karte suna ke Suwaid bin Tariq ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, hamare paas angoor hain jinhein ham banate hain — aur Unhon ne sharab ka zikr kiya — aur Aap ne unhen mana farmaya unhon ne kaha: Woh dawa hai! Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Lekin, woh beemari hai Abu Bishr ne kaha: Meri is Kitab mein apne walid se nahin hai aur Abu Mas'ud ne kaha: Apne walid se"
"1114","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak bin Harb se, Alqamah bin Wa'il se, ke Salamah bin Yazid Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne khade hue jabke woh Asr ke baad khutba de rahe the aur kaha: Agar hamare upar tumhare baad hukamaraana hon jo ham se un ka haq mangne aur ham se roken? Woh khamosh rahe, phir Unhon ne sawal dohraya jaise woh gusse hue, aur khamosh rahe, to al-Ash'as ne unhen kheencha aur kaha: Allah ki qasam, main un se poochta rahunga yahan tak ke suraj ghurub ya woh mujhe jawab den! Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Un par woh hai jis ka unhen mukallafa kiya gaya, aur tum par woh hai jis ka tumhen mukallafa kiya gaya; unhen suno aur maano. Wahb ne yeh hadees Shu'bah se, Simak bin Harb se, Alqamah se, un ke walid se riwayat ki, ke Salamah bin yaziida."
"1115","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam bin Sulaim ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Asim bin Kulaib ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Wa'il al-Hazrami se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke peeche namaz padhi aur kaha: Main un ki namaz yaad karunga! Aap ne namaz khole, takbir kahi, aur apne hath uthae yahan tak ke woh un ke kaanon tak pahunche, aur apne baayen ko apne daayen se roka jab Aap ne ruku ka irada kiya to takbir kahi aur apne hath uthae jaise Aap ne unhen uthaya tha jab Aap ne namaz khole thi, aur jab ruku kiya to apni hatheliyon apne ghutnon par rakhiin. jab Aap ne ruku se apna sar uthaya to apne hath uthae jaise Aap ne unhen uthaya tha jab Aap ne namaz khole thi phir Aap ne sajdah kiya aur apna baen paon phailaayaa aur us par baithe unhon ne kaha: Phir Aap ne apni dayan hatheli apni dayan raan par aur apna baen hath apni baaeen raan par rakha, aur is tarah dua karne lage — ya'ni shahadat ki ungli se, us se ishara karte hue"
"1116","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Murrah ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu al-bakhatarii ko Abdur Rahman bin al-yahasabii se, Wa'il al-Hazrami se riwayat karte suna, ke Unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath namaz padhi: Woh jhukte aur uthte waqt takbir kehte, takbir par apne hath uthate, aur apne daayen-baayen salam pherte Shu'bah ne kaha: Aban bin Taghlib ne mujh se kaha: is hadees mein hai yahan tak ke un ke chehre ki safedi zahir ho to Main ne us ka Amr se zikr kiya: Kya hadees mein hai yahan tak ke un ke chehre ki safedi zahir ho? Amr ne kaha: Waisa hi kucha."
"1117","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdul-Jabbar bin Wa'il se, unhon ne kaha: Mere gharwalon mein se ek ne mujhe bayan kiya, mere walid se, ke Unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath namaz padhi, aur Unhon ne apne daayen-baayen salam phera"
"1118","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sallam ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Abdul-Jabbar bin Wa'il at-Taayi se, un ke walid se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namaz padh rahe the, aur ek aadmi dakhil hua aur kaha: Allahu Akbar Kabeera; Alhamdulillah kaseera; Subhanallah wa bihamdihi subah-shaama. jab woh namaz padh chuke to Aap ne farmaya: Yeh kalimaat Kis ne kahe? Aadmi ne kaha: Main ne, Ya Rasulullah, aur Main ne un se bhalai ke siwa kuch irada na kiya tha Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ne aasman ke darwaze khule dekhe, Arsh se neeche na rukte hue"
"1119","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Salamah bin Kuhail ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Hujr Abu al-Anbas ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Alqamah bin Wa'il ko Wa'il se riwayat karte suna — aur Main ne use Wa'il se suna tha — ke Unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath namaz padhi; jab Unhon ne ghairila-maghazuubi alaihima valazzaalliina padhi to unhon ne kaha: Amin, use aahista awaz se kehte hue, apna dayan hath apne baayen hath par rakha, aur apne daayen-baayen salam phera"
"1120","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdul-Malik bin Umair se, Alqamah bin Wa'il se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath the jab do jhagarane wale zameen par jhagde aae: Mein se ek imaraula-Qais bin aabisa al-Kindi aur doosra Rabi'ah bin aidaana. imaraula-Qais ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Is ne meri zameen hathiyaa li! Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhari daliila. unhon ne kaha: Mere paas koi istidlal nahin! Aap ne farmaya: Phir woh qasam khaaegaa. unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, to woh use le milayega! Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhare paas us ke siwa kuch nahin jab woh qasam khane khada hua to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar woh apni zameen lene ke liye jhooti qasam khayega to woh Allah se liye jabke woh us se ghadabnak hai"
"1121","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdul-Aziz bin rufaia se, Tameem bin Tarafah se, Adi bin Hatim se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne gawahi di aur kaha: Jo Allah aur us ke Rasulullah ki ita'at kare woh kamyab hua, aur jo un donon ki nafarmani kare woh gumrah hua Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khamosh raho; tum bure khateeb ho"
"1122","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdul-Aziz bin rufaia se, Tameem at-Taayi se, Adi bin Hatim se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo qasam khae aur us se behtar kuch dekhe to woh behtar kare aur use chhod"
"1123","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak bin Harb se, Tameem bin Tarafah se, ke ek aadmi ne Adi bin Hatim se do sau dirham mange, aur woh us ki kam par gusse hue aur na dene ki qasam karega phir unhon ne kaha: Agar Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate na suna hota: Jo qasam khae aur us se behtar kuch dekhe to woh behtar kare aur apni qasam ka kaffara de, to main tumhen kuch na deta; lekin woh meri Ata mein tumhara hai"
"1124","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Murrah ne mujhe khabar di, Unhon ne Abdullah bin Amr ko suna, jo al-Hasan bin Ali ke aazad-karda the, riwayat karte hue ke Adi bin Hatim se manga gaya aur Unhon ne na dene ki qasam khayi, phir diya unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jo qasam khae aur us se behtar kuch dekhe to woh behtar kare aur apni qasam ka kaffara de"
"1125","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi as-safar se, ash-Sha'bi se, Adi se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se miraaaza ke bare mein poocha aur Aap ne farmaya: Agar woh apni dhaar se maare aur qatl kare to khao; agar woh apne pahlu se maare aur qatl kare to woh kuutakara mara gaya hai, to na khao main ne kaha: Main apna kutta bhejta hun Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum apna kutta shikar par bhejo aur Allah ka naam lo aur woh pakde to khao; agar woh us mein se khae to na khao, kyunke Us ne sirf apne liye roka main ne kaha: Main apna kutta bhejta hun aur apne kutte ke sath kutta pata hun Jis ne pakda, aur main nahin janta mein se Kis ne use pakda! Aap ne farmaya: To na khao; Tum ne Allah ka naam sirf apne kutte par liya aur doosre par nahin liya"
"1126","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hakam se, ash-Sha'bi se, Adi se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main apna kutta shikar par bhejta hun — aur Unhon ne usi jaisa zikr kiya"
"1127","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waraqah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, Ibrahim se, Hammam bin al-Haris se, Adi bin Hatim se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main miraaaza se shikar marte hun Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum miraaaza se shikar maro aur woh chede to khao; agar woh na chede to na khao — ya unhon ne kaha: Agar woh apne pahlu se maare to na khao Abu Dawud ko shak tha"
"1128","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waraqah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, Ibrahim se, Hammam bin al-Haris se, Adi bin Hatim se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, hamare paas sadhe kutte hain jinhein ham shikar par bhejte hain aur woh hamare liye rokte hain Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar woh sadhe hon aur tumhare liye roken aur qatl karen to khao, jab tak koi doosra kutta un se na mile"
"1129","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne muraiya bin qatarii ko kehte suna: Main ne Adi bin Hatim ko riwayat karte suna ke Unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main shikar pakarataa hun lekin use zabah karne ko cakamaaqa-lakdi ke siwa kuch nahin pata! Aap ne farmaya: Jis se chaho khoon baha aur Allah ka naam lo"
"1130","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak bin Harb se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne muraiya bin qatarii ko Adi bin Hatim se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mere walid sila-rehmi karte the unhon ne kaha: Aur Unhon ne a'la akhlaq ka zikr kiya, phir farmaya: Tumhare walid ne muamla chaha aur use paya"
"1131","[AI-translation] Aur Adi se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, khana jise main paraheza ke siwa nahin chhodta Aap ne farmaya: To woh khana na chhodo jis mein tum iisaaiyata se mushaabehata karo"
"1132","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Murrah ne mujhe khabar di, Unhon ne Khaithamah ko suna, Unhon ne Adi bin Hatim ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne aag ka zikr kiya aur us se panah mangi aur apna chehra phera, phir aag ka zikr kiya aur us se panah mangi aur apna chehra phera, phir aag ka zikr kiya aur us se panah mangi aur apna chehra phera phir farmaya: Aag se daro chahe aadhi khajoor se; agar na pao to achchi baat se"
"1133","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Ishaq ko kehte suna: Sadqa do, kyunke Main ne Abdullah bin Ma'qil ko kehte suna: Main ne Adi bin Hatim ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Aag se daro chahe aadhi khajoor se; agar na pao to achchi baat se"
"1134","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdul-Malik bin Umair se, ek se zyada se jinhon unhen Adi bin Hatim se bayan kiya, ke Unhon ne unhen bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath tha jab dakaitii ka zikr hua, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum par sirf thoda waqt aayega yahan tak ke akeli musaafiraa Makkah-Madinah ke darmiyan safar karegi koi us ki Langoat na pakde; Allah ki qasam, tum par sirf thoda aayega yahan tak ke aadmi sone ki mutthi milayega aur tum mein se koi na paega jo us se use qabool kare aur tum mein se koi nahin magar woh Allah, Aziz Wajleel se liye us ke-us ke darmiyan koi tarjuman nahin; woh daayen-baayen dekhega aur aag ke siwa kuch na dekhegaa. tum mein se jo aag se apna chehra bacha sake chahe aadhi khajoor se, woh aisa kare"
"1135","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin khaazima ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, Khaithamah se, Adi bin Hatim se, unhon ne kaha: Tum mein se koi nahin magar woh qayamat ke din Allah, Aziz Wajleel se liye us ke-us ke darmiyan koi tarjuman nahin; woh apne daayen-baayen dekhega aur jo Us ne aage bheja us ke siwa kuch na dekhega, phir woh dekhega aur wahan aag hai; tum mein se har ek aag se dare chahe aadhi khajoor se Abu Dawud ne Ise marfu' nahin kiya, jabke al-A'mash ke sahaba ne yeh hadees marfu' ki: As-Sauri aur Abu Usamah, aur main samajhta hun Abu Mu'awiyah kiya"
"1136","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, muhilla bin khalifa se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Adi bin Hatim ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Aag se daro chahe aadhi khajoor se; agar na pao to achchi baat se"
"1137","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Amr bin Sabit ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak bin Harb se, us se Jis ne Adi bin Hatim ko kehte suna: Jab main Madinah aaya — aur mujhe pahunchi tha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe ummeed hai ke Allah us ka hath mere hath mein rakhega — unhon ne kaha: Woh mujhe apne thikane le gae, aur bandi ne hamare liye takiya bichaayaa — ya unhon ne kaha: Chataai — aur ham baithe Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum inkar karte ho ke kaha jata hai: La ilaha illallah? Kya Allah ke siwa koi ma'bood hai? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Nahin Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum inkar karte ho ke kaha jata hai: Allahu Akbar? Kya Allah se bade koi cheez hai? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Nahin Aap ne farmaya: Yahudi woh hain jin par gussa hua, aur Nasrani gumrah hain unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Main Musalman hun unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka chehra us ke liye raushan dekha, ya us ke liye camakaa."
"1138","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah aur Hushaim ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Bishr se, Sa'id bin Jubair se, Adi bin Hatim se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, main shikar marte hun aur use agle din pata hun mera teer us mein hai! Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum apna teer us mein pao aur jano ke Us ne use mara, aur us mein darinde ka koi nishan na dekho to khao"
"1139","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdul-Malik bin Maisarah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Sa'id bin Jubair ko Adi bin Hatim se riwayat karte suna ke Unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha — aur Unhon ne usi jaisa zikr kiya"
"1140","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Aun Ibn Abi Juhaifah se, un ke walid se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam): Un ke liye chhota neza rakha gaya aur Aap ne us ki taraf namaz padhi, gadha-aurat us ke arz guzarte hue"
"1141","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Aun Ibn Abi Juhaifah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne ghulam ladka khareeda jo hijaamaa karne wala tha, aur mere walid ne us ke hijaame ke auzaara liye aur tore. Main ne un se kaha: Kya tum unhen todte ho? Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khoon ki qeemat, kutte ki qeemat, faahishaa ki kamai, aur apne ki jima se mana farmaya"
"1142","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Hakam se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Juhaifah ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) dopehar ko — dopehar ko, dopehar ko — Batha ki taraf nikle, wuzu kiya, aur Zuhr do rak'aten aur Asr do rak'aten padhin, un ke samne chhota neza tha unhon ne kaha: Aun Ibn Abi Juhaifah ne us mein apne walid se badhaya: Aurat-gadha us ke arz guzarte the"
"1143","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Aun se, un ke walid se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne tasweer banane wale par lanat ki"
"1144","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Zuhair ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Abu Juhaifah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha, aur Main ne mein yeh safed dekha — nichle honth ke neeche uskhool ki taraf ishara karte hue unhon ne kaha: Un se kaha gaya: Us din tum kis jaise the, Aey Abu Juhaifah? Unhon ne kaha: Main teer tez karta aur par karta tha"
"1145","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Qais ne ham se bayan kiya, Ali bin al-aqamara se, Abu Juhaifah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main tek lagakar nahin khata"
"1146","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Talha ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Shareek al-aamirii se, Abdur Rahman bin Adi al-Kindi se, al-Ash'as bin Qais se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Logon mein Allah ke sab shukraguzaara woh hain jo mein logon ke sab shukraguzaara hain"
"1147","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Aqeel bin Talha as-Sulami se, Muslim bin Haisam se, al-Ash'as bin Qais se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, ham da'wa karte hain ke ham tum hain ya tum ham se ho — Abu Bishr ko shak tha — to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ham an-Nazr bin Kinanah ke bete hain; ham apne baap se bezaarii nahin karte na apni walidah par tohmat lagate hain unhon ne kaha: Al-Ash'as ne kaha: Main kisi ko nahin pata — ya: Mere paas koi nahin laya jata — jo Quraish ke Kinanah se nasab ka inkar kare magar main use hadd ke kode marte hun"
"1148","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Wa'il ko Abdullah se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Jo apne bhai ka maal katne ke liye jhooti qasam khae woh Allah se liye jabke woh us se ghadabnak hai al-Ash'as bin Qais hamare paas aae aur kaha: Abu Abdur Rahman ne tumhen Kya bayan kiya? Ham ne unhen khabar di, aur unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne sach kaha; mere bare mein yeh aayat nazil hui: Jo Allah ke ahd aur apni qasmon se thodi qeemat khareedte hain — aakhirat mein un ka koi hissa nahin — aayat ke aakhir tak Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne kuen par aadmi se jhagda kiya, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhari istidlal, ya us ki qasam main ne kaha: To woh gunahgar hote hue qasam khaaegaa."
"1149","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Waraqah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mansoor se, Abu Wa'il se, Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Jo gunahgar hote hue maal katne ke liye pakka qasam khae woh Allah, Aziz Wajleel se liye jabke woh us se ghadabnak hai unhon ne kaha: Al-Ash'as bin Qais al-Kindi hamare paas nikle aur kaha: Abu Abdur Rahman ne tumhen Kya bayan kiya? Ham ne kaha: Aisa-aisaa. unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne sach kaha; woh mere bare mein nazil hui Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne kuen par aadmi se jhagda kiya, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Tumhari istidlal, ya us ki qasam unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: To woh gunahgar hote hue qasam khaaegaa. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo gunahgar hote hue pakka qasam khae, taake us se maal kaate, woh Allah, Aziz Wajleel se liye jabke woh us se ghadabnak hai aur nazil hua: Jo Allah ke ahd aur apni qasmon se thodi qeemat khareedte hain aayat ke aakhir tak"
"1150","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ishaq ne hamein khabar di, Sa'id bin Wahb se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Khabbab ko kehte suna: Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se garmi ki ki ki shikayat ki, lekin Unhon ne hamari shikayat qabool na ki"
"1151","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ishaq ne hamein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Harisah bin muzarriba ko kehte suna: Ham Khabbab ke paas dakhil hue jab unhen lagaye gaya tha, aur unhon ne kaha: Main kisi ko nahin janta Jis ne aazmaish pa jo Main ne paya main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein raha dirham na pate hue, jabke mere ghar ke is ko mein chalis hazaar hain; agar Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen mana na farmaya hota — ya: Mana — ke koi maut ki tamanna kare, to main us ki tamanna karta"
"1152","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Woh-Duha ko Masrooq se, Khabbab se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Main Jahiliyat mein lohar tha, aur al-Aas bin Wa'il par mere dirham baqi the, to main us ke paas adayegi mangta aaya us ne kaha: Main tumhen ada nahin karunga yahan tak ke tum Muhammad ka inkar karo! Main ne kaha: Main Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka inkar nahin karunga yahan tak ke Allah tumhen maut de phir tumhen uthae us ne kaha: Mujhe chhodo yahan tak ke main chahun phir uthaya jaun, aur mere paas maal-aulaad hoga aur tumhen ada karunga! Unhon ne kaha: Phir yeh aayat nazil hui: Kya Tum ne use dekha Jis ne hamari aayaton ka inkar kiya aur kaha: Mujhe zaroor maal-aulaad diya jaega?"
"1153","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Waleed bin Saree se, Amr bin main se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke peeche namaz padhi, aur Aap ne jab suraj tilawat jae padha jab Aap is aayat aur raat jab woh jae, aur subah jab woh saans le pahunche to Main ne apne se kaha: Raat jab woh jae aur subah jab woh saans le Kya hai?"
"1154","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi as-safar aur Husain se, donon ne ash-Sha'bi ko kehte suna: Main ne Urwah Ibn Abi al-Ja'd al-Bariqi ko kehte suna: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Ghodon ki peshaaniyon mein qayamat ke din tak bhalai hui hai kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, bhalai Kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Ajr aur maal-ghaniimata."
"1155","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne al-aizaara bin main ko Urwah bin al-Ja'd al-Bariqi se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte suna, jinhon farmaya: Ghodon ki peshaaniyon mein qayamat ke din tak bhalai hui hai kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah, bhalai Kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Ajr aur maal-ghaniimata."
"1156","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Humaidah az-zaainii se, Urwah al-Bariqi se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ghodon ki peshaaniyon mein bhalai hui hai kaha gaya: Bhalai Kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Ajr aur ghaniimaten."
"1157","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jarir bin Hazim ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Az-Zubair bin khirrita al-Azdi ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nu'aim Ibn Abi Hind al-Ashja'i ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko ghode ki rukhsar sahalaate dekha gaya, aur Aap se us ke bare mein poocha gaya, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jibreel ne mujhe ghode ke bare mein malamat ki Abu Bishr ne kaha: Ahmad bin al-furaata ne hamein khabar di, Muslim bin Ibrahim se, Sa'id bin Zaid se, az-Zubair bin khirrita se, Nu'aim Ibn Abi Hind se, Urwah se"
"1158","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Hakam ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Abi Laila ko Ka'b bin Ujrah se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Musalsal azkaara mein un ka kehne wala — ya unhon ne kaha: Karne wala — nakam na hoga: Ke tum har namaz ke baad Allah ki takabbur chauntis martaba bayan karo, us ki tasbih tentis martaba karo, aur us ki tareef tentis martaba karo al-Hakam ne kaha: Main ne waqt se unhen nahin chhod aur Abu Amir ne yeh hadees Sufyan se, Mansoor se, al-Hakam se, Ibn Abi Laila se, Ka'b se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat ki"
"1159","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Hakam ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Abi Laila ko suna, unhon ne kaha: Ka'b bin Ujrah mujh se mile aur kaha: Kya main tumhen hadiya na dun? Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) nikle, aur ham ne kaha: Ham jante hain tumhen salam kaise karen, lekin tum par salat kaise bhejen? Aap ne farmaya: Kaho: Aey Allah, Muhammad aur Muhammad ke Aal par barkat de jaise Tu ne Ibrahim ke Aal par barkat di; Tu hamd wala, azeem hai Aey Allah, Muhammad aur Muhammad ke Aal par Fazl de jaise Tu ne Ibrahim ke Aal par Fazl diya; Tu hamd wala, azeem hai"
"1160","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abdur Rahman bin al-asbahaanii se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah bin Ma'qil ko kehte suna: Main is masjid mein Ka'b bin Ujrah ke sath baitha aur un se Allah, Aziz Wajleel ke qaul phir roze-sadqe-qurbani ka fidya ke bare mein poocha unhon ne kaha: Woh mere bare mein nazil hui; main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas laya gaya juunen mere chehre par bikharatii huin, aur Aap ne farmaya: Main ne na samjha tha ke mushakqata tumhen pahunchee hai jaisa main dekhta hun! Bakri zabah karo main ne kaha: Main ek nahin rakhta phir nazil hua: Phir roze ka fidya — teen din, ya chhe miskeenon ko aadha sa' khilana; woh mere bare mein khaas nazil hui, aur woh tumhare liye aam hai"
"1161","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'id al-Maqburi se, Bani Sulaim ke aazad-karda se, un ke walid se, Ka'b bin Ujrah se, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se ek wuzu kare phir namaz ke liye nikle to woh namaz mein hai, to tum mein se koi wuzu karne ya namaz mein dakhil hone ke baad apni ungliyan na guunthe."
"1162","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Sulaiman bin al-Mughirah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Musa al-Hilali ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Ka'b se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) masjid mein hamare paas aae aur farmaya: Yahan kaun hai? Kya tum sunte ho? Mere baad hukamaraana honge jo Allah ki ita'at ke baghair amal karenge, to jo un ke aamal mein Shareek ho aur un ke zulm mein un ki madad kare woh mujh se nahin aur main us se nahin, aur jo un ke aamal mein Shareek na ho aur un ke zulm mein un ki madad na kare woh mujh se hai aur main us se hun"
"1163","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hushaim aur Abu Awanah ne ham se bayan kiya, Abu Bishr se, Mujahid se, Abdur Rahman Ibn Abi Laila se, Ka'b bin Ujrah se, unhon ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Hudaibiyah ke waqt ehram mein the, aur mushrik hamare-Baitullah ke darmiyan aa gae the, aur mere ghane baal the, aur juunen mujh par girne mani, ya unhon ne kaha mere chehre par, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Kya tumhare keede tumhen takleef dete hain? Main ne kaha: Han Aap ne farmaya: Phir apna sar muundo, aur teen din roze rakho, ya chhe miskeenon ko khilao, ya qurbani do"
"1164","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, Sa'd bin Ishaq se, un ke chacha se, unhon ne kaha: Main Ka'b bin Ujrah ke sath Eid ke din nikla aur Unhon ne us se pahle namaz na padhi, aur jab ham namaz padh chuke to Unhon ne logon ko ek mukammal ki tarah masjid ki taraf jate dekha, to kaha: Yeh log Kya kar rahe hain? Main ne kaha: Woh masjid ja rahe hain unhon ne kaha: Yeh bidaata aur sunnat ka tarka hai"
"1165","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Al-Mas'udi ne ham se bayan kiya, furaata al-qazzaaza se, Abu at-Tufail se, Huzaifah bin Usaid al-Ghifari se, jo as-Suffah walon mein se the, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare paas nikle jabke ham qayamat par guftagu kar rahe the, aur farmaya: Qayamat na pahunchegi yahan tak ke das nishaniyan hon: Dhuwen, Dajjal, daabbaa, suraj ka apne Maghrib se nikalna, teen grahana, Mashriq mein grahana, Maghrib mein grahana, aur Jazirat-Arab mein grahana, Isa bin Maryam ka nuzuula, yaajuuja-maajuuja ka khulanaa, aur adana ki gaharaaiyon se aag nikalna jo logon ko hashragaaha haankegii."
"1166","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Al-Musanna bin Sa'id ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Abu at-Tufail se, Huzaifah bin Usaid se, ke Najashi ki maut ki khabar Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aai, to Aap ne farmaya: Tumhara bhai tumhare siwa zameen mein mara hai, to khade ho aur us par namaz padho to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen apne peeche safabanda kiya aur un par namaz padhi"
"1167","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, Talha bin Amr aur Jarir bin Hazim se; jahan tak Talha ka miskeen hai, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Ubaid bin Umair al-Laisi ne mujhe khabar di ke Abu at-Tufail ne unhen Huzaifah bin Usaid al-Ghifari Abu saraihaa se bayan kiya, aur jahan tak Jarir ka miskeen hai, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Umair se, Abdullah bin Mas'ud ke gharwalon mein se aadmi se, aur Talha ki hadees donon mein zyada kamil-behtar hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne daabbaa ka zikr kiya aur farmaya: Woh taariikha mein teen martaba niklega; woh door seharaa mein niklega aur us ka zikr Shahr mein dakhil na hoga, ya'ni Makkah, phir woh lamba waqt chipegaa, phir doosri martaba us se kam niklega, to us ka zikr seharaa walon mein phailegaa aur Shahr mein dakhil hoga, ya'ni makkaa. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Phir jabke log Allah ke han hurmat mein sab bade masjid mein hon, mein behtareen-asharafa, Masjid-haram, unhen kuch nahin daraaegaa siwae ke woh rukn-maqam ke darmiyan dahaarataa hoga, apne sar se ghubar jhaadta hua, to log us se grohon mein aur sath bikharenge, aur mu'minon ka giroh Sabit rahega, jante hue ke woh Allah se gunjaish nahin rakhte, to woh un se shuru karega aur un ke chehre raushan karega yahan tak ke woh camakate sitare jaise honge, aur woh zameen mein chaloge, koi Talib use na pakdega aur koi bhagne wala us se na bacegaa, yahan tak ke aadmi us se namaz mein panah lo, aur woh us ke paas peeche se aayega aur kehta: Aey falan, ab tum namaz padhte ho! Phir woh us ki taraf muregaa aur woh us ke chehre par nishan lagaaegaa, phir aage barhegaa, aur log maal mein Shareek honge aur shaharon mein ek-doosre ke sath rahenge, mu'min kafir se mumataaza, yahan tak ke mu'min kehta: Aey kafir, mujhe mera haq do! Aur kafir kehta: Aey mu'min, mujhe mera haq do!"
"1168","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Adi bin Sabit se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah bin Yazid al-Ansari ko kehte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne luutamaara aur chehre se mana farmaya"
"1169","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Qurrah bin Khalid ne ham se bayan kiya, Mu'awiyah bin Qurrah ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mujhe mohar dikhao! Aap ne farmaya: Apna hath dalo to Main ne apna hath un ke gireban mein dala aur mohar ko mehsoos kiya-dekha, aur woh un ke kandhe ke gude par ande jaisi thi, aur woh mujhe dua dene se na ruke jabke mera hath un ke gireban mein tha"
"1170","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Zuhair bin Mu'awiyah al-Ju'fi ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Urwah bin Abdullah al-Ju'fi ne ham se bayan kiya, Mu'awiyah bin Qurrah se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas pahunchi aur un ke kar khule the, aur tum Mu'awiyah aur un ke bete ko kabhi na dekhoge magar un ke kar khule hue"
"1171","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Raziyallahu bin Muslim ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Qatadah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mu'awiyah bin Qurrah se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein hamen namaz mein sutoonon ke darmiyan khade hone se zor se hataya jata tha"
"1172","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mu'awiyah bin Qurrah se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mahine ke teen din roze ka umar bhar ka roza hai, aur us ka iftar"
"1173","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mu'awiyah bin Qurrah se, un ke walid se, ke Ansari aadmi apne bete par Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aate the, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se ek din kaha: Aey falan, Kya tum us se muhabbat karte ho? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, Ya Rasulullah, Allah tum muhabbat kare jaise main us se muhabbat karta hun! Phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen khoyaa aur un ke bare mein poocha, aur unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, un ka beta mar gaya! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya woh razi na hoga, ya: Kya tum razi na hoge, ke tum qayamat ke din jannat ke kisi darwaze par na jao magar woh tumhare liye phailane jaldi aayega? Phir ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya woh us ke liye khaas hai ya ham sabake liye? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Lekin, tum sabake liye"
"1174","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Mu'awiyah bin Qurrah ne ham se bayan kiya, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Sham wale se to tum koi bhalai nahin; meri ummat ka giroh ghalib rahega, jo unhen karen woh unhen nuqsan na denge, yahan tak ke qayamat aaye"
"1175","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mu'awiyah bin Qurrah se, unhon ne kaha: Mere walid Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae dohne aur than bandhne ke baad"
"1176","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Mu'awiyah bin Qurrah se, ke bin Mas'ud Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye miswak dene gae, aur woh un ki pindli ki baariikii dekhne lage, ya un ki pindli ki baariikii par ta'ajjub karte hue, to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh meezan mein Uhud se bhaari hain is tarah Abu Dawud ne Ise riwayat kiya, jabke Abu Dawud ke siwa doosron ne kaha: Shu'bah se, Mu'awiyah bin Qurrah se, un ke walid se"
"1177","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hisham ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Mutarrif bin Abdullah bin ash-Shikhkhir se, Iyaz bin Himar al-mujaashiii se, ke Allah ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek din apne khutbe mein farmaya: Beshak mere Rabb ne mujhe hukm diya ke tumhen sikhaun jo tum nahin jante the us mein se jo Us ne mujhe aaj sikhaya: Har maal jo main apne bande ko dun halal hai, aur Main ne apne bandon ko sab seedha paida kiya, lekin shaitan un ke paas aae aur unhen un ke deen se phera aur un par woh haram kiya jo Main ne un ke liye halal kiya tha aur unhen hukm diya ke mere sath woh Shareek karen jis ki Main ne koi istidlal nahin bheji aur Allah ne zameen walon ko dekha aur un se nafrat ki, un ke Arab-ajama, siwae Ahle-Kitab ke bache logon ke, aur farmaya: Aey Muhammad, Main ne tumhen bheja hai taake tumhen aazamaauun aur tumhare sath doosron ko aazamaauun, aur Main ne tum par Kitab nazil ki jise pani nahin dho sakta, jise tum sote-jagte padhte ho aur Allah ne mujhe hukm diya ke Quraish ko ubhaaruun, to main ne kaha: Mere Rabb, to woh mera sar phaarenge aur use roti jaisa karenge! To Us ne farmaya: Unhen nikalo jaise Unhon ne tumhen nikali, un par chadhai karo tumhari madad ki jaegi, kharch karo tum par kharch kiya jaega, lashkar bhejo ham us ke jaise paanch bhejenge, aur un se lado jo tumhari manen un ke par jo tumhari na maanen. aur farmaya: Jannat wale teen hain: Adil, sakhi, hidaayatayaaftaa hakim, raheem aadmi jo har Musalman rishtedar par narm dil hai, aur daman ghareeb jo Sadqa deta hai aur jahannam wale paanch hain: Kamzor belagaama, tum mein se woh jo pairukar hain na ghar chahte na maal, khaayina jis ki kisi bhi cheez ki hirs, chahe chhoti, kabhi chipii nahin siwae ke woh us mein khayanat kare, aadmi jo kabhi subah-Sham nahin karta magar woh tumhare ghar-maal mein tumhen dhoka deta hai, aur Unhon ne bukhl ya jhoot ka zikr kiya, aur hota fahashago. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Phir Hammam ne hamen bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ham Qatadah ke sath the aur Ham ne is hadees ka zikr kiya, aur Yunus al-haddaadii, aur mein un se zyada haafiza koi na tha, ne kaha: Qatadah ne yeh hadees Mutarrif se nahin suni to Ham ne us ke liye un ki nuktaaciinii ki, aur unhon ne kaha: Un se poocho! Lekin ham un se darte the, phir dehati aaya, to Ham ne dehati se kaha: Qatadah se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke khutbe ke bare mein poocho, ya'ni Iyaz bin Himar ki hadees, Kya Tum ne use Mutarrif se suna? To dehati ne kaha: Aey Abu al-Khattab, mujhe Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke khutbe ke bare mein batao, ya'ni Iyaz ki hadees, Kya Tum ne use Mutarrif se suna? To woh gusse hue aur kaha: Mujhe teen ne un se bayan kiya; Yazid, bhai, bin Abdullah bin ash-Shikhkhir ne mujhe bayan kiya, aur al-ala bin Ziyad al-Adawi ne mujhe un se bayan kiya, aur Unhon ne teesre ka zikr kiya jise Hammam yaad na rakh sakein"
"1178","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Imran al-Qattan aur Hammam ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se; Hammam ne kaha: Yazid bin Abdullah bin ash-Shikhkhir se, jabke Imran ne kaha: Mutarrif bin Abdullah bin ash-Shikhkhir se, Iyaz bin Himar se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, meri qaum ka mujh se adna aadmi mujhe bura deta hai? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Do bura dene wale do shaitan hain ek-doosre par tohmat lagate-jhutlate hue, to jo woh kahen woh shuru karne wale par hai, yahan tak ke mazloom hadd se badhe"
"1179","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Main ne Khalid al-Hazza ko Yazid bin Abdullah bin ash-Shikhkhir se, Mutarrif bin Abdullah bin ash-Shikhkhir se, Iyaz bin Himar al-mujaashiii se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte suna, ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo gumshuda uthae woh adil gawah bulaye, ya adil gawah, aur na chhupae na ghaib kare; agar us ka Malik aae to woh us ka zyada haqdar hai, warna woh Allah ka maal hai jise woh jise chahe deta hai Abu Bishr ne kaha: Aur Main ne doosri jagah dekha, Abu Dawud se, Shu'bah se, Khalid se, Yazid se, Iyaz se, us mein Mutarrif ke baghair"
"1180","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Zaid ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu at-Tayyah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Al-Hasan ne ham se bayan kiya, Iyaz bin Himar se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko hadiya diya, ya unhon ne kaha untni, aur Aap ne mujh se kaha: Kya tum Musalman hue? Main ne kaha: Nahin to Aap ne use qabool karne se inkar kiya, aur farmaya: Ham mushrikon ke tohfe qabool nahin karte Main ne al-Hasan se kaha: Mushrikon ka hadiya Kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Un ki madada."
"1181","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Imran ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Yazid bin Abdullah se, Iyaz bin Himar se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko untni di, ya unhon ne kaha hadiya, aur Aap ne kaha: Kya tum Musalman hue? Main ne kaha: Nahin Aap ne kaha: Mujhe mushrikon ke tohafon se mana kiya gaya hai"
"1182","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Jarir bin Abdul-Hameed Woh-dabbii ne ham se bayan kiya, al-Mughirah se, un ke walid se, Shu'bah bin at-tauama se, Qais bin Asim se, ke Unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se Islam mein hilfa ke bare mein poocha, aur Aap ne kaha: Islam mein koi hilfa nahin, lekin Jahiliyat ke hilfa ko nibhaao."
"1183","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Mutarrif bin Abdullah bin ash-Shikhkhir ko Hakim bin Qais at-Tamimi se riwayat karte suna ke un ke walid ne apni maut par apne beton ko wasiyat ki, kehte hue: Jab main chahun to mujh par nauha na karna, kyunke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par nauha nahin kiya gaya"
"1184","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak bin Harb se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Qabeesah bin hulba ko apne walid se riwayat karte suna ke Unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna, aur Unhon ne sadqe ka zikr kiya, kehte hue: Tum mein se koi mimiya bakri lekar na aaye"
"1185","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Simak se, Qabeesah bin hulba se, un ke walid se, ke Unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath namaz padhi, aur woh donon taraf mudte hue jate the"
"1186","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ya'la bin Ata se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Waki bin udusa ko apne chacha Abu raziina al-Uqaili se riwayat karte suna ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mu'min ka khwab nubuwwat ke chalis hisson mein se ek hissa hai, aur woh parinde ke pair par lipta hai jab tak us ka zikr na kiya jae, lekin jab us ka zikr kiya jae to woh girataa hai unhon ne kaha: Aur main samajhta hun unhon ne kaha: Aur us ka zikr na karo siwae mahboob ya aqalmand se"
"1187","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ya'la bin Ata ne mujhe khabar di, kehte hue: Main ne Waki bin udusa ko Abu raziina al-Uqaili se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Allah murdon ko kaise zinda karta hai? Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum banjar wadi se nahin guzre phir us se sabz-bhari guzre? Unhon ne kaha: Han Aap ne farmaya: To isi hi uthna hai, ya unhon ne kaha: Is tarah Allah murdon ko zinda karta hai"
"1188","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ya'la bin Ata se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Waki bin udusa ko Abu raziina al-Uqaili se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, meri walida sila-rehmi karti thin aur aisa-aisa karti thin, lekin woh mushrik mariin! To woh kahan hain? Aap ne farmaya: Woh aag mein hain unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, to tumhari walida kahan hain? Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum razi na hoge ke tumhari walida meri walida ke sath hon"
"1189","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: An-Nu'man bin Salim ne mujhe khabar di, Amr bin Aws as-Saqafi se, Abu raziina al-Uqaili se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, mere walid bahut boodhe hain Hajj-umrah ya safar nahin kar rakhte! Aap ne farmaya: Apne walid ki taraf se Hajj karo, ya umrah"
"1190","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ya'la bin Ata se, Waki bin hudusa se, Abu raziina se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hamara Rabb apne bandon ki mayoos aur apne Faraj ki qurbat par hansta hai to main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya Rabb hansta hai, Tabaraka-wa Ta'ala?! To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Han phir unhon ne kaha: Ham chamakne wale Rabb se kabhi bhalai se mahrum na honge"
"1191","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ya'la bin Ata se, Waki bin hudusa se, Abu raziina se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko sawal poocha jana napasand tha, lekin jab Abu raziina ne un se poocha to woh unhen achcha wahan unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, aasman-zameen paida karne se pahle hamara Rabb kahan tha? Aap ne farmaya: Woh badal mein tha, jis ke upar koi hawa na thi aur jis ke neeche koi hawa na thi, phir Us ne pani par Arsh paida kiya"
"1192","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Hammad bin Salamah ne ham se bayan kiya, Ya'la bin Ata se, Waki bin hudusa se, Abu raziina se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, Kya ham sab qayamat ke din apne Rabb ko dekhenge? Aap ne farmaya: Han main ne kaha: Aur us ki makhlooq mein us ki nishani Kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum sab chand ko akela tanhai nahin dekhte? Main ne kaha: Han Aap ne farmaya: To Allah bada hai"
"1193","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ayyub bin Utbah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qais bin Talq se, un ke walid se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ek raat mein do witr nahin"
"1194","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ayyub bin Utbah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qais bin Talq se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, ham mein se ek namaz mein hai aur apni sharmgah chhuta hai, Kya woh wuzu dohrae? Aap ne farmaya: Nahin, woh sirf tumhara hissa hai"
"1195","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ayyub bin Utbah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qais bin Talq se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aurat ke liye apne shauhar se rokna halal nahin, chahe oont ki tayyar par ho"
"1196","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ayyub bin Utbah ne ham se bayan kiya, Qais bin Talq se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha gaya: Kya aadmi ek kapde mein namaz padhe? Woh khamosh rahe yahan tak ke namaz aai, phir Aap ne ek kapde mein namaz padhi us ke donon kinare milate hue"
"1197","[AI-translation] Yunus ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Shu'bah ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Habib bin Zaid al-Ansari ne mujhe bayan kiya, kehte hue: Main ne Abbad bin Tameem ko Abdullah bin Zaid se riwayat karte suna, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko wuzu karte aur apni bazoo lagate dekha"
"1198","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Abbad bin Tameem se, un ke chacha Abdullah bin Zaid se, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) baarish ke liye namaz padhne nikle, logon ki taraf peeth karke qible ki taraf munh karte hue, apni chadar ulti karte hue, aur logon ke sath do rak'aten buland awaz se padhte hue padhin"
"1199","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ibn Abi Zi'b ne ham se bayan kiya, az-Zuhri se, Abbad bin Tameem se, un ke chacha Abdullah bin Zaid se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko masjid mein tek lagae ek pair doosre par rakhe dekha"
"1200","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne ham se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Kharijah bin Mus'ab ne ham se bayan kiya, Amr bin Yahya al-Ansari se, un ke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Zaid ne ham se kaha: Kya main tumhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka wuzu karke na dikhaun? Ham ne kaha: Han to Unhon ne ek lapen se munh-naak teen martaba dhoya, phir apna chehra teen martaba dhoya, phir apni bazoo do-do martaba dhoe, phir apne hath aage-peeche le jate hue sar ka masah kiya, aur apne paon teen-teen martaba dhoya, phir kaha: Aisa tha Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka vuzuu."
